  ["A stack that also reports its smallest value in O(1). Push keeps a second stack of the smallest so far. Which i32 method picks the smaller of x and m?"] = "一个还能以 O(1) 报告最小值的栈。push 时维护第二个栈，存到目前为止的最小值。哪个 i32 方法在 x 和 m 中选较小的？",
