  ["A tick and the word for something that never moves."] = "一个单引号加一个表示永不移动的词。",
  ["A timeout is a deadline computed from now. It is inherited: a child can be stricter than its parent, never looser."] = "超时就是从现在算出来的截止时间。它会继承：子可以比父更严，绝不能更松。",
  ["A trait is a set of methods. impl Trait for Type promises them; dyn Trait picks at run time."] = "trait 是一组方法。impl Trait for Type 承诺实现它们；dyn Trait 在运行时挑选。",
  ["A tree node holds *Node children. insert recurses left or right until nil. height is 1 + max of both sides."] = "树节点持有 *Node 子节点。insert 向左或向右递归直到 nil。height 是 1 + 两边的 max。",
  ["A tree node owns Option<Box<Node>> children. insert recurses left or right until None. height is 1 + max of both sides."] = "树节点拥有 Option<Box<Node>> 子节点。insert 向左或向右递归，直到 None。height 是 1 加上两边的 max。",
  ["A tuple struct with one field whose Ord is the other way round. Same word as the iterator's rev, spelled out."] = "一个只有一个字段的元组结构体，其 Ord 顺序相反。和迭代器的 rev 是同一个词，完整拼出来。",
