  ["An import path that starts with a host is fetched from that host: go get github.com/x/y@v1.2.3 downloads the tagged commit into the module cache, adds a require line to go.mod and a hash to go.sum. // indirect marks a dependency of a dependency. Nothing is copied into your repo; everything is reproducible from the two files."] = "以主机名开头的导入路径就从那个主机获取：go get github.com/x/y@v1.2.3 把打了标签的提交下载进模块缓存，在 go.mod 加一行 require，在 go.sum 加一个哈希。// indirect 标记依赖的依赖。什么都不会复制进你的仓库；靠这两个文件就能完整复现。",
  ["An interface is (type, value). The type *Order is set, so it is not the nil interface."] = "interface 是 (类型, 值)。类型 *Order 已经设置，所以它不是 nil interface。",
