  ["An underscore and four letters, the same suffix the file name carries. The only case of two packages in one directory."] = "一条下划线加四个字母，和文件名带的后缀一样。一个目录里有两个包的唯一情形。",
  ["Anagram: same letters, same counts. Lowercase ASCII only. How many slots does the counter array need?"] = "变位词：字母一样，个数也一样。只考虑小写 ASCII。计数数组需要几个格子？",
  ["And on the way out, error or not. Which method closes the file?"] = "出来时，有错没错都一样。哪个方法关闭文件？",
