  ["Ask the compiler to write Clone and Debug for Order. Which attribute?"] = "让编译器替 Order 写 Clone 和 Debug。哪个属性？",
  ["Ask the tool chain to find data races at run time. Fill the flag: go test ___ ./..."] = "让工具链在运行时找数据竞争。填标志：go test ___ ./...",
  ["Ask your AI: why is `%s` the answer here, and what breaks with anything else?"] = "问问你的 AI：这里为什么答案是 `%s`，换成别的会出什么问题？",
  ["Assigning e alone is the classic bug: [1, 10] then [2, 3] would end at 3."] = "直接赋 e 是经典 bug：[1, 10] 再来 [2, 3] 会止于 3。",
