  ["AsyncResult.get() blocks and re-raises whatever the worker raised. apply_async plus get is exactly go plus <-ch."] = "AsyncResult.get() 会阻塞，并把 worker 抛出的异常重新抛一次。apply_async 加 get，正是 go 加 <-ch。",
  ["At most 3 requests in flight: a semaphore from a buffered channel. Fill: make(chan struct{}, ___)"] = "最多 3 个请求同时进行：用带缓冲 channel 做信号量。填空：make(chan struct{}, ___)",
  ["Atomics and sync.Once"] = "原子操作与 sync.Once",
  ["Await is a receive with a nicer name. Go left it out of the language because a generic type and one operator are enough."] = "Await 只是取了个好听名字的接收。Go 没把它放进语言里，因为一个泛型类型加一个运算符就够了。",
