  ["Base cases seed the table. From here every entry is built from the two before it."] = "基础情况给表打底。从这里起每一项都由前两项算出。",
  ["Base cases seed the table. dp[0] = 1 is the empty climb; without it dp[2] would be wrong."] = "基础情况给表打底。dp[0] = 1 是空的攀爬；没有它 dp[2] 就错了。",
  ["Because every Go function is already the async one. There is no second colour of function to await."] = "因为每个 Go 函数本身就已经是异步的那种。没有第二种颜色的函数要你去 await。",
  ["Before the dinner rush, rewrite the delivery backend in Rust. Ship it."] = "晚市之前，用 Rust 重写外卖后端。交付。",
  ["Before the morning van"] = "早班货车来之前",
  ["Benchmark* takes *testing.B and loops b.N times. Go 1.24 adds b.Loop()."] = "Benchmark* 接收 *testing.B 并循环 b.N 次。Go 1.24 新增 b.Loop()。",
  ["Best k hours in a row: slide a window of size k. One element enters, which one leaves?"] = "连续 k 小时的最佳：滑一个大小为 k 的窗口。一个元素进来，哪个出去？",
  ["Best subarray sum: at each x, either extend the current run or start fresh at x. Which method picks the larger?"] = "最大子数组和：在每个 x 处，要么延续当前这段，要么从 x 重新开始。哪个方法选较大的？",
  ["Big O is one question: when the input doubles, what happens to the work?"] = "Big O 就是一个问题：输入翻倍时，工作量会怎样？",
  ["Binary search and merge sort"] = "二分查找与归并排序",
  ["Binary search checks the middle of lo..hi. Which operator finds the midpoint index?"] = "二分查找检查 lo..hi 的中间。哪个运算符求中点索引？",
  ["Binary search checks the middle of lo..hi. Which operator gives a whole-number midpoint?"] = "二分查找检查 lo..hi 的中间。哪个运算符给出整数中点？",
  ["Binary search halves [lo, hi) with mid. Merge sort splits, recurses, and merges two sorted halves."] = "二分查找用 mid 把 [lo, hi) 对半分。归并排序分割、递归，再合并两个有序半段。",
  ["Binary search has one precondition. The slice must be ___"] = "二分查找有一个前提。切片必须是 ___",
  ["Binary search tree"] = "二叉搜索树",
  ["Binary search: the target is bigger than a[mid]. Where does lo move?"] = "二分查找：目标比 a[mid] 大。lo 移到哪里？",
  ["BinaryHeap implements FromIterator, so collect heapifies in O(n). Then k pops: O(n + k log n)."] = "BinaryHeap 实现了 FromIterator，所以 collect 以 O(n) 建堆。然后 k 次 pop：O(n + k log n)。",
  ["BinaryHeap is a max-heap. Reverse(x) turns it into a min-heap. kth largest: push everything, pop whenever len > k, peek. Top k frequent: count with a HashMap, collect (count, word) into a heap, pop k times."] = "BinaryHeap 是最大堆。Reverse(x) 把它变成最小堆。第 k 大：全部 push，len > k 就 pop，最后 peek。前 k 高频：用 HashMap 计数，把 (count, word) collect 进堆，pop k 次。",
  ["BinaryHeap: kth largest and top k"] = "BinaryHeap：第 k 大与前 k 名",
  ["Bindings, mutability and types"] = "绑定、可变性与类型",
  ["Blocking I/O and NumPy's C loops both drop the GIL, so threads overlap waiting perfectly. Pure Python arithmetic never drops it."] = "阻塞式 I/O 和 NumPy 的 C 循环都会放开 GIL，所以线程能完美地把等待重叠起来。纯 Python 的算术从不放开它。",
  ["Blocks are indented, no braces. elif chains ifs. for walks anything iterable; range counts. while loops on a condition."] = "代码块靠缩进，没有大括号。elif 串起多个 if。for 遍历任何可迭代对象；range 计数。while 按条件循环。",
  ["Blocks until the counter is zero. In its own goroutine so main can keep reading."] = "阻塞到计数器归零。放在单独的 goroutine 里，main 才能继续读。",
  ["Borrow only the second and third price, indices 1 and 2. What goes in the brackets?"] = "只借第二和第三个价格，索引 1 和 2。方括号里写什么？",
  ["Both tills add to one sold counter and the number is wrong every time."] = "两台收银机都往同一个销量计数器里加，数字每次都错。",
  ["Bottom-up DP: O(n) time, O(n) table, and two variables would make it O(1) space."] = "自底向上 DP：O(n) 时间，O(n) 表，换成两个变量就是 O(1) 空间。",
  ["Bottom-up fib: O(n) time, no recursion, and only two cells are ever needed, so O(1) space is possible."] = "自底向上的 fib：O(n) 时间，不用递归，而且随时只需要两个格子，所以 O(1) 空间也能做到。",
  ["Box<Node> is one pointer wide, so Node has a size. Option<Box<T>> costs nothing extra: None is the null pointer."] = "Box<Node> 只有一个指针宽，所以 Node 有确定的大小。Option<Box<T>> 不多花一个字节：None 就是空指针。",
  ["Box<dyn Error> accepts any error type via From. Good for main and prototypes, not libraries."] = "Box<dyn Error> 通过 From 接受任何错误类型。适合 main 和原型，不适合库。",
  ["Branch on what v really is. Fill: switch x := v.(___)"] = "按 v 的真实类型分支。填：switch x := v.(___)",
  ["Breadth first needs a FIFO: in at the back, out at the front. Which std collection?"] = "广度优先需要先进先出：从后面进，从前面出。哪个 std 容器？",
  ["Build a String from pieces without printing it. Which macro?"] = "把零件拼成 String，不打印。哪个宏？",
  ["Build a growable list from three literal prices. Which macro?"] = "用三个价格字面量建一个可增长的列表。哪个宏？",
  ["Build a max-heap of (count, word) straight from the map's iterator. Which method turns an iterator into a collection?"] = "直接从 map 的迭代器构建 (count, word) 的最大堆。哪个方法把迭代器变成集合？",
  ["Build that copy by hand: a new slice as long as a, then copy into it. Which built-in gives the length?"] = "手动构建那份副本：一个和 a 一样长的新切片，再复制进去。哪个内置函数给出长度？",
  ["Build the label as a string, without printing. Which fmt function?"] = "把标签拼成 string，不打印。用 fmt 的哪个函数？",
  ["By default go get asks proxy.golang.org, which caches every public module for ever and checks its hash against sum.golang.org. A private GitHub repo is invisible to the proxy: set GOPRIVATE=github.com/yourorg/* so the tool goes straight to git, and teach git to use ssh for github.com so the clone authenticates. When the cache turns stale or the disk fills, go clean -modcache."] = "默认情况下 go get 先问 proxy.golang.org，它永久缓存每个公开模块，并用 sum.golang.org 核对哈希。私有 GitHub 仓库对代理是不可见的：设置 GOPRIVATE=github.com/yourorg/* 让工具直接走 git，再教 git 对 github.com 使用 ssh，克隆才能通过认证。缓存过期或磁盘满了，就 go clean -modcache。",
  ["By hand: look the answer up before computing. Which dict is checked?"] = "手动版：计算之前先查答案。检查哪个 dict？",
  ["C  continue at %s   (%d/%d streets clear)"] = "C  从 %s 继续   (%d/%d 条街通关)",
  ["CALLBACK  -  the whiteboard"] = "CALLBACK  -  白板",
  ["CALLBACK  ·  the Go round"] = "CALLBACK  ·  Go 回合",
  ["CALLBACK  ·  the Python round"] = "CALLBACK  ·  Python 回合",
