  ["CODE RUSH  -  the interview"] = "CODE RUSH  -  面试",
  ["CODE RUSH  ·  Times Square"] = "代码冲刺  ·  时代广场",
  ["CODE RUSH  ·  the Python round"] = "CODE RUSH  ·  Python 回合",
  ["CODE RUSH  ·  the Rust round"] = "CODE RUSH  ·  Rust 回合",
  ["COMBO x%d"] = "连击 x%d",
  ["COMBO x10"] = "连击 x10",
  ["COMBO x5"] = "连击 x5",
  ["COPIED  %s"] = "已复制  %s",
  ["COPY  (ask your AI why)"] = "复制  (问 AI 为什么)",
  ["Call it what its GitHub URL will be. Every import inside starts with that string."] = "就叫它将来的 GitHub URL。里面每个 import 都以这串字开头。",
  ["Call the map API over HTTP with one line. Which popular async client crate?"] = "一行代码通过 HTTP 调用地图 API。哪个流行的 async 客户端 crate？",
  ["Callback round, Chef. Whiteboard, no keyboard. First: are these brackets balanced?"] = "Callback 回合，厨师。白板，没有键盘。第一题：这些括号配对了吗？",
  ["Callback round, Mei. No buzzer this time, just the whiteboard. Warm-up: are these brackets balanced?"] = "回访轮，Mei。这次没有抢答器，只有白板。热身：这些括号配对了吗？",
  ["Cancel automatically after two seconds. Fill: context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)"] = "两秒后自动取消。填空：context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)",
  ["Capital = exported. Small = private to the package. Same rule for types and fields."] = "大写 = 导出。小写 = 包内私有。类型和字段同样适用。",
  ["Capital E, returns string. That one method is the whole error interface."] = "大写 E，返回 string。这一个方法就是整个 error interface。",
  ["Capital M. MarshalIndent pretty-prints. The opposite is on the next blank."] = "大写 M。MarshalIndent 带缩进美化输出。反方向在下一个空里。",
  ["Capital N. Go's nil, Rust's Option::None. Compare it with is, not ==."] = "大写 N。Go 的 nil，Rust 的 Option::None。用 is 比较，不要用 ==。",
  ["Capital S. The fmt.Stringer interface has exactly this one method."] = "大写 S。fmt.Stringer interface 只有这一个方法。",
  ["Capital first letter. Lower-case fields are invisible outside the package, json included."] = "首字母大写。小写字段在包外不可见，json 也看不到。",
  ["Capital means exported, and that goes for types, fields, methods and constants too. A struct with lowercase fields cannot even be filled in from another package."] = "大写就是导出，类型、字段、方法和常量都一样。字段是小写的 struct，在别的包里甚至没法填值。",
  ["Cargo, the build tool"] = "Cargo，构建工具",
  ["Carry the order id through five calls of logging. Which constructor?"] = "把订单 id 带过五层日志调用。用哪个构造函数？",
  ["Causeway Bay"] = "铜锣湾",
  ["Causeway Bay station"] = "铜锣湾站",
  ["Channel pipelines, closed and nil"] = "channel 流水线，关闭与 nil",
  ["Channels"] = "Channel",
  ["Channels in Go, mpsc in Rust, and now a Queue. Same kitchen every time."] = "Go 用 channel，Rust 用 mpsc，现在是 Queue。每次都是同一个厨房。",
  ["Check bounds before touching g[r][c]: Python would raise IndexError on the right edge, and g[-1] silently wraps."] = "碰 g[r][c] 之前先检查边界：Python 在右边缘会抛 IndexError，而 g[-1] 会悄悄绕回去。",
  ["Check bounds before you index, or the recursion panics at the shoreline."] = "先检查边界再取下标，否则递归会在海岸线上 panic。",
  ["Check for an order without waiting; the till must keep beeping. Which method?"] = "不等待地查看有没有订单；收银机得继续响。哪个方法？",
  ["Check the hints before running the shift. Which tool, the classic one?"] = "开工前检查标注。哪个工具，最经典的那个？",
  ["Checking every guest against every other guest for a double booking. Fine with 20. Not with 2000."] = "为了查重复预订，把每位客人和其他每位客人比较。20 个没问题。2000 个不行。",
  ["Checking every guest against every other guest for a double booking. It was fine with 20. It is not fine with 2000."] = "为了查重复预订，把每位客人和其他每位客人比较。20 个人没问题。2000 个就不行了。",
  ["Chef Bo"] = "波师傅",
  ["Close results only after every worker is done. Fill: wg.___(); close(results)"] = "所有 worker 完成后才关闭 results。填空：wg.___(); close(results)",
  ["Close the receipt printer whether the refund worked or not. Which clause always runs?"] = "不管退款成不成功都要关掉收据打印机。哪个子句总会运行？",
  ["Code is done. Now build it like a Rustacean: one tool for everything. Ticket six."] = "代码写完了。现在像 Rustacean 一样构建它：一个工具搞定一切。第六张工单。",
  ["Coin c on top of the best answer for a - c, if that beats what we have. Which built-in keeps the smaller?"] = "在 a - c 的最优答案上加一枚硬币 c，如果比现有的更好。哪个内置函数保留较小值？",
  ["Coin change, fewest coins. Before the loop, mark every amount with a value no real answer can reach. Which?"] = "零钱兑换，最少硬币数。循环之前，给每个金额标上一个任何真实答案都到不了的值。哪个？",
  ["Coin change: dp[a] is the fewest coins for amount a. The table starts full of 'impossible'. Which amount costs zero coins?"] = "找零：dp[a] 是凑出金额 a 的最少硬币数。表一开始全填“不可能”。哪个金额花零枚硬币？",
  ["Coin change: fewest coins for each amount. Unreachable amounts start at infinity. Fill the float."] = "硬币找零：每个金额的最少硬币数。到不了的金额从无穷大开始。填这个浮点数。",
  ["Coins [2] for 3 returns -1. Table, transition, base case, impossible marker: every DP has the four."] = "硬币 [2] 凑 3 返回 -1。表、转移、基础情况、不可能标记：每个 DP 都有这四样。",
  ["Colon then equals. Only inside a function."] = "冒号加等号。只能在函数内部使用。",
  ["Compare characters, not bytes, so 銅鑼灣 works. Fill: r := []___(s)"] = "比较字符而不是字节，这样 銅鑼灣 也能用。填空：r := []___(s)",
  ["Compare code against several patterns and pick one arm. Which keyword?"] = "把 code 和几个模式比对，选一个分支。哪个关键字？",
  ["Compare the start with the end of the last block in out. Equal counts as touching."] = "把起点和 out 里最后一个块的终点比较。相等也算碰到。",
  ["CompareAndSwap returns false when someone beat you to it, so the loop reads and tries again. That retry loop is how lock-free code is written."] = "有人抢先一步时 CompareAndSwap 返回 false，于是循环重新读、再试一次。这个重试循环就是无锁代码的写法。",
  ["Comparing each pair once is n(n-1)/2 checks. For 100 guests, how many?"] = "每对比较一次是 n(n-1)/2 次。100 位客人，多少次？",
  ["Compile everything into one binary called delivery. Fill: go ___ -o delivery ."] = "把所有代码编译成一个叫 delivery 的二进制文件。填：go ___ -o delivery .",
  ["Compile with optimisations for the live server. Which flag?"] = "给线上服务器开优化编译。哪个标志？",
  ["Compute, remember, return. Fill the second term: fib(n-1) + fib(___)"] = "计算、记住、返回。填第二项：fib(n-1) + fib(___)",
  ["Computed once, never again. Put v into the memo under key n. Which method?"] = "算过一次就不再算。把 v 以键 n 存进 memo。哪个方法？",
  ["Constant time"] = "常数时间",
  ["Constant. A Python list is an array of pointers; index 3 is base plus 3 times a pointer's size."] = "常数。Python 列表是一个指针数组；索引 3 是基地址加 3 乘一个指针的大小。",
  ["Constant. A slice is a pointer and a length; index 3 is pointer plus 3 times the element size, after a bounds check."] = "常数。切片是一个指针加一个长度；索引 3 是边界检查之后指针加 3 乘元素大小。",
  ["Constant. The slice knows its base address; index 3 is base plus 3 times the element size."] = "常数。切片知道自己的基地址；索引 3 就是基地址加 3 乘元素大小。",
  ["Context and tests"] = "Context 与测试",
  ["Context managers"] = "上下文管理器",
  ["Conversion is T(x). int and float64 never mix without it."] = "转换写作 T(x)。没有它，int 和 float64 不能混用。",
  ["Convert the rune back to a string. The index i is a byte offset."] = "把 rune 转回 string。下标 i 是字节偏移量。",
  ["Copies are the tax of multiprocessing: a global changed in a child stays in the child. multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory gives every process the same block of bytes, found by name and read through .buf, which NumPy can wrap without copying. You close() your view and unlink() the block exactly once, or it outlives the program."] = "复制是 multiprocessing 的税：在子进程里改掉的全局变量只留在子进程里。multiprocessing.shared_memory.SharedMemory 让每个进程拿到同一块字节，按名字找到、经由 .buf 读取，而 NumPy 可以不复制地把它包起来。你要 close() 自己的视图，并且恰好 unlink() 那块内存一次，否则它会活得比程序还久。",
  ["Count characters, not bytes. Which iterator do you count?"] = "数字符，不数字节。你要数哪个迭代器？",
  ["Count characters, not bytes. Which unicode/utf8 function?"] = "数字符，不数字节。用 unicode/utf8 的哪个函数？",
  ["Count each letter of a word in one call. Which collections class?"] = "一次调用数出一个词里每个字母的次数。collections 的哪个类？",
  ["Count islands: every land cell still standing starts a new one. Fill the call that sinks the whole island."] = "数岛屿：每个还立着的陆地格子都开启一座新岛。填上把整座岛沉掉的那个调用。",
  ["Count letters of a, uncount letters of b; all zero means anagram. Fill: count[c-'a']___"] = "a 的字母计数加，b 的字母计数减；全为零就是变位词。填空：count[c-'a']___",
  ["Count muffins per table: insert 0 if the key is new, then add 1. Which HashMap method starts that?"] = "按桌统计松饼：键是新的就插 0，然后加 1。HashMap 的哪个方法开头？",
  ["Count the arrows. 2 to this power is 1024."] = "数箭头。2 的这个次方是 1024。",
  ["Count the nodes without taking ownership: cur is a &Link. Step to the following node: cur = &node.___"] = "不取得所有权就数出节点个数：cur 是 &Link。走到后面那个节点：cur = &node.___",
  ["Count the values. The length is part of the type, so [i32; 4] would be a different type."] = "数一数值。长度是类型的一部分，所以 [i32; 4] 是另一个类型。",
  ["Counter(word).most_common(1) gives the top letter. Go's count[c-'a']++ in one line. Round six to Bo."] = "Counter(word).most_common(1) 给出最多的字母。Go 的 count[c-'a']++ 一行搞定。第六回合归 Bo。",
  ["Counting the queue takes one look per person. Twice the queue, twice the looking."] = "数队伍每个人看一眼。队伍两倍，看的次数两倍。",
  ["Crate name, two colons, the function it sits on."] = "crate 名，两个冒号，再加它所标记的那个函数名。",
  ["Create a fresh binary project called delivery. Which cargo subcommand?"] = "新建一个叫 delivery 的二进制项目。哪个 cargo 子命令？",
  ["Custom errors and ?"] = "自定义错误与 ?",
  ["Cut a slice into two slices at mid, no copying. Which slice method returns the pair?"] = "在 mid 处把一个切片切成两个切片，不做拷贝。哪个切片方法返回这一对？",
  ["DELIVERY  -  the app"] = "DELIVERY  -  应用",
  ["DFS dives down one line before backing up. Same O(V + E) as BFS. Mind the 1000-deep recursion limit. Round three to Bo."] = "DFS 沿一条线潜到底再折返。和 BFS 一样 O(V + E)。注意 1000 层的递归限制。第三回合归 Bo。",
  ["DFS is recursion plus a visited set. Maps are reference-like: no pointer needed."] = "DFS 就是递归加一个已访问集合。map 是引用语义：不需要指针。",
  ["DP fills a table from small answers up. Stairs: dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]. Coin change: dp[a] = min over coins of dp[a-c] + 1, with amount+1 as 'impossible'."] = "DP 从小答案往上填表。楼梯：dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]。找零：dp[a] = 对每枚硬币取 dp[a-c] + 1 的最小值，用 amount+1 表示“不可能”。",
  ["DP: a table of answers to smaller problems, filled from the base cases up. Stairs: dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]. Coin change: dp[a] = min over coins of dp[a-c] + 1, with a sentinel for 'impossible'."] = "DP：一张记录小问题答案的表，从基础情况向上填。楼梯：dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2]。零钱兑换：dp[a] = 对每种硬币取 dp[a-c] + 1 的最小值，用一个哨兵值表示“不可能”。",
  ["DP: solve the small cases once, build the bigger ones from them. Stairs: ways(i) = ways(i-1) + ways(i-2). Coins: dp[a] = min over coins of dp[a-c] + 1, with inf for unreachable."] = "DP：小问题只解一次，大问题由它们搭起来。楼梯：ways(i) = ways(i-1) + ways(i-2)。硬币：dp[a] = 所有硬币中 dp[a-c] + 1 的最小值，到不了的用 inf。",
  ["Declare a function. Which keyword starts the line?"] = "声明一个函数。这一行以哪个关键字开头？",
  ["Declare with an explicit type, outside any function. Which keyword?"] = "在函数之外用显式类型声明。哪个关键字？",
  ["Decorators"] = "装饰器",
  ["Define your own error type for the kitchen. What must it inherit from?"] = "为厨房定义自己的错误类型。它必须继承什么？",
  ["Depth first, recursive: visit, then call yourself on each unseen neighbour. Fill the call."] = "深度优先，递归：访问，然后对每个没见过的邻站调用自己。填上调用。",
  ["Depth first: same loop, but the newest station goes next. Which Vec method takes from the end?"] = "深度优先：同一个循环，但下一个走最新的那个站。哪个 Vec 方法从末尾取？",
  ["Depth-first: visit, then recurse into each unseen neighbour. Fill the call."] = "深度优先：访问，然后递归进每个未访问的邻居。填调用。",
  ["Dicts and sets"] = "dict 与 set",
  ["Did any of those futures leak? Which runtime call counts the live goroutines?"] = "那些 future 有没有漏掉的？哪个 runtime 调用数活着的 goroutine？",
  ["Did the child succeed? Which attribute holds its exit status after join?"] = "子进程成功了吗？join 之后哪个属性保存它的退出状态？",
  ["Different indexes are different memory, so no lock is needed. Since Go 1.22 each iteration gets its own i, so the closure captures the right one."] = "不同的下标就是不同的内存，所以不需要锁。从 Go 1.22 起每一轮都有自己的 i，所以闭包捕获到的是对的那个。",
  ["Directory, package name, exported names"] = "目录、包名、导出的名字",
  ["Display does not care which lifetime Receipt has. Which placeholder says so?"] = "Display 不关心 Receipt 是哪个生命周期。哪个占位符这么说？",
  ["Divide and conquer: split the slice in the middle. Fill: let mid = v.len() / ___"] = "分而治之：从中间把切片分开。填空：let mid = v.len() / ___",
  ["Divide, recurse, merge: O(n log n) always. Base case is a slice of length 0 or 1."] = "分割、递归、合并：永远 O(n log n)。基准情形是长度 0 或 1 的 slice。",
  ["Do not block if nothing is ready. Which case label?"] = "没有就绪的就不要阻塞。哪个 case 标签？",
  ["Do not recurse. Fill a table from the bottom step up."] = "别递归。从最底下的台阶开始往上填表。",
  ["Do not start a Process per photo. Forty thousand interpreters is not parallelism, it is a fire."] = "别为每张照片开一个 Process。四万个解释器不是并行，那是火灾。",
  ["Doc comments are the API reference: go doc, gopls hover and pkg.go.dev all read them. Start each with the name it documents so it reads as a sentence."] = "文档注释就是 API 参考：go doc、gopls 悬停和 pkg.go.dev 都读它。每条都以它描述的名字开头，读起来才像一句话。",
  ["Does the order contain egg? Which keyword tests membership?"] = "订单里有鸡蛋吗？哪个关键字测试成员关系？",
  ["Does this shift start before the last merged block ends? Fill the overlap test."] = "这个班次是否在上一个合并块结束前就开始？填重叠判断。",
  ["Don't share memory. Pass the hash brown on a channel."] = "不要共享内存。用 channel 把薯饼传过去。",
  ["Double every price into a new list, in one line. Which keyword sits in the middle of the comprehension?"] = "一行把每个价格翻倍放进新列表。推导式中间是哪个关键字？",
  ["Double every quantity. How does a closure name its one parameter?"] = "把每个数量翻倍。闭包怎么写它唯一的参数？",
  ["Dunder around the text type's name. Its sibling __repr__ is for the debugger."] = "文本类型的名字，前后加 dunder。它的兄弟 __repr__ 是给调试器用的。",
  ["Dunder around the verb for going in. Its return value is what as binds."] = "“进入”这个动词前后加 dunder。它的返回值就是 as 绑定的东西。",
  ["Dunder around the verb for going out. It receives three values about any exception."] = "“退出”这个动词前后加 dunder。它接收关于异常的三个值。",
  ["Dynamic programming"] = "动态规划",
  ["Dynamic programming: stairs and coins"] = "动态规划：楼梯与硬币",
  ["EARLY BIRD"] = "早起鸟",
  ["ENTER  pick a street"] = "ENTER  选一条街",
  ["ENTER  street map      ESC  title"] = "ENTER  街道地图      ESC  标题",
  ["ESC back"] = "ESC 返回",
  ["ESC title"] = "ESC 标题",
  ["EXPORT  to ~/Downloads"] = "导出  到 ~/Downloads",
  ["Each Fibonacci number is the sum of the two before it."] = "每个斐波那契数都是前两项之和。",
  ["Each call handles one step and delegates the rest: n * (n-1)!"] = "每次调用只做一步，其余交给下一层：n * (n-1)!",
  ["Each call handles one step and delegates the rest: n * (n-1)!. Python ints never overflow, so fact(100) just works."] = "每次调用处理一步，其余交出去：n * (n-1)!。Python 的 int 永不溢出，所以 fact(100) 直接可用。",
  ["Each call is one step closer to 1. fact(20) is the biggest that fits in u64. The crowd claps."] = "每次调用都离 1 更近一步。fact(20) 是 u64 装得下的最大的一个。观众鼓掌。",
  ["Each cell is visited a constant number of times: O(rows*cols). A BFS with a queue avoids deep recursion. OFFER."] = "每个格子被访问常数次：O(rows*cols)。带队列的 BFS 能避免深递归。OFFER。",
  ["Each closer maps to its opener. Fill the value stored for ')'."] = "每个闭括号对应它的开括号。填上 ')' 对应存储的值。",
  ["Each interval is compared with the last merged one, which may need to grow. Which method borrows the last element mutably as Option?"] = "每个区间都和上一个已合并区间比较，后者可能需要变长。哪个方法以 Option 可变借用最后一个元素？",
  ["Each n is computed once: O(n) calls, O(n) memory. Round one, no misses. Combo x1."] = "每个 n 只算一次：O(n) 次调用，O(n) 内存。第一回合，零失误。连击 x1。",
  ["Each node links to the next one. Fill the field type: Next ___"] = "每个节点链接到下一个。填字段类型：Next ___",
  ["Each thread needs its own handle to the same counter. Which call makes one from &sold?"] = "每个线程需要自己的一个指向同一计数器的句柄。哪个调用从 &sold 造一个？",
  ["Each version is unpacked once into pkg/mod/github.com/alex/luckymac@v1.2.0 and never touched again. go clean -modcache wipes it when the disk fills up."] = "每个版本只解压一次到 pkg/mod/github.com/alex/luckymac@v1.2.0，之后再也不碰。磁盘满了就用 go clean -modcache 清掉。",
  ["Eight cooks, one order book. That I understand."] = "八个厨师，一本落单簿。这个我懂。",
  ["Eight cores, one busy"] = "八个核，只有一个忙",
  ["Eight letters, the opposite of external. The rule is in the compiler, not in a linter."] = "八个字母，external 的反面。这条规则在编译器里，不在 linter 里。",
  ["Eight letters, what a house or an object has. Then o.total works, no parentheses."] = "八个字母，一座房子或一个对象拥有的东西。然后 o.total 不带括号就能用。",
  ["Eight letters: every goroutine waits on every other. The send never returns."] = "八个字母：每个 goroutine 都在等别的 goroutine。发送永远不返回。",
  ["Eight letters: like find, but it gives you where, not what. Option<usize>."] = "八个字母：像 find，但给你的是位置而不是元素。Option<usize>。",
  ["Eight shared doubles with a lock and no NumPy. Which multiprocessing class?"] = "八个带锁的共享 double，不用 NumPy。用哪个 multiprocessing 类？",
  ["Eight workers, one label printer. The labels came out with two orders on one sticker."] = "八个 worker，一台标签打印机。印出来的贴纸上有两张订单叠在一起。",
  ["Eight workers, started once, reused all night. Which class?"] = "八个 worker，只开一次，用一整晚。用哪个类？",
  ["Elision: one input reference (here &self) means the output borrows from it. Most signatures need no 'a at all. The receipt prints."] = "省略规则：只有一个输入引用（这里是 &self）就表示输出从它借。大多数签名根本不需要 'a。收据打印出来了。",
  ["Empty brackets then the element type. [3]int would be an array."] = "空方括号加元素类型。[3]int 就是数组了。",
  ["Empty parentheses. go needs a call, not just a function value."] = "空括号。go 需要一次调用，不只是函数值。",
  ["Empty the whole map in one call (Go 1.21). Which built-in?"] = "一次调用清空整个 map（Go 1.21）。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Errors and defer"] = "错误与 defer",
  ["Errors are exceptions: try runs the risky part, except catches a type, finally always runs, raise throws. Your own errors subclass Exception."] = "错误就是异常：try 运行有风险的部分，except 捕获某个类型，finally 总会运行，raise 抛出。自己的错误继承 Exception。",
  ["Errors: New, wrap, Is, As"] = "error：New、包装、Is、As",
  ["Even with separate memory, processes still share the machine: one printer, one log file, one counter in shared memory. multiprocessing.Lock is the mutex across processes, used as a with block. Value and Array put a number in shared memory and hand you get_lock() for it, and a Manager serves ordinary dicts and lists over a proxy."] = "就算内存分开了，进程之间还是共享着这台机器：一台打印机、一个日志文件、共享内存里的一个计数。multiprocessing.Lock 就是跨进程的 mutex，用 with 块来用。Value 和 Array 把一个数字放进共享内存，并把 get_lock() 一并交给你，而 Manager 通过代理提供普通的 dict 和 list。",
  ["Evening edition of CODE RUSH! Rust round. Mei, you're up. Factorial, then fib. Buzzer's live!"] = "CODE RUSH 夜场！Rust 回合。Mei，到你了。先阶乘，再 fib。抢答器已经开了！",
  ["Every Go file starts with package. import brings other packages in."] = "每个 Go 文件都以 package 开头。import 把其他包引进来。",
  ["Every Rust program starts in which function?"] = "每个 Rust 程序从哪个函数开始？",
  ["Every cell is visited once by the loop and at most once by a DFS: O(rows * cols). The screen says OFFER."] = "每个格子被循环访问一次，被 DFS 最多访问一次：O(rows * cols)。屏幕上写着 OFFER。",
  ["Every closer knows its opener. Fill the opener that } maps to."] = "每个闭括号都认识自己的开括号。填 } 对应的开括号。",
  ["Every dish gets a stamp: time it, log it. I do not want to write that in fifty functions."] = "每道菜都盖个章：计时、记录。我不想在五十个函数里都写一遍。",
  ["Every dish is a function. fry(egg), brew(tea). Someone deleted the word that starts them."] = "每道菜都是一个函数。fry(egg)、brew(tea)。有人删掉了开头那个词。",
  ["Every get must be paired with a task_done, or join waits forever. Go's wg.Done()."] = "每个 get 必须配一个 task_done，否则 join 永远等待。Go 的 wg.Done()。",
  ["Every get needs one task_done, or q.join() waits for ever. It is the WaitGroup of the queue world."] = "每个 get 都要配一个 task_done，否则 q.join() 会永远等下去。它就是队列世界里的 WaitGroup。",
  ["Every island is counted exactly once because its cells are water by the time the loop reaches them again. OFFER."] = "每座岛恰好被数一次，因为循环再次到达它的格子时，它们已经是水了。OFFER。",
  ["Every item is moved exactly once per level, however many pieces there are."] = "不管有多少块，每一项每层恰好移动一次。",
  ["Every item sent to a worker is pickled and shipped down a pipe. Below a few microseconds of work per item, the shipping is the program."] = "每一件送去 worker 的东西都要 pickle 再经管道运过去。当每件工作不到几微秒时，运输就是整个程序。",
  ["Every key of the price map, as an iterator (Go 1.23). Fill: maps.___(prices)"] = "价格 map 的每个 key，以迭代器形式（Go 1.23）。填：maps.___(prices)",
  ["Every one of these is 'use a map' or 'use two pointers'. Pick the right one."] = "这些题不是“用 map”就是“用双指针”。选对那个。",
  ["Every opener must have been closed. What does the function return at the end?"] = "每个开括号都必须已经闭合。函数最后返回什么？",
  ["Every opener must have found its closer. What does valid return after the loop?"] = "每个开括号都必须找到了闭括号。循环结束后 valid 返回什么？",
  ["Every price but the first must lose a comparison to be ruled out. One less than the count."] = "除了第一个，每个价格都得在比较中输一次才能被排除。比数量少一。",
  ["Every process closes its view. Which call, made once, frees the block itself?"] = "每个进程都关掉自己的视图。哪个调用只做一次，释放这块内存本身？",
  ["Every public download is checked against a transparency log. Name its host."] = "每次公开下载都会和一份透明日志核对。说出它的主机名。",
  ["Every real answer grows out of dp[0]. The marker amount + 1 lets min work without an Option."] = "每个真实答案都从 dp[0] 长出来。标记值 amount + 1 让 min 不需要 Option 就能工作。",
  ["Every receipt goes onto a min-heap. Which heapq function adds x and keeps the heap order?"] = "每张收据都进最小堆。哪个 heapq 函数加入 x 并保持堆序？",
  ["Every recursion stops somewhere. fact(0) and fact(1) evaluate to what?"] = "每个递归都要在某处停下。fact(0) 和 fact(1) 的值是多少？",
  ["Every recursion stops somewhere. fact(0) and fact(1) return what?"] = "每个递归都有终点。fact(0) 和 fact(1) 返回什么？",
  ["Every runnable Go program lives in which package?"] = "每个可运行的 Go 程序都放在哪个 package 里？",
  ["Every topping can be on or off. Ten toppings, a thousand combos. Twenty, a million. That is 2^n."] = "每种配料可以加或不加。十种配料，一千种组合。二十种，一百万。这就是 2^n。",
  ["Every topping on or off, n toppings. How many combinations, as a power?"] = "每种配料加或不加，n 种配料。多少种组合，用次方表示？",
  ["Every worker allocates a receipt buffer. Which sync.Pool method hands one back?"] = "每个 worker 都要分配一个小票缓冲区。sync.Pool 的哪个方法给你一个？",
  ["Every worker must report in before Wait returns. Which method, deferred?"] = "每个 worker 都要报到，Wait 才会返回。用哪个方法，配 defer？",
  ["Everyone's shifts overlap. Six to ten, nine to two, one to four. When is the kitchen actually staffed?"] = "大家的班次都重叠。六点到十点，九点到两点，一点到四点。厨房到底什么时候真的有人？",
  ["Everything bigger than the node. Five letters."] = "所有比这个节点大的。五个字母。",
  ["Everything from index 1 to the end. A slice expression, no copy."] = "从下标 1 到末尾的全部。切片表达式，不拷贝。",
  ["Everything from the second block on. zip stops at the shorter list, so no index error."] = "从第二个块开始的所有块。zip 在较短的列表处停下，所以不会越界。",
  ["Everything is immutable until you say mut. The tram sign forgot that."] = "不说 mut，一切都不可变。电车牌忘了这一点。",
  ["Everything written before the close happens before <-ready returns, so reading menu after it is not a race. That rule is the Go memory model."] = "关闭之前写的一切都发生在 <-ready 返回之前，所以之后读 menu 不是竞态。这条规则就是 Go 内存模型。",
  ["Exponential time"] = "指数时间",
  ["Exponential: two to the power of n. Each level of the call tree is twice as wide as the one above."] = "指数：2 的 n 次方。调用树的每一层都是上一层的两倍宽。",
  ["F for a file or writer, then printf. The writer is the first argument."] = "F 代表 file 或 writer，后接 printf。writer 是第一个参数。",
  ["FAILED  %s"] = "失败  %s",
  ["FAST!"] = "快！",
  ["FINAL  -  the islands"] = "决赛  -  岛屿",
  ["FINAL  -  the kitchen"] = "决赛  -  厨房",
  ["FIRST CLEAR"] = "首次通关",
  ["FIRST STAMP"] = "第一个印章",
  ["FIVE PERFECTS"] = "五次完美",
  ["FULL"] = "全屏",
  ["Fan-in: workers send, one closer closes. Closing from a worker would panic the others, so the closer is the goroutine that waits."] = "扇入：worker 负责发送，由一个人负责关闭。让 worker 自己关会让别人 panic，所以关闭的是那个负责等待的 goroutine。",
  ["Feed nine orders into the queue. Which method adds one?"] = "把九张订单喂进队列。哪个方法加一个？",
  ["Fewest coins wins, so keep the smaller of the old value and the new candidate."] = "硬币最少者胜，所以在旧值和新候选里留较小的。",
  ["Fibonacci in disguise: the sum of the two entries just before it."] = "乔装的斐波那契：它前面两项之和。",
  ["Final question. A map of the harbour, ones for land, zeros for water. How many islands? Get this and the offer is yours."] = "最后一题。海港的地图，1 是陆地，0 是水。有几座岛？答对了，offer 就是你的。",
  ["Final round, Mei! Get the drop and the join in the right order and you're HIRED!"] = "最后一回合，Mei！把 drop 和 join 的顺序摆对，你就 HIRED 了！",
  ["Final round. The delivery map as a grid of 1s and 0s. How many separate islands of buildings?"] = "最后一回合。外卖地图是一张 1 和 0 的网格。有多少座互不相连的楼岛？",
  ["Final round: a worker pool. Three cooks, one queue, nine orders. Nothing lost, nothing done twice."] = "最后一回合：工人池。三个厨师，一个队列，九张订单。一张不丢，一张不重做。",
  ["Finally, types. Even if the interpreter ignores them."] = "终于有类型了。即使解释器不理它们。",
  ["Find land, sink the whole island, count one. Repeat until the map is all water."] = "找到陆地，把整座岛沉掉，计一。重复到地图全是水。",
  ["Find suspicious code the compiler allows: wrong Printf verbs, copied locks. Fill: go ___ ./..."] = "找出编译器放行的可疑代码：错误的 Printf 动词、被复制的锁。填：go ___ ./...",
  ["Find the middle: slow moves one, fast moves two. Fill the fast step: fast = fast.next.___"] = "找中点：slow 走一步，fast 走两步。填 fast 那一步：fast = fast.next.___",
  ["Find where 38 belongs in the sorted amounts in O(log n). Which bisect function?"] = "用 O(log n) 找到 38 在有序金额里的位置。哪个 bisect 函数？",
  ["Finding the largest of n unsorted prices needs at least how many comparisons?"] = "在 n 个未排序的价格中找最大值，至少需要多少次比较？",
  ["Finish Go's proverb: do not communicate by sharing memory; share memory by ___."] = "补完 Go 的箴言：不要通过共享内存来通信；要通过 ___ 来共享内存。",
  ["Five letters, Go's only way to loop over a slice's elements. slices.Contains does exactly this inside."] = "五个字母，Go 遍历切片元素的唯一方式。slices.Contains 内部做的正是这个。",
  ["Five letters, a builtin that takes a channel. It never blocks and every receiver wakes."] = "五个字母，一个接收 channel 的内建函数。它从不阻塞，而且每个接收者都会醒。",
  ["Five letters, a stash of things already fetched. Its older sibling takes a maxsize."] = "五个字母，已经取过的东西的储藏。它的哥哥要接收 maxsize。",
  ["Five letters, a verb in the third person: what the wrapper does to fn."] = "五个字母，第三人称动词：包装器对 fn 做的事。",
  ["Five letters, a verb: wait for it. Rust puts the same word after a dot."] = "五个字母，一个动词：等它。Rust 把同一个词放在点后面。",
  ["Five letters, capitalised: what Value is, but with a length."] = "五个字母，首字母大写：Value 那样东西，但带了长度。",
  ["Five letters, goes before fn. The opposite of sync."] = "五个字母，写在 fn 前面。sync 的反义词。",
  ["Five letters, lower case: the box has one, and this is how you open it."] = "五个字母，小写：盒子里装着一个，而这就是打开它的方式。",
  ["Five letters, lowercase, no package in front of it. Go needs fmt for this; Python does not."] = "五个字母，小写，前面没有包名。Go 需要 fmt 才能做到；Python 不需要。",
  ["Five letters, meaning 'give way'. Like return, but the function resumes on the next pull."] = "五个字母，意思是“让路”。像 return，但下次拉取时函数会继续。",
  ["Five letters, plural. for k in menu alone gives only the keys."] = "五个字母，复数。单独 for k in menu 只给出键。",
  ["Five letters, same as Go, but Rust insists on the : u8 part."] = "五个字母，和 Go 一样，但 Rust 坚持要写 : u8 那部分。",
  ["Five letters, short for asynchronous. Rust spells it the same way in front of fn."] = "五个字母，asynchronous 的缩写。Rust 在 fn 前面的拼写一样。",
  ["Five letters, short for mutual exclusion."] = "五个字母，mutual exclusion（互斥）的缩写。",
  ["Five letters, since Python 3.9: the unbounded memo. Its older cousin takes a maxsize."] = "五个字母，Python 3.9 起有：无上限的 memo。它的老表亲要带一个 maxsize。",
  ["Five letters, the opposite of open. Forgetting it is why the morning count was wrong."] = "五个字母，open 的反义词。忘了它就是早上数目出错的原因。",
  ["Five letters, the opposite of stop. Not run(): that would call fry in the current thread."] = "五个字母，stop 的反义词。不是 run()：那会在当前线程调用 fry。",
  ["Five letters, the shape of a line at a counter. Go spells it chan."] = "五个字母，柜台前排队的那个形状。Go 写作 chan。",
  ["Five letters, the trait every Vec<T: Clone> implements. to_vec() from a slice is the other spelling."] = "五个字母，每个 Vec<T: Clone> 都实现的 trait。切片的 to_vec() 是另一种写法。",
  ["Five letters, the word for 'above'. It returns a proxy to the parent class."] = "五个字母，意思是“上面”。它返回一个指向父类的代理。",
  ["Five letters, the word for a stash of things you already fetched. Its older sibling takes a maxsize."] = "五个字母，指已经取过的东西的储藏。它的哥哥要接收 maxsize。",
  ["Five letters, what a fish does with eggs. The alternatives are fork and forkserver."] = "五个字母，鱼产卵的那个词。另外两个选择是 fork 和 forkserver。",
  ["Five letters, what a fish does with eggs. The closure must be 'static, hence move."] = "五个字母，鱼对鱼卵做的那件事，用英文。闭包必须是 'static，所以要 move。",
  ["Five letters. A region with a clear start and end."] = "五个字母。有明确起点和终点的一段区域。",
  ["Five letters. A slot for one key, whether it exists yet or not."] = "五个字母。一个键的位置，不管它存不存在。",
  ["Five letters. Also asks for a location."] = "五个字母。也是问地点的词。",
  ["Five letters. Also ends a switch or select case early."] = "五个字母。也能提前结束 switch 或 select 的 case。",
  ["Five letters. Explicit, so you always see where the copying cost is."] = "五个字母。显式写出，所以你总能看见复制的开销在哪。",
  ["Five letters. Go 1.22 borrowed the idea as for i := range 3."] = "五个字母。Go 1.22 借用了这个想法，写成 for i := range 3。",
  ["Five letters. Go called it an interface."] = "五个字母。Go 叫它 interface。",
  ["Five letters. Go has struct plus methods; Python puts both under one word. Names are CapWords."] = "五个字母。Go 是 struct 加方法；Python 把两者放在一个词下面。命名用 CapWords。",
  ["Five letters. Go's switch, but exhaustive and it returns a value."] = "五个字母。Go 的 switch，但要穷尽所有情况，还会返回值。",
  ['Five letters. It returns a Result because "1x8" is not a number.'] = '五个字母。它返回 Result，因为 "1x8" 不是数字。',
  ["Five letters. On a slice it zeroes every element instead."] = "五个字母。用在 slice 上则是把每个元素置零。",
  ["Five letters. Return an error for expected failure; this is for the impossible."] = "五个字母。预期的失败返回 error；这个留给不可能发生的情况。",
  ["Five letters. Same verb as std::thread uses to start a new thread."] = "五个字母。和 std::thread 启动新线程用的是同一个动词。",
  ["Five letters. Sender has it; Receiver does not."] = "五个字母。Sender 有它；Receiver 没有。",
  ["Five letters. The same word as in C and Python; Go spells it for."] = "五个字母。和 C、Python 里是同一个词；Go 写成 for。",
  ["Five letters. What a key maps to. The json! macro builds one."] = "五个字母。key 所映射到的东西。json! 宏能造一个。",
  ["Five letters. What fish and goroutines do."] = "五个字母。鱼和 goroutine 都会做的事，用英文。",
  ["Five letters. What the kettle does between orders."] = "五个字母。水壶在两单之间做的事。",
  ["Five letters. go run compiles and runs; this one only compiles."] = "五个字母。go run 编译并运行；这个只编译。",
  ["Five letters: the Entry API. One lookup for both the check and the insert."] = "五个字母：Entry API。一次查找同时完成检查和插入。",
  ["Five letters; Java and JavaScript say throw. Rust's panic!, but meant to be caught."] = "五个字母；Java 和 JavaScript 叫 throw。Rust 的 panic!，但是设计成可以被捕获。",
  ["Fix the Go bugs. Get the morning set."] = "修好 Go bug，领早餐套餐。",
  ["Fix the Python scripts. Close the night shift."] = "修好 Python 脚本。结束夜班。",
  ["Fix the Rust bugs. Get the afternoon tea set."] = "修好 Rust 的 bug，拿到下午茶套餐。",
  ["Flip it to > for a max-heap. sort.Interface plus Push and Pop is the whole contract."] = "反过来用 > 就是最大堆。sort.Interface 加 Push 和 Pop 就是全部契约。",
  ["Flood fill on a grid: return when out of bounds or not land, sink the cell to mark it, recurse into the four neighbours. Count islands by starting a fill from every land cell still standing."] = "网格上的洪水填充：越界或不是陆地就返回，把格子沉掉作为标记，再递归四个邻居。从每个还立着的陆地格子发起一次填充，数出岛屿。",
  ["Flood the four neighbours. r + 1 is fine, but r - 1 on a usize at row 0 panics in debug. Which method subtracts and wraps to usize::MAX instead?"] = "洪泛四个邻居。r + 1 没问题，但第 0 行的 usize 做 r - 1 在 debug 下会 panic。哪个方法做减法并回绕到 usize::MAX？",
  ["Flood the four neighbours: down, up, right and one more. Fill the missing one."] = "把洪水漫向四个邻居：下、上、右，还有一个。填上缺的那个。",
  ["Floor 8. Type the floor. Don't hard-code magic."] = "8 楼。输入楼层。别硬编码魔法数字。",
  ["Floor is a named type over int. Convert the int 3 into a Floor. Fill: f := ___(3)"] = "Floor 是基于 int 的命名类型。把 int 值 3 转成 Floor。填：f := ___(3)",
  ["Floors 1 to 5, and 5 must be included. Which range operator?"] = "1 到 5 层，5 也必须包括。哪个范围运算符？",
  ["Floyd's check: if the fast rider ever lands on the slow one, the route loops. Which operator compares identity?"] = "Floyd 检查：如果快骑手落到慢骑手身上，路线就成环。哪个运算符比较同一性？",
  ["Floyd: fast moves two steps per turn. Fill: fast = fast.Next.___"] = "Floyd 算法：fast 每轮走两步。填空：fast = fast.Next.___",
  ["Followed by the value, then case labels. No break needed."] = "后面跟值，再写 case 标签。不需要 break。",
  ["For a pure function, the standard library has the whole cache as a decorator. Which keyword caps its size?"] = "对纯函数，标准库把整个缓存做成了一个装饰器。哪个关键字参数限制它的大小？",
  ["For each amount a and coin c that fits: one coin c on top of the best for a - c. Keep the smaller. Which method?"] = "对每个金额 a 和每枚放得下的硬币 c：在 a - c 的最优解上再加一枚 c。保留较小者。哪个方法？",
  ["For each coin c that fits into a: one coin, plus the best for what is left. Fill the index."] = "对每枚能放进 a 的硬币 c：一枚硬币，加上剩余部分的最优解。填上下标。",
  ["For one number, an atomic beats a mutex: atomic.Int64 has Add, Load, Store and CompareAndSwap, all lock free. atomic.Pointer[T] swaps a whole value in one step. sync.Once runs setup exactly once; sync.OnceValue caches what it returned."] = "只有一个数字时，原子操作胜过 mutex：atomic.Int64 有 Add、Load、Store 和 CompareAndSwap，全都无锁。atomic.Pointer[T] 一步换掉整个值。sync.Once 让初始化只跑一次；sync.OnceValue 还会缓存它的返回值。",
  ["Forty riders, eight bikes"] = "四十个骑手，八辆单车",
  ["Forty thousand photos"] = "四万张照片",
  ["Forty thousand photos before the morning van, and threads made it no faster. Fill every core with processes."] = "早班货车来之前要搞定四万张照片，而线程一点没让它变快。用进程把每个核都填满。",
  ["Forty thousand results will not fit in memory. Which method yields them one by one?"] = "四万个结果装不进内存。哪个方法一个一个地交出它们？",
  ["Found and removed from its old spot: now k goes to the fresh end. Which VecDeque method appends at the back?"] = "找到并从旧位置移除：现在 k 去新的那端。哪个 VecDeque 方法在末尾追加？",
  ["Four directions, no diagonals. Deep grids hit the recursion limit near 1000: an explicit stack of (r, c) fixes that."] = "四个方向，不走对角线。深的网格在 1000 附近会撞上递归限制：用一个显式的 (r, c) 栈就能解决。",
  ["Four hundred HTTP calls, and four hundred image resizes. Same code, different executor."] = "四百个 HTTP 调用，和四百张要缩的图。同样的代码，不同的 executor。",
  ["Four hundred image resizes, eight cores. Which executor class?"] = "四百张图要缩，八个核。用哪个 executor 类？",
  ["Four letters, a Greek one. Resets to 0 in every const block, +1 per line."] = "四个字母，一个希腊字母。每个 const 块重置为 0，每行 +1。",
  ["Four letters, a preposition. It replaces try/finally: f.close() for the common case."] = "四个字母，一个介词。它替代了常见情况下的 try/finally: f.close()。",
  ["Four letters, as in workspace. Go 1.18. It writes a go.work file beside the two folders."] = "四个字母，workspace 的开头。Go 1.18。它在两个文件夹旁边写一个 go.work 文件。",
  ["Four letters, capital K. slices.Sorted(maps.Keys(m)) gives a sorted slice."] = "四个字母，大写 K。slices.Sorted(maps.Keys(m)) 得到排好序的 slice。",
  ["Four letters, capital O. Its only method is Do."] = "四个字母，大写 O。唯一的方法是 Do。",
  ["Four letters, capital S. SortFunc takes a compare function."] = "四个字母，大写 S。SortFunc 接收一个比较函数。",
  ["Four letters, capitalised. The same name threading uses, and Go calls it sync.Mutex."] = "四个字母，首字母大写。和 threading 用的名字一样，Go 叫它 sync.Mutex。",
  ["Four letters, capitalized; Go calls it a Mutex. with acquires and releases it."] = "四个字母，大写开头；Go 叫它 Mutex。with 负责获取和释放。",
  ["Four letters, plural of what you look a value up by."] = "四个字母，你用来查值的那个东西的复数。",
  ["Four letters, short for implementation. Go attaches methods one by one; Rust groups them."] = "四个字母，implementation 的缩写。Go 一个一个挂方法；Rust 把它们归成一组。",
  ["Four letters, short for receive. Returns Result<Job, RecvError>. try_recv would not wait."] = "四个字母，receive 的缩写。返回 Result<Job, RecvError>。try_recv 则不会等。",
  ["Four letters, the append of every Vec."] = "四个字母，每个 Vec 的追加方法。",
  ["Four letters, the opposite of Store."] = "四个字母，Store 的反面。",
  ["Four letters, the opposite of first. The length is stored, so no counting."] = "四个字母，first 的反义词。长度是存好的，所以不用数。",
  ["Four letters, the opposite of send, cut short."] = "四个字母，send 的反义词，截短了。",
  ["Four letters, the same word Go uses for a set of workers reading one channel."] = "四个字母，和 Go 用来称呼一群读同一条 channel 的 worker 的词一样。",
  ["Four letters, the same word Rust's JoinHandle uses. Go spells it wg.Wait()."] = "四个字母，Rust 的 JoinHandle 用的同一个词。Go 写 wg.Wait()。",
  ["Four letters, the same word as Thread.join, but on the queue: wait until the count of unfinished tasks is zero."] = "四个字母，和 Thread.join 同一个词，但作用于队列：等到未完成任务的计数为零。",
  ["Four letters, the same word threading uses. Go spells it wg.Wait()."] = "四个字母，和 threading 用的词一样。Go 写作 wg.Wait()。",
  ["Four letters, the start of iterator. A for loop calls it for you."] = "四个字母，iterator 的开头。for 循环会替你调用它。",
  ["Four letters, the type of true. map[T]struct{} saves a byte per entry and is the other idiom."] = "四个字母，true 的类型。map[T]struct{} 每项省一个字节，是另一种惯用写法。",
  ["Four letters, the type {} makes. A list of pairs would need a scan, O(n)."] = "四个字母，{} 造出来的类型。成对的列表需要扫描，O(n)。",
  ["Four letters, the word in the warning itself. It also works on go run and go build."] = "四个字母，就是警告里的那个词。它对 go run 和 go build 一样有效。",
  ["Four letters, to enumerate. -m means modules rather than packages; -u adds available upgrades."] = "四个字母，列举。-m 表示模块而非包；-u 加上可用的升级。",
  ["Four letters, what a shell puts between two commands. It returns two ends."] = "四个字母，shell 放在两条命令中间的那样东西。它返回两端。",
  ["Four letters. An alias of int32. byte is the alias of uint8."] = "四个字母。int32 的别名。byte 是 uint8 的别名。",
  ["Four letters. Consumes the handle and returns Result<T, Box<dyn Any + Send>>."] = "四个字母。消耗掉这个 handle，返回 Result<T, Box<dyn Any + Send>>。",
  ["Four letters. Every file may have one; the runtime calls it for you."] = "四个字母。每个文件都可以有一个；运行时会替你调用。",
  ["Four letters. Go fakes it with const and iota; Rust has the real thing."] = "四个字母。Go 用 const 和 iota 凑合；Rust 有真货。",
  ["Four letters. Go writes for { } with no condition; Rust has a word for it."] = "四个字母。Go 写不带条件的 for { }；Rust 有专门的词。",
  ["Four letters. Go's append, but it changes the Vec in place, so it needs mut."] = "四个字母。Go 的 append，但它原地修改 Vec，所以需要 mut。",
  ["Four letters. Go's receiver (o *Order), Rust's &self, but here it is an ordinary parameter by convention."] = "四个字母。Go 的接收者 (o *Order)，Rust 的 &self，但这里按约定是一个普通参数。",
  ["Four letters. It also builds maps and channels."] = "四个字母。它也用来创建 map 和 channel。",
  ["Four letters. It answers the question 'what type is this'. isinstance(x, float) is the check you use in code."] = "四个字母。它回答“这是什么类型”。写代码时用 isinstance(x, float) 来检查。",
  ["Four letters. It counts the group down; Add counted it up."] = "四个字母。它把这一组减一；Add 是加一。",
  ["Four letters. Let go of it now instead of at the end of scope."] = "四个字母。现在就放手，不等作用域结束。",
  ["Four letters. Like std::mem::take: gives you the value, puts the default (None) back."] = "四个字母。和 std::mem::take 一样：把值给你，把默认值（None）放回去。",
  ["Four letters. Not copied: the heap buffer changed hands."] = "四个字母。不是复制：堆上的缓冲区换了主人。",
  ["Four letters. Take it, do not borrow it."] = "四个字母。拿走它，不要借。",
  ["Four letters. The From trait gives it to you. to_string() does the same job."] = "四个字母。From trait 送给你的。to_string() 干的是同一件事。",
  ["Four letters. The block gets one from the operating system, like a file in /dev/shm."] = "四个字母。这块内存从操作系统那里得到一个，像 /dev/shm 里的一个文件名。",
  ["Four letters. The borrowing one. into_ in front of it would consume the Vec."] = "四个字母。借用的那个。前面加 into_ 就会消耗掉 Vec。",
  ["Four letters. The channel is closed when the context is finished, so every watcher wakes at once."] = "四个字母。context 结束时这条 channel 会被关闭，所以每个观察者同时醒来。",
  ["Four letters. The opposite of None."] = "四个字母。None 的反面。",
  ["Four letters. The same keyword that opens a block of methods, used as a type."] = "四个字母。和开启方法块的是同一个关键字，这里当类型用。",
  ["Four letters. The same rule Go applies to a local variable you never read."] = "四个字母。和 Go 对一个从不读取的局部变量用的是同一条规则。",
  ["Four letters. The same word that starts an implementation block."] = "四个字母。和开启实现块的是同一个词。",
  ["Four letters. The same word you put in the attribute over the function."] = "四个字母。和你写在函数上方属性里的是同一个词。",
  ["Four letters. The word that follows if. The block must diverge: return, break, panic."] = "四个字母。跟在 if 后面的那个词。块必须发散：return、break、panic。",
  ["Four letters. Threads use the same word to wait for each other."] = "四个字母。线程互相等待用的也是这个词。",
  ["Four letters. What Rust does for you at the end of every scope, called by hand."] = "四个字母。Rust 在每个作用域结束时替你做的事，手动调用。",
  ["Four letters. What you do to a menu."] = "四个字母。你对菜单做的事。",
  ["Four letters. What you do to a paper napkin, over and over, into one small square."] = "四个字母。对一张纸巾反复做的事，直到变成一个小方块。",
  ["Four letters. What you do to the drawer at closing time."] = "四个字母。关店时你对抽屉做的事。",
  ["Four letters. What you do with a parcel."] = "四个字母。你对包裹做的事。",
  ["Four letters. Where two roads meet again."] = "四个字母。两条路重新汇合的地方。",
  ["Four letters. fork gives one lazily, spawn makes one from the pickle. Either way it is not yours."] = "四个字母。fork 惰性地给你一份，spawn 则从 pickle 造一份。无论哪种，它都不是你那份。",
  ["Four letters: a look at the top. Returns Option<&T>, hence the * and the unwrap."] = "四个字母：看一眼堆顶。返回 Option<&T>，所以有 * 和 unwrap。",
  ["Four letters: else and if squeezed into one word."] = "四个字母：else 和 if 挤成一个词。",
  ["Four letters: make it neat. Run it before every commit."] = "四个字母：把它整理干净。每次提交前都跑一遍。",
  ["Four letters: my, and the language's first two. pyright is the other common one."] = "四个字母：my，加上这门语言的前两个字母。pyright 是另一个常见的。",
  ["Four letters: the one after this one. Rust's iterator method has the same name."] = "四个字母：这一个之后的那一个。Rust 的迭代器方法同名。",
  ["Four letters: to clean up. The error message itself tells you the command."] = "四个字母：整理。错误信息本身就告诉了你命令。",
  ["Four letters: what the threads finally are, and what the build is called."] = "四个字母：线程终于变成了那样，也是这个构建的名字。",
  ["Four quests: BASIC, ADVANCED, DELIVERY, CODE RUSH. Q switches."] = "四个任务：基础、进阶、外卖、代码冲刺。Q 切换。",
  ["Four recursive calls, each O(1) plus its own flood: every cell is sunk once, so the whole grid is O(rows * cols)."] = "四次递归调用，每次 O(1) 加上各自的洪泛：每格只沉一次，所以整张网格是 O(rows * cols)。",
  ["Four workers, many eggs, no hand-made threads. Which executor from concurrent.futures?"] = "四个工人，很多鸡蛋，不手动开线程。concurrent.futures 的哪个执行器？",
  ["Fprintf writes to any io.Writer: files, buffers, network, ResponseWriter."] = "Fprintf 写到任何 io.Writer：文件、缓冲区、网络、ResponseWriter。",
  ["Free the tray right now, before the end of the block. Which function?"] = "现在就释放托盘，不等块结束。哪个函数？",
  ["From a str. Two words with an underscore, like the FromStr trait in lowercase."] = "从 str 来。两个词加下划线，像 FromStr trait 的小写版。",
  ["From m to the end. a[:m] and a[m:] cover the slice exactly once."] = "从 m 到末尾。a[:m] 和 a[m:] 恰好覆盖整个 slice 一次。",
  ["Functions and Option"] = "函数与 Option",
  ["Functions and returns"] = "函数与返回值",
  ["Futures need a runtime. Which attribute makes main async on tokio?"] = "Future 需要运行时。哪个属性让 main 在 tokio 上变成 async？",
  ["GO SET  -  the walk"] = "GO SET  -  步行",
  ["GO plus the word for not public, all capitals. A comma-separated list of path globs."] = "GO 加上表示不公开的那个词，全部大写。以逗号分隔的路径通配符清单。",
  ["GO, then the three letters of the file, all capitals. It walks up from the current directory."] = "GO，再加文件名那三个字母，全部大写。它从当前目录一路向上找。",
  ["GOMAXPROCS(0) reports without changing it. Thousands of goroutines still exist; only this many are running Go code at any instant."] = "GOMAXPROCS(0) 只报告，不修改。几千个 goroutine 依然存在；只是任一瞬间在跑 Go 代码的就这么多。",
  ["GOPATH still exists as the download cache ($GOPATH/pkg/mod) and the go install bin dir, but your code lives wherever you like."] = "GOPATH 还在，只是作为下载缓存（$GOPATH/pkg/mod）和 go install 的 bin 目录，你的代码想放哪就放哪。",
  ["GOPRIVATE sets GONOPROXY and GONOSUMDB together: those modules skip the proxy and the checksum database, and their hashes go only in your go.sum."] = "GOPRIVATE 同时设置了 GONOPROXY 和 GONOSUMDB：这些模块跳过代理和校验和数据库，它们的哈希只进你自己的 go.sum。",
  ["GOPROXY, GOPRIVATE, ssh"] = "GOPROXY、GOPRIVATE、ssh",
  ["Generators and iterators"] = "生成器与迭代器",
  ["Generics and trait bounds"] = "泛型与 trait 约束",
  ["Generics, embedding, closures"] = "泛型、嵌入、闭包",
  ["Generics. Say <T> and tell the compiler what T can do."] = "泛型。写 <T>，再告诉编译器 T 能做什么。",
  ["Get the guard so you can change the counter. Which method?"] = "拿到守卫才能改计数器。哪个方法？",
  ["Get, Put and evict all O(1): that is the whole point of the LRU question."] = "Get、Put 和淘汰全是 O(1)：这就是 LRU 这道题的全部意义。",
  ["Get: a hit becomes the most recently used. Which list method moves the node to the front?"] = "Get：命中就成为最近使用的。哪个链表方法把节点移到最前？",
  ["Give me a pipe. Send on one end, I receive on the other."] = "给我一根管子。一头发送，另一头我接收。",
  ["Give the ETA call two seconds and no more. Which constructor?"] = "给取 ETA 的调用两秒，不能再多。用哪个构造函数？",
  ["Give the error a human message for {}. Which fmt trait?"] = "给错误一条 {} 用的人类可读信息。哪个 fmt trait？",
  ["Give the future room for one result so a lost caller cannot strand the goroutine."] = "给这个 future 留一个结果的位置，免得没人来取时把 goroutine 困住。",
  ["Give the opened file a name inside the block. Which keyword?"] = "在代码块里给打开的文件起个名字。哪个关键字？",
  ["Give up after one second. Fill: case <-time.___(time.Second)"] = "一秒后放弃。填空：case <-time.___(time.Second)",
  ["Gives index and value. The blank _ throws the index away."] = "给出索引和值。空白标识符 _ 把索引丢掉。",
  ["Global Interpreter Lock, by its initials."] = "Global Interpreter Lock 的首字母。",
  ["Global Interpreter Lock, said as one word."] = "Global Interpreter Lock，合成一个词说出来。",
  ["Go + routine. Not a full OS thread. The scheduler parks them."] = "Go + routine。不是完整的 OS 线程。调度器会把它们挂起。",
  ["Go 1.21 has a builtin for the smaller of two numbers."] = "Go 1.21 有一个取两数较小值的内置函数。",
  ["Go 1.21 wraps that pattern and caches the result. Which sync helper?"] = "Go 1.21 把这个模式包起来，还缓存了结果。是哪个 sync 助手？",
  ["Go 1.21-1.23: slices, maps, min, iterators"] = "Go 1.21-1.23：slices、maps、min、迭代器",
  ["Go 1.22 loops over a plain number. Fill: for i := ___ 3"] = "Go 1.22 可以直接对一个数字循环。填：for i := ___ 3",
  ["Go finds the nearest go.mod above you. A second go.mod in a subdirectory starts a different module, which is almost never what you meant."] = "Go 会找你上方最近的那个 go.mod。子目录里再放一个 go.mod 就开始了另一个模块，几乎从来不是你想要的。",
  ["Go had goroutines. Where is the go keyword?"] = "Go 有 goroutine。go 关键字在哪？",
  ["Go has no async and no await, on purpose. A goroutine plus a buffered channel is a future: go starts it, <-ch awaits it. The runtime parks a goroutine that blocks on I/O and runs another on the same OS thread, so ordinary blocking code is already asynchronous. errgroup runs a batch and returns the first error; runtime.NumGoroutine() shows the ones you forgot to stop."] = "Go 没有 async，也没有 await，这是故意的。一个 goroutine 加一条带缓冲的 channel 就是 future：go 启动它，<-ch 等待它。运行时会把阻塞在 I/O 上的 goroutine 泊起来，在同一条 OS 线程上跑另一个，所以普通的阻塞式代码本身已经是异步的。errgroup 跑一批并返回第一个错误；runtime.NumGoroutine() 会照出你忘了停的那些。",
  ["Go has no set type; a map to this type is the idiom. struct{} also works."] = "Go 没有 set 类型；映射到这个类型的 map 是惯用法。struct{} 也行。",
  ["Go has no while. Which keyword loops while i < 8?"] = "Go 没有 while。哪个关键字在 i < 8 时循环？",
  ["Go has one loop: for. if needs no parentheses. range walks a slice."] = "Go 只有一种循环：for。if 不需要括号。range 遍历 slice。",
  ["Go has structs and methods. Here the method gets self by hand?"] = "Go 有 struct 和方法。这里方法要自己接 self？",
  ["Go never converts numbers silently. Type name, then parentheses. 64-bit float."] = "Go 从不悄悄转换数字。类型名加括号。64 位浮点数。",
  ["Go never leaves a variable uninitialized. Numbers start here."] = "Go 从不让变量未初始化。数字从这里开始。",
  ["Go returns errors. Python throws them. Catch the one you expect, let the rest fly."] = "Go 返回错误。Python 抛出错误。捕获你预期的那个，其余的让它飞。",
  ["Go spells every loop for; Python has this second word for the condition-only loop."] = "Go 把所有循环都写成 for；Python 为只看条件的循环准备了这第二个词。",
  ["Go, Chef! Same seven rounds as this afternoon. The memo one is a one-liner in Python."] = "加油，厨师！和下午一样七个回合。memo 那题在 Python 里就一行。",
  ["Go, Mei! I did this show at lunch. The memo one gets everybody."] = "加油 Mei！我中午上过这个节目。memo 那题谁都中招。",
  ["Goroutines"] = "Goroutine",
  ["Goroutines, then. What is the Python word?"] = "那就是 goroutine 了。Python 里叫什么？",
  ["Graphs: BFS and DFS"] = "图：BFS 和 DFS",
  ["Greater than or equal. With > alone, g[g.len()] would panic."] = "大于等于。只用 >，g[g.len()] 会 panic。",
  ["Greedy fails on coins {1,3,4} for 6 (4+1+1). DP tries every last coin and finds 3+3."] = "硬币 {1,3,4} 凑 6 时贪心会失败（4+1+1）。DP 试遍每个最后一枚硬币，找到 3+3。",
  ["Grill and Wok are different sizes. What element type lets one Vec hold both?"] = "Grill 和 Wok 大小不同。哪个元素类型能让一个 Vec 同时装下两者？",
  ["Grill promises to be a Cook. Complete the header."] = "Grill 承诺成为 Cook。补全头部。",
  ["Grill, wok, steamer. Every station must answer name() and greet()."] = "烤架、炒锅、蒸笼。每个工位都要回答 name() 和 greet()。",
  ["Group an item name and a quantity under one named type. Which keyword?"] = "把商品名和数量归到一个有名字的类型下。哪个关键字？",
  ["Group name and price in one type. Which keyword?"] = "把名字和价格放进一个类型。哪个关键字？",
  ["Grow a slice by one hash brown. Which built-in?"] = "给 slice 多加一个薯饼。哪个内置函数？",
  ["HERE"] = "这里",
  ["HIDE"] = "隐藏",
  ["HINT"] = "提示",
  ["Half-open [lo, hi): loop while lo < hi, no off-by-one."] = "半开区间 [lo, hi)：当 lo < hi 时循环，不会差一。",
  ["Halve the gap. (lo+hi)/2 can overflow in other languages; this form never does."] = "把差距对半。(lo+hi)/2 在其他语言可能溢出；这种写法永远不会。",
  ["Halve, halve, halve, then zip the halves back together. Ties go left."] = "对半、对半、再对半，然后像拉链一样把两半并回去。打平的取左边。",
  ["Halving gives log n levels. Integer division: 5 / 2 is 2, and that is fine."] = "对半分给出 log n 层。整数除法：5 / 2 等于 2，这没问题。",
  ["Hand both values back to the caller. Which keyword?"] = "把两个值都交还给调用者。哪个关键字？",
  ["Hand out one bowl at a time and pause. Which keyword makes a function a generator?"] = "一次交出一碗然后暂停。哪个关键字让函数变成生成器？",
  ["Hand the total back to the caller. Which keyword?"] = "把总数交回给调用者。哪个关键字？",
  ["Hand the value to one owner over a channel and there is nothing to lock. The order belongs to whoever received it."] = "通过 channel 把值交给唯一的拥有者，就没有什么要锁的了。订单属于收到它的那一方。",
  ["Handle + Func. Plain Handle takes an http.Handler value instead."] = "Handle 加 Func。单独的 Handle 接收的是 http.Handler 值。",
  ["HandleFunc maps a path to func(w, r). Fprintf(w) replies. ListenAndServe runs."] = "HandleFunc 把路径映射到 func(w, r)。Fprintf(w) 回复。ListenAndServe 运行。",
  ['HandleFunc registers on the default mux. Go 1.22 routes can say "GET /order/{id}".'] = 'HandleFunc 注册到默认 mux。Go 1.22 的路由可以写 "GET /order/{id}"。',
  ["Hash brown on one burner. Muffin on another. Both at once."] = "薯饼在一个炉头。松饼在另一个。同时进行。",
  ["Hash maps, chars and counts"] = "哈希表、字符和计数",
  ["HashMap: O(1) average, O(n) worst case when everything collides. BTreeMap is O(log n) but ordered."] = "HashMap：平均 O(1)，全部碰撞时最差 O(n)。BTreeMap 是 O(log n) 但有序。",
  ["HashMap<u32, Vec<u32>>: O(1) to find a station, then its neighbours in order. g[&n] panics on a missing key; get returns Option."] = "HashMap<u32, Vec<u32>>：O(1) 找到一个站，然后按顺序看它的邻居。g[&n] 遇到不存在的键会 panic；get 返回 Option。",
  ["HashSet: one O(1) insert per guest, O(n) total. Fifty million checks become ten thousand."] = "HashSet：每位客人一次 O(1) insert，总共 O(n)。五千万次检查变成一万次。",
  ["Have we seen the partner of x? Fill the lookup: seen[target-x]"] = "x 的搭档见过了吗？填查找：seen[target-x]",
  ["Height is one plus the taller child. Which built-in picks the taller?"] = "高度是一加上更高的子节点。哪个内置函数挑出更高的？",
  ["Height is one plus the taller subtree. Fill: 1 + max(height(n.Left), height(n.___))"] = "高度是较高子树加一。填空：1 + max(height(n.Left), height(n.___))",
  ["Hello, Python"] = "你好，Python",
  ["Hello, Rust"] = "你好，Rust",
  ["Hints document types without enforcing them: def f(x: int) -> str. list[str], dict[str, float], Optional[str]. mypy checks them before you run."] = "标注记录类型但不强制：def f(x: int) -> str。list[str]、dict[str, float]、Optional[str]。mypy 在运行前检查它们。",
  ["How big a batch each worker collects per trip. One word, no underscore."] = "每个 worker 每趟收多大一批。一个词，没有下划线。",
  ["How many goroutines may run Go code at the same instant? Which setting?"] = "同一瞬间可以有多少个 goroutine 在跑 Go 代码？是哪个设置？",
  ["How many items are in prices? Which method returns a usize?"] = "prices 里有几项？哪个方法返回 usize？",
  ["How many items are in the slice right now? Which built-in?"] = "slice 现在有多少个元素？哪个内置函数？",
  ["How many items fit before append must reallocate? Which built-in?"] = "append 必须重新分配之前能装多少个？哪个内置函数？",
  ["How many trays? Which built-in counts a list?"] = "有几个托盘？哪个内置函数数列表？",
  ["How many workers? Ask the machine. Which function?"] = "开多少个 worker？问机器。用哪个函数？",
  ["How much room does the belt have in total? Which builtin?"] = "这条传送带总共有多少位置？用哪个内建函数？",
  ["I copied the threading code, changed one word, and the script started itself forever."] = "我照抄了 threading 的代码，改了一个词，脚本就开始无穷无尽地启动自己。",
  ["I do not want to tag a release every time I change a line. Point it at my folder."] = "我不想每改一行就打一个发布标签。让它指向我的文件夹吧。",
  ["I gave the photo job eight threads. The fan spun up and the clock did not move."] = "我给这个照片任务开了八条线程。风扇转起来了，时钟没动过。",
  ["I made the repo private and go get says 404, even though I can clone it fine."] = "我把仓库设成私有了，go get 就说 404，可我自己 clone 明明没问题。",
  ["If dp[amount] never dropped below the marker, no combination works. What does the function return then?"] = "如果 dp[amount] 从没降到标记值以下，就没有任何组合可行。那时函数返回什么？",
  ["If no combination reaches the amount, its cell still holds the sentinel. Return what?"] = "如果没有任何组合能凑出金额，它的格子仍是哨兵值。返回什么？",
  ["If the amount is still infinite, no coins reach it. What does the function return then?"] = "如果金额仍是无穷大，没有硬币能凑到它。那时函数返回什么？",
  ["If the guest leaves, cancel. The fryer stops."] = "客人走了就取消。炸锅停下。",
  ["If there is a loop the fast runner laps the slow one. O(1) memory."] = "如果有环，快的会追上慢的。O(1) 内存。",
  ["If you miss the word, write it yourself. Fill the body of Await."] = "要是你想念那个词，就自己写一个。把 Await 的函数体填上。",
  ["Import from GitHub"] = "从 GitHub 导入",
  ["Import the package from main.go. Write the whole path."] = "从 main.go 导入这个包。写出完整路径。",
  ["In Go I would write a json tag. Show me the Rust way."] = "在 Go 里我会写 json tag。给我看看 Rust 的做法。",
  ["In Go this was three pointers. In Rust, who owns the next node?"] = "在 Go 里这是三个指针。在 Rust 里，下一个节点归谁所有？",
  ["In JavaScript I would write await fetchMenu(). Go's editor does not even know the word."] = "换成 JavaScript 我就写 await fetchMenu()。Go 的编辑器连这个词都不认识。",
  ["In Rust the compiler stops you. In Go nothing stops you, so the race detector is the compiler you run at test time."] = "在 Rust 里编译器会拦住你。在 Go 里没人拦你，所以竞态检测器就是你在测试时运行的那个编译器。",
  ["In Rust, if gives back a value. No ternary needed. The gate forgot its else."] = "在 Rust 里 if 会返回值。不需要三目运算符。闸门忘了写 else。",
  ["In a {start, end} pair, the end is the second element."] = "在 {start, end} 对里，终点是第二个元素。",
  ["In order, smallest to largest. The line above the search does it."] = "有序，从小到大。查找上面那一行就是在做这件事。",
  ["In real code None is more honest. key in self.d is O(1): a hash lookup."] = "真实代码里 None 更诚实。key in self.d 是 O(1)：一次哈希查找。",
  ["In real code: sort a slice of structs by price. Fill: sort.___(orders, func(i, j int) bool {...})"] = "实际代码：按价格给 struct slice 排序。填空：sort.___(orders, func(i, j int) bool {...})",
  ["In-order on a BST yields sorted output. Pre-order (self first) copies a tree; post-order (self last) frees one."] = "BST 的中序遍历产出有序输出。前序（先自己）复制一棵树；后序（自己最后）释放一棵。",
  ["In-order on a BST yields sorted output. Pre-order: node first. Post-order: node last."] = "BST 中序遍历输出有序。前序：节点在前。后序：节点在后。",
  ["In-order walk: left subtree, this node, then which subtree? That gives sorted output."] = "中序遍历：左子树、这个节点，然后是哪棵子树？这样输出才有序。",
  ["Inclusive count from l to r: the difference, plus one."] = "从 l 到 r 的闭区间个数：差值加一。",
  ["Increment a counter without a mutex. Which package? ___.AddInt64(&count, 1)"] = "不用 mutex 给计数器加一。哪个包？___.AddInt64(&count, 1)",
  ["Indexes start at 0, so the last one is one less than the count. len itself is O(1): Go keeps it in the slice header."] = "索引从 0 开始，所以最后一个比数量少一。len 本身是 O(1)：Go 把它存在切片头里。",
  ["Indexes start at 0, so the last one is the length less one. One character."] = "索引从 0 开始，所以最后一个是长度减一。一个字符。",
  ["Insert at the recent end and get the new node back."] = "在最近端插入，并拿回新节点。",
  ["Inside Lucky Mac Express the kitchen runs on Rust threads. Earn the tea set."] = "幸运麦 Express 的厨房靠 Rust 线程运转。赢得下午茶套餐。",
  ["Inside Lucky Mac the kitchen runs on goroutines. Earn the morning set."] = "幸运麦的厨房靠 goroutine 运转。赢得早餐套餐。",
  ["Inside a workspace every listed module is built from disk, so a change in luckymac is seen by cousinshop on the next build. go.work is for your machine; do not commit it."] = "在工作区里，每个列出的模块都从磁盘构建，所以 luckymac 里的改动下一次构建时 cousinshop 就能看到。go.work 是给你的机器用的；别提交它。",
  ["Is ErrCold anywhere in that chain? Fill: errors.___(err, ErrCold)"] = "ErrCold 在那条链里吗？填：errors.___(err, ErrCold)",
  ["Is a name in the Vec? Without a set you must look at each one. Which iterator adapter stops at the first match?"] = "名字在 Vec 里吗？没有集合就得逐个看。哪个迭代器适配器在第一个匹配处停下？",
  ["Is a name in the list? Python has a keyword for it, but on a list it scans. Which keyword?"] = "名字在列表里吗？Python 有一个关键字，但对列表它会扫描。哪个关键字？",
  ["Is a name in the slice? Without a map you must look at each one. Which keyword walks the slice?"] = "名字在切片里吗？没有 map 就得逐个看。哪个关键字遍历切片？",
  ['Is muffin on the list? Fill: slices.___(names, "muffin")'] = 'muffin 在列表里吗？填：slices.___(names, "muffin")',
  ["Is the ETA Some and under 10 minutes, in one call, no unwrap? Which Option method?"] = "ETA 是 Some 且小于 10 分钟，一次调用，不 unwrap？哪个 Option 方法？",
  ["It appended to its own copy. Nothing crosses a process boundary unless you send it."] = "它 append 的是自己那个副本。你不发送，就没有东西越得过进程边界。",
  ["It closes over n. Inner func, outer variable."] = "它闭合了 n。内层 func，外层变量。",
  ["It did not fall over. It just made the kitchen printer thrash. Give me a queue and a few workers."] = "它没垮。只是让厨房打印机疯了。给我一条队列和几个 worker 就行。",
  ['It is an error, not a warning, so dead imports never pile up. goimports adds and removes them for you; _ "pkg" keeps one only for its init side effect.'] = '它是错误而不是警告，所以死掉的 import 永远不会堆积。goimports 替你增删；_ "pkg" 只为它的 init 副作用而保留。',
  ["It is an operating-system semaphore under the hood, so it works across processes. Like a Queue, it must be created in the parent and passed down."] = "它底下是一个操作系统信号量，所以跨进程也管用。和 Queue 一样，它必须在父进程里创建再传下去。",
  ["It returns the *Element the map needs. An existing key is an update plus a touch, not a second node."] = "它返回 map 需要的 *Element。已存在的键是更新加一次触碰，而不是第二个节点。",
  ["It runs on your laptop. Make it build on the shop's machine."] = "它在你笔记本上能跑。让它在店里的机器上也能构建。",
  ["It's DFS, Mei, same as the MTR round, but the neighbours are up, down, left, right. Mind the usize!"] = "是 DFS，Mei，和港铁那一回合一样，只是邻居是上下左右。小心 usize！",
  ["It's fib in a hat, Chef. Then the coin one: fewest coins for the exact change."] = "就是戴了帽子的 fib，厨师。然后是硬币题：凑出正好的零钱，硬币最少。",
  ["It's fib with a table instead of a memo. Bottom up, Mei. No recursion, no stack overflow."] = "就是用表代替 memo 的 fib。自底向上，Mei。不用递归，不会栈溢出。",
  ["It's the graph round in disguise, Bo. Sink every island as you find it, and count the finds."] = "这是乔装的图论回合，Bo。找到一座岛就沉一座，数一数找到了几座。",
  ["Iterator::eq compares two iterators without building a String. chars() walks Unicode scalars, not bytes."] = "Iterator::eq 比较两个迭代器，不用造一个 String。chars() 走的是 Unicode 标量，不是字节。",
  ["Iterators and closures"] = "迭代器与闭包",
  ["JoinHandle<T>: T is what the closure returns, here (). Drop the handle and the thread is detached, still running."] = "JoinHandle<T>：T 是闭包的返回值，这里是 ()。丢掉句柄，线程就分离了，仍在运行。",
  ["Jumps to the next iteration. break would leave the loop entirely."] = "跳到下一次迭代。break 会直接跳出整个循环。",
  ["Just the size, no coefficient. 2n, 3n and n/2 are all the same order."] = "只有大小，没有系数。2n、3n 和 n/2 都是同一阶。",
  ["Just the size, no coefficient. 2n, 3n and n/2 are the same order."] = "只有大小，没有系数。2n、3n 和 n/2 是同一阶。",
  ["Just the sum. Adding a semicolon would turn it into a statement and return ()."] = "只写和。加上分号就变成语句，返回 ()。",
  ["Kadane's algorithm: O(n), one pass, two variables. A negative prefix is never worth keeping."] = "Kadane 算法：O(n)，一趟，两个变量。负的前缀永远不值得保留。",
  ["Kadane's algorithm: O(n), one pass, two variables. A negative run never helps, so it is dropped."] = "Kadane 算法：O(n)，一趟，两个变量。负的一段永远没帮助，所以被丢掉。",
  ["Kadane's algorithm: a negative run is worth dropping. O(n) time, O(1) space, no nested loop."] = "Kadane 算法：负的一段值得丢掉。O(n) 时间，O(1) 空间，没有嵌套循环。",
  ["Kadane: at each x, extend the run or restart at x, keep the best. A fixed window adds the newcomer and drops a[i-k]. Two pointers only move right: O(n) for the longest substring without repeats."] = "Kadane：在每个 x 处，延续当前段或从 x 重新开始，记录最优。固定窗口加上新来的，去掉 a[i-k]。双指针只向右移动：无重复最长子串是 O(n)。",
  ["Kadane: cur = max(x, cur + x), best = max(best, cur). A fixed window adds one and drops one. A growing window moves l forward until the window is clean again."] = "Kadane：cur = max(x, cur + x)，best = max(best, cur)。固定窗口加一个丢一个。可增长的窗口把 l 往前移，直到窗口再次干净。",
  ["Kadane: cur = x.max(cur + x). A fixed window adds the new item and drops the old one. A growing window moves its left end while a HashSet says repeat. Two pointers walk in from both ends of a sorted slice."] = "Kadane：cur = x.max(cur + x)。定长窗口加入新元素、丢掉旧元素。变长窗口在 HashSet 说有重复时移动左端。双指针从有序切片的两端向中间走。",
  ["Keep a AND give b its own copy of the text. Which method?"] = "保留 a，同时给 b 一份自己的文本副本。哪个方法？",
  ["Keep a tiny heap of the k biggest. Whatever falls out was never the answer."] = "只留一个装着 k 个最大值的小堆。掉出去的从来都不是答案。",
  ["Keep only paid orders. Which adapter takes a bool closure?"] = "只保留已付款的订单。哪个适配器接收返回 bool 的闭包？",
