  ["Kth largest: keep a min-heap of the k largest so far. When it grows past k, which heap call drops the smallest?"] = "第 k 大：维护一个存放目前最大 k 个值的最小堆。超过 k 时，哪个 heap 调用丢掉最小的？",
  ["LAND"] = "横屏",
  ["LEVEL UP!  LV %d"] = "升级！  LV %d",
  ["LRU cache"] = "LRU 缓存",
  ["LRU: a HashMap for the values and a VecDeque for recency, fresh at the back, stale at the front. get moves the key to the back. put evicts the front when full, then inserts. The O(1) version swaps the VecDeque for a linked list."] = "LRU：HashMap 存值，VecDeque 存新旧顺序，新的在后，旧的在前。get 把键移到最后。put 在满时淘汰最前面的，再插入。O(1) 版本把 VecDeque 换成链表。",
  ["LRU: a map from key to *list.Element plus a container/list in recency order. Get moves the node to the front, Put pushes a new one at the front, over capacity evicts l.Back() from both the list and the map. Every operation O(1)."] = "LRU：一张从键到 *list.Element 的 map，加一个按最近使用顺序排列的 container/list。Get 把节点移到最前，Put 在最前压入新节点，超出容量就把 l.Back() 从链表和 map 里一起淘汰。每个操作都是 O(1)。",
  ["LRU: least recently used goes first. OrderedDict remembers order: move_to_end on every use, popitem(last=False) evicts the oldest. get and put are O(1). functools.lru_cache is the built-in."] = "LRU：最久未使用的先走。OrderedDict 记得顺序：每次使用就 move_to_end，popitem(last=False) 淘汰最老的。get 和 put 都是 O(1)。functools.lru_cache 是内置的那个。",
  ["LV %d   XP %d / %d"] = "LV %d   XP %d / %d",
  ["LV %d  ·  %d XP  ·  %d badges"] = "LV %d  ·  %d XP  ·  %d 个徽章",
  ["Last board of the night, Python column. Same question: input doubles, then what?"] = "今晚最后一块白板，Python 栏。同一个问题：输入翻倍，然后呢？",
  ["Last customers before the shutter. The queue script decides who gets a bowl."] = "关门前最后几位客人。排队脚本决定谁能吃到一碗。",
  ["Last one. A map of Victoria Harbour as ones and zeros. How many islands?"] = "最后一题。维多利亚港的地图，用一和零表示。有几座岛？",
  ["Last ticket. Code review. Every match with one arm and an early return gets a modern spelling."] = "最后一张工单。代码审查。每个只有一个分支加提前返回的 match 都换成现代写法。",
  ["Laying out a repo"] = "给仓库排布局",
  ["Least recently used. A map for the values and a queue for the order; every get is a touch."] = "最久未使用的那个。一个 map 存值，一个队列存顺序；每次 get 都算一次触碰。",
  ["Leave note out of the JSON when it is empty. Fill the tag option."] = "note 为空时不放进 JSON。填 tag 选项。",
  ["Leave the function early when n is 0. Which keyword?"] = "n 是 0 时提前离开函数。哪个关键字？",
  ["Leave the note out of the JSON when it is None. Which attribute?"] = "note 是 None 时就不要写进 JSON。哪个属性？",
  ["Left, node, right: a BST walked in order comes out sorted. if let on &Link needs no unwrap."] = "左、根、右：中序遍历 BST，出来就是有序的。对 &Link 用 if let 不需要 unwrap。",
  ["Left, self, then which side, to print the values in sorted order?"] = "左、自己，然后哪一边，才能按排好的顺序打印值？",
  ["Left: the same row, one column back."] = "左：同一行，往回一列。",
  ["Len, Less, Swap take a value; Push and Pop take a pointer because they resize the slice."] = "Len、Less、Swap 用值接收者；Push 和 Pop 用指针，因为它们要改变切片大小。",
  ["Less than or equal. With a strict < equal items would swap order and the sort would not be stable."] = "小于或等于。用严格的 < 相等的项会交换顺序，排序就不稳定了。",
  ["Less than or equal: the equal case is the touching pair."] = "小于等于：相等的情况就是相接的那对。",
  ["Less than, or equal. A strict < would take the right one on a tie and break stability."] = "小于，或者等于。严格的 < 在打平时会取右边，破坏稳定性。",
  ["Let ? turn a ParseIntError into OrderError by itself. Which trait do you implement?"] = "让 ? 自己把 ParseIntError 变成 OrderError。你要实现哪个 trait？",
  ["Let count() read the String without taking it. Which symbol goes before the type?"] = "让 count() 读 String 而不拿走它。类型前面放哪个符号？",
  ["Let println! print the whole struct with {:?}. Which attribute word generates Debug?"] = "让 println! 用 {:?} 打印整个 struct。哪个属性词生成 Debug？",
  ["Let serde write the JSON code for the struct. Which trait goes with Deserialize?"] = "让 serde 替 struct 写 JSON 代码。哪个 trait 和 Deserialize 配对？",
  ["Level by level with a deque: take from the front. Which method?"] = "用 deque 逐层：从前面取。哪个方法？",
  ["Lifetimes"] = "生命周期",
  ["Like %v, but with w for wrap. errors.Unwrap gets the inner error back."] = "像 %v，但用 w 表示 wrap。errors.Unwrap 能取回里面的 error。",
  ["Like fmt.Errorf but on t. Fatalf would stop this test at once."] = "像 fmt.Errorf，但在 t 上。Fatalf 会立刻终止这个测试。",
  ["Like last(), with the suffix every mutable borrow in std carries."] = "像 last()，加上 std 里每个可变借用都带的后缀。",
  ["Like unwrap, but with your own panic message. Which method?"] = "像 unwrap，但带你自己的 panic 消息。哪个方法？",
  ["Linear time"] = "线性时间",
  ["Linear: the work grows in step with the input. A one-word built-in is still a loop underneath."] = "线性：工作量随输入同步增长。一个词的内置函数底下仍然是一个循环。",
  ["Linear: the work grows in step with the input. Iterator chains hide the loop but not the cost."] = "线性：工作量随输入同步增长。迭代器链藏起了循环，藏不起代价。",
  ["Linear: the work grows in step with the input. Write it with a capital O and the size in brackets."] = "线性：工作量随输入同步增长。用大写 O 和括号里的大小写出来。",
  ["Linked list without pointers"] = "不用裸指针的链表",
  ["Linked list: reverse, cycle"] = "链表：反转、环",
  ["Linked lists"] = "链表",
  ["Listen, And, Serve. Returns only on error, hence log.Fatal."] = "Listen、And、Serve。只在出错时返回，所以用 log.Fatal。",
