  ["Lists and slices"] = "列表与切片",
  ["Load and Store are the read and write. Reading the field directly is a data race even for one int."] = "Load 和 Store 就是读和写。直接读那个字段，哪怕只是一个 int，也是数据竞态。",
  ["Lock a shared counter. Fill the type: var mu sync.___"] = "给共享计数器上锁。填类型：var mu sync.___",
  ["Lock then defer Unlock, on the next line, always. A lock released only on the happy path is a deadlock waiting for the first error."] = "Lock 之后紧接着一行 defer Unlock，永远这样。只在顺利路径上释放的锁，就是在等第一个 error 的死锁。",
  ["Lock; defer Unlock is the pattern. A forgotten Unlock deadlocks the next caller."] = "Lock；defer Unlock 是固定模式。忘了 Unlock，下一个调用者就死锁。",
  ["Locks, Value and Manager"] = "锁、Value 和 Manager",
  ["Log each total the moment it lands, in any order. Which helper?"] = "每个总数一到就立刻记下来，不管顺序。用哪个助手？",
  ["Logarithmic time"] = "对数时间",
  ["Logarithmic: O of the logarithm of n. The base does not matter in Big O."] = "对数：n 的对数的 O。在 Big O 里底数无关紧要。",
  ["Long bounds go under the signature. Which keyword starts that clause?"] = "长约束写在签名下面。哪个关键字开头那个子句？",
  ["Longest run of distinct bytes: a window [l, r] and a HashSet of what is inside. When b[r] is already in, drop from the left until it is not. Which HashSet method removes?"] = "最长的不重复字节序列：一个窗口 [l, r] 加一个记录窗口内容的 HashSet。b[r] 已在其中时，从左边丢弃直到不在为止。哪个 HashSet 方法负责移除？",
  ["Longest run with no repeated dish. When c is already in the window, drop from the left until it is not. Which set method?"] = "没有重复菜品的最长一段。c 已经在窗口里时，从左边丢，直到它不在为止。哪个 set 方法？",
  ["Longest substring without a repeat: remember where each char was last seen. What is stored under last[c]?"] = "无重复最长子串：记住每个字符上次出现的位置。last[c] 里存的是什么？",
  ["Look at the load: one core at 100, seven asleep. That is not a threading bug, that is the design."] = "看看负载：一个核 100，七个在睡。这不是线程的 bug，这就是设计。",
  ["Look the answer up before computing. Fill the comma-ok test: if v, ok := memo[n]; ___"] = "计算之前先查答案。填 comma-ok 检查：if v, ok := memo[n]; ___",
