  ["Max subarray: extend the current run with x, or restart at x alone. Fill the second choice."] = "最大子数组：用 x 延长当前这段，或者从 x 单独重新开始。填第二个选项。",
  ["Maybe a String, maybe nothing. Which return type?"] = "也许是 String，也许什么都没有。哪个返回类型？",
  ["Meeting rooms: sort starts and ends separately. A start reuses a room when the earliest end is already over. Fill the test."] = "会议室：起点和终点分别排序。最早的终点已经结束时，新的起点就复用一间房。填上判断。",
  ["Mei"] = "Mei",
  ["Memoization: check the map before computing. fib(90) becomes instant."] = "记忆化：计算前先查 map。fib(90) 瞬间完成。",
  ["Memoized recursion is DP from the top. Same O(n), but the call stack is n deep: RecursionError near 1000."] = "记忆化递归就是从顶部做 DP。同样 O(n)，但调用栈有 n 层：接近 1000 会 RecursionError。",
  ["Merge intervals"] = "合并区间",
  ["Merge intervals, meeting rooms"] = "合并区间，会议室",
  ["Merge sort and binary search"] = "归并排序与二分查找",
  ["Merge sort has log n levels of splitting. Merging all the pieces on one level costs how much?"] = "归并排序有 log n 层拆分。合并一层的所有碎片要多少代价？",
  ["Merge sort recurses on both halves. Fill: merge(mergeSort(a[:m]), mergeSort(a[___]))"] = "归并排序对两半都递归。填空：merge(mergeSort(a[:m]), mergeSort(a[___]))",
  ["Merge sort splits in the middle. Which operator gives a whole-number midpoint?"] = "归并排序从中间分开。哪个运算符给出整数中点？",
  ["Merge sort: split at len // 2, sort both halves, merge with <=. sorted and list.sort take key=. bisect finds a slot in a sorted list in O(log n)."] = "归并排序：在 len // 2 处分开，两半各自排序，用 <= 合并。sorted 和 list.sort 接收 key=。bisect 用 O(log n) 在有序列表里找位置。",
  ["Merge sort: split_at(len / 2), sort both, merge with <= for stability. In practice: sort_by_key, sort_unstable, binary_search."] = "归并排序：split_at(len / 2)，两半各排一遍，用 <= 合并以保持稳定。实战里用：sort_by_key、sort_unstable、binary_search。",
  ["Merge two sorted halves: take from the left while its item is no bigger. Which comparison keeps the sort stable?"] = "合并两个有序的一半：左边的项不更大时取左边。哪个比较让排序稳定？",
  ["Merge two sorted halves: take the smaller head and advance that side. Fill: ___++"] = "合并两个有序半段：取较小的头，那一边前进。填空：___++",
  ["Merging two sorted halves. On a tie take from the left, so equal items keep their order. Which comparison?"] = "合并两个有序的半边。打平时取左边，相等的元素就保持原来的顺序。用哪个比较？",
  ["Method calls bind tighter than +, so it is 1 + (left.max(right)). Round two clean. Combo x2."] = "方法调用比 + 结合得更紧，所以是 1 + (left.max(right))。第二回合干净利落。连击 x2。",
  ["Methods are written in a separate block. Which keyword opens it?"] = "方法写在单独的块里。哪个关键字开头？",
  ["Midnight edition of CODE RUSH! Python round. Chef Bo at the keyboard. Factorial, then fib. Buzzer's live!"] = "CODE RUSH 午夜场！Python 回合。Bo 厨师坐键盘。阶乘，然后 fib。蜂鸣器开了！",
  ["Min of the k largest is the kth largest. Top-k frequent is the same loop over a count map."] = "k 个最大值里的最小值就是第 k 大。前 k 高频是同样的循环，套在计数 map 上。",
  ["Modern Rust idioms"] = "现代 Rust 惯用法",
  ["Module error, trait of the same name with a capital. Every method has a default."] = "模块叫 error，trait 同名但首字母大写。每个方法都有默认实现。",
  ["Module path plus directory equals import path. That is the whole rule, and it is why a module named after its repo just works from anywhere."] = "模块路径加目录等于导入路径。规则就这一条，也是为什么按仓库命名的模块在任何地方都能直接用。",
  ["Module path plus directory is the import path. Fill the path of the menu package."] = "模块路径加目录就是导入路径。填上 menu 包的路径。",
  ["Modules and the go tool"] = "module 与 go 工具",
  ["More than k inside: the smallest cannot be the kth largest. Which function removes the root?"] = "里面超过 k 个：最小的不可能是第 k 大。哪个函数移除堆顶？",
  ["More than k inside: the smallest, on top, has to go. Which method removes the top?"] = "堆里超过 k 个：堆顶那个最小的得走。哪个方法移除堆顶？",
  ["Morning set. Don't show him your laptop bugs."] = "早餐套餐。别给他看你笔记本上的 bug。",
  ["Morning set. Lucky Mac. The kiosk on the door is stuck on a Go bug."] = "早餐套餐。Lucky Mac。门口的自助机卡在一个 Go bug 上。",
  ["Most tree questions are this shape: nil returns a base value, else combine both sides."] = "大多数树题都是这个形状：nil 返回基准值，否则合并两边。",
  ["Move it to the recent end of the list, which is the front. One method, three words."] = "把它移到链表的最近端，也就是最前面。一个方法，三个单词。",
  ["Move next out, flip the arrow, push node onto prev. No take() needed: while let moved cur into node. prev is the new head."] = "把 next 移出来，掉转箭头，把 node 接到 prev 上。不需要 take()：while let 已经把 cur 移进了 node。prev 就是新的头。",
  ["Muffin ready, or hash brown, or timeout. Pick one."] = "松饼好了，或薯饼好了，或超时。选一个。",
