  ["Mutual exclusion, shortened to five letters. lock() gives a guard; the guard unlocks on drop."] = "mutual exclusion（互斥），缩成五个字母。lock() 给你一个 guard；guard 在 drop 时解锁。",
  ["Mutual exclusion. Capital M. In package sync."] = "互斥。大写 M。在 sync 包里。",
  ["My cousin's shop wants your menu package. He typed the GitHub path into an import and it just downloaded."] = "我表哥的店想要你的 menu 包。他把 GitHub 路径敲进 import，就这么下载下来了。",
  ["My first version started one goroutine per order. Forty thousand orders, forty thousand goroutines."] = "我的第一版是每张订单一个 goroutine。四万张订单，四万个 goroutine。",
  ["NEXT"] = "下一个",
  ["NEXT >"] = "下一步 >",
  ["NICE!"] = "漂亮！",
  ["NIGHT OWL"] = "夜猫子",
  ["NIGHT SHIFT  -  the kitchen"] = "NIGHT SHIFT  -  厨房",
  ["Name the module after the repo it will live in. Fill the path."] = "按它将来所在的仓库给模块起名。填上路径。",
  ["Named after a paperclip assistant from old office software. Six letters, double p."] = "名字来自老办公软件里的回形针助手。六个字母，两个 p。",
  ["Named types, assertions, type switch"] = "命名类型、断言、type switch",
  ["Negative indexes count from the end. Go would panic on this."] = "负索引从末尾数起。Go 遇到这个会 panic。",
  ["Negative indexing counts from the end; the last item is one back."] = "负下标从末尾数起；最后一项是倒数第一个。",
  ["Nested loops multiply their sizes. Two different letters, a star between them."] = "嵌套循环把它们的大小相乘。两个不同的字母，中间一个星号。",
  ["Newer Go has helpers for that. Lunch is on the house."] = "新版 Go 有现成的辅助函数。午餐店里请。",
  ["Next of Next. The loop condition already checked fast.Next is not nil."] = "Next 的 Next。循环条件已确认 fast.Next 不为 nil。",
  ["Night shift. Every station runs a Python script I wrote. Tonight none of them start."] = "夜班。每个岗位都跑一个我写的 Python 脚本。今晚一个都启动不了。",
  ["Nine letters, 'to count off'. Go gives you the index for free in range; Python asks you to wrap the list."] = "九个字母，“逐个数出”。Go 在 range 里免费给你索引；Python 让你把列表包起来。",
  ["Nine letters, a railway signal. Go builds the same thing from a buffered channel."] = "九个字母，一种铁路信号机。Go 用带缓冲的 channel 造出同样的东西。",
  ["Nine letters. To number things one by one. zip() pairs two iterators instead."] = "九个字母。给东西逐个编号。zip() 则是把两个迭代器配对。",
  ["Nine letters. go test -bench=. runs them."] = "九个字母。go test -bench=. 运行它们。",
  ["No allocation, O(1): the node is relinked in place. Value is an any, so the type assertion unpacks the entry."] = "不分配内存，O(1)：节点就地重新链接。Value 是 any，所以类型断言把 entry 解出来。",
  ["No eggs left: stop the order with an error. Which keyword throws?"] = "鸡蛋没了：用一个错误停止订单。哪个关键字抛出？",
  ["No garbage collector, and it still knows when to free the tray?"] = "没有垃圾回收器，还知道什么时候释放托盘？",
  ["No input reference to borrow from. Which lifetime does a literal string have?"] = "没有可借用的输入引用。字符串字面量有哪个生命周期？",
  ["No nested loops. A window slides; the answer updates as it goes."] = "不许嵌套循环。窗口滑过去；答案边走边更新。",
  ["No nil in Rust. If a value may be missing, the type says Option."] = "Rust 没有 nil。值可能缺失，类型就写 Option。",
  ["No nil. Every failure is a value you must look at."] = "没有 nil。每次失败都是一个你必须查看的值。",
  ["No note on the order yet. Which value means 'nothing here'?"] = "订单上还没有备注。哪个值表示“这里什么都没有”？",
  ["No overlap, or out is still empty: the current interval starts a new block. Which Vec method appends it?"] = "不重叠，或者 out 还是空的：当前区间另起一块。哪个 Vec 方法把它追加进去？",
  ["No overlap: cur starts a new merged interval. Fill the builtin."] = "不重叠：cur 开启一个新的合并区间。填上内置函数。",
  ["No partner yet: remember this value and where it was. What is stored under seen[x]?"] = "还没有搭档：记住这个值和它的位置。seen[x] 下面存什么？",
  ["Nobody told it to stop. Nothing in Go kills a goroutine from outside."] = "没人叫它停。在 Go 里没有东西能从外面杀死一个 goroutine。",
  ["Node contains Node. The compiler needs a fixed size, so the child lives on the heap behind which pointer?"] = "Node 里面又包含 Node。编译器需要固定大小，所以子节点放在堆上，藏在哪个指针后面？",
  ["None is a value, not a null pointer. Read it with match or if let Some(s) = seat(t). The board lights up."] = "None 是一个值，不是空指针。用 match 或 if let Some(s) = seat(t) 读取。外卖板亮了。",
  ["None is the base case: put a fresh leaf there. The Some arms recurse. Match ergonomics let n be &mut Box<Node>."] = "None 就是 base case：在那里放一片新叶子。Some 分支继续递归。match ergonomics 让 n 成为 &mut Box<Node>。",
  ["None is the one value of NoneType. A function with no return gives None too."] = "None 是 NoneType 唯一的值。没有 return 的函数也返回 None。",
  ["None marks an empty subtree. Every tree function starts with: if node is None."] = "None 标记空子树。每个树函数都从 if node is None 开始。",
  ["None on an empty out falls to the _ arm and pushes. The borrow ends with the match, so out.push is allowed there."] = "out 为空时返回 None，落到 _ 分支去 push。借用随 match 结束，所以那里允许 out.push。",
  ["None terminates the list. Walk with while node: and stop when it is falsy."] = "None 终止链表。用 while node: 遍历，为假时停下。",
  ["Not TODO (that is a placeholder). The empty, never-cancelled root."] = "不是 TODO（那是占位符）。空的、永不取消的根。",
  ["Not equal. The statement before ; runs first, and err lives only inside the if."] = "不等于。; 之前的语句先运行，err 只存在于这个 if 里。",
  ["Not null, not None. Three letters. The only zero for interfaces with no type."] = "不是 null，也不是 None。三个字母。没有类型的 interface 唯一的零值。",
  ["Not quite. Read the hint and try again. HINT again shows the answer."] = "不太对。看看提示再试一次。再按提示会显示答案。",
  ["Not struct. Variants, one of which carries the ParseIntError inside."] = "不是 struct。有变体，其中一个内部装着 ParseIntError。",
  ["Not the stack. The other one, the one the garbage collector sweeps."] = "不是栈。是另一边，垃圾回收器打扫的那一边。",
  ["Nothing runs yet. Which method actually starts the thread?"] = "还什么都没运行。哪个方法真正启动线程？",
  ["Nothing tells parse which type to build. Say i32 with the turbofish."] = "没有东西告诉 parse 要造哪个类型。用 turbofish 说出 i32。",
  ["Now collect the number. Which method of the Future?"] = "现在把那个数字收回来。用 Future 的哪个方法？",
  ["Now the worker takes two arguments. Which method unpacks each tuple?"] = "现在 worker 要收两个参数。哪个方法把每个元组拆开？",
  ["Now wait for the answer. Write Go's await."] = "现在等这个答案。写出 Go 的 await。",
  ["Num, then the thing Go is famous for, singular."] = "Num，再加 Go 最出名的那样东西，单数。",
  ["Num, then the three letters on the chip."] = "Num，再加芯片上那三个字母。",
  ["Number in the brackets, then the element type. It cannot grow."] = "方括号里写数字，再加元素类型。它不能增长。",
  ["Number of islands"] = "岛屿数量",
  ["Number of islands: DFS on a grid"] = "岛屿数量：网格上的 DFS",
  ["Number the constants 0, 1, 2 automatically. Which identifier?"] = "自动给常量编号 0、1、2。哪个标识符？",
  ["Number the trays from 1 while looping. Which built-in pairs an index with each item?"] = "循环时从 1 开始给托盘编号。哪个内置函数把索引和每一项配对？",
  ["Numbers, strings, None"] = "数字、字符串、None",
  ["O(1) extra, near enough: the list is rearranged where it lives and sort() returns None to say so."] = "额外 O(1)，差不多：列表就在原位重排，sort() 返回 None 就是在说这个。",
  ["O(1) extra: pdqsort swaps within the slice. The input itself is never counted as extra space."] = "额外 O(1)：pdqsort 在切片内部交换。输入本身永远不算额外空间。",
  ["O(1) extra: pdqsort swaps within the slice. Vec::sort, the stable one, allocates an O(n) buffer instead."] = "额外 O(1)：pdqsort 在切片内部交换。稳定的那个 Vec::sort 反而会分配一个 O(n) 缓冲。",
  ["O(1) lookups need a map from key to its node in the list. Fill the value type."] = "O(1) 查找需要一张从键到它在链表中节点的 map。填上值类型。",
  ["O(1): a million items or ten, one multiply and one load. Written O(1), read 'order one'."] = "O(1)：一百万个还是十个，一次乘法一次加载。写作 O(1)，读作“order one”。",
  ["O(1): the OrderedDict is a doubly linked list plus a dict. The newest lives at the end, the oldest at the front."] = "O(1)：OrderedDict 是一个双向链表加一个 dict。最新的在末尾，最老的在最前。",
  ["O(1): the bounds check is one compare, the read one load, whatever n is. Read 'order one'."] = "O(1)：边界检查是一次比较，读取是一次加载，n 是多少都一样。读作“order one”。",
  ["O(1): the same number of steps however big the input. Indexing a Vec, a HashMap lookup, .last(). Doubling n changes nothing."] = "O(1)：无论输入多大，步数都一样。Vec 索引、HashMap 查找、.last()。n 翻倍什么都不变。",
  ["O(1): the same number of steps however big the input. Indexing a list, a dict lookup, items[-1]. Doubling n changes nothing."] = "O(1)：无论输入多大，步数都一样。列表索引、dict 查找、items[-1]。n 翻倍什么都不变。",
  ["O(1): the same number of steps however big the input. Indexing a slice, a map lookup, the last element. Doubling n changes nothing."] = "O(1)：无论输入多大，步数都一样。切片索引、map 查找、最后一个元素。n 翻倍什么都不变。",
  ["O(2^n). fib(35) already takes seconds in Python; fib(50) would take days. The worst curve on the board."] = "O(2^n)。Python 里 fib(35) 已经要好几秒；fib(50) 要好几天。白板上最差的曲线。",
  ["O(2^n). fib(40) is about a billion calls even in Rust; fib(50) would take a day. The worst curve on the board."] = "O(2^n)。就算是 Rust，fib(40) 也要大约十亿次调用；fib(50) 要一天。白板上最差的曲线。",
  ["O(2^n). fib(40) is about a billion calls; fib(50) would take a day. The worst curve on the board."] = "O(2^n)。fib(40) 大约十亿次调用；fib(50) 要一天。白板上最差的曲线。",
  ["O(2^n): the work doubles when n grows by one. Naive fib makes two calls per call. @functools.cache brings it to O(n). Listing every subset of n items is 2^n and cannot be helped."] = "O(2^n)：n 每加一，工作量翻倍。朴素的 fib 每次调用再调用两次。@functools.cache 把它降到 O(n)。列出 n 项的所有子集是 2^n，没法救。",
  ["O(2^n): the work doubles when n grows by one. Naive fib makes two calls per call. A HashMap memo brings it to O(n). Listing every subset of n items is 2^n and cannot be helped."] = "O(2^n)：n 每加一，工作量翻倍。朴素的 fib 每次调用再调用两次。HashMap memo 把它降到 O(n)。列出 n 项的所有子集是 2^n，没法救。",
  ["O(2^n): the work doubles when n grows by one. Naive fib makes two calls per call. A memo brings it to O(n). Listing every subset of n items is 2^n and cannot be helped."] = "O(2^n)：n 每加一，工作量翻倍。朴素的 fib 每次调用再调用两次。memo 把它降到 O(n)。列出 n 项的所有子集是 2^n，没法救。",
  ["O(amount * coins). Each cell asks: which last coin gives the fewest in total?"] = "O(amount * coins)。每个格子都在问：最后一枚选哪种硬币，总数最少？",
  ["O(amount * coins). Greedy fails here: coins [1, 3, 4] for 6 is two coins, not 4 + 1 + 1."] = "O(amount * coins)。贪心在这里会失败：硬币 [1, 3, 4] 凑 6 是两枚，不是 4 + 1 + 1。",
  ["O(amount * coins). The greedy 'biggest coin first' fails for coins like 1, 3, 4 and amount 6; the table does not."] = "O(amount * coins)。贪心的“先用最大硬币”在硬币 1、3、4 凑 6 时会失败；表不会。",
  ["O(log k) per push. Python's heapq is a min-heap only; for a max-heap push -x."] = "每次 push O(log k)。Python 的 heapq 只有最小堆；要最大堆就 push -x。",
  ["O(log n) per search. Sorting first pays off after the first few lookups. The sorting hat is done."] = "每次查找 O(log n)。先排序，查几次之后就回本。分类帽完成。",
  ["O(log n) stack frames on average. Every axis on the board has a name now. Alex takes the O(1) stamp."] = "平均 O(log n) 个栈帧。白板上的每条轴现在都有了名字。Alex 拿到 O(1) 印章。",
  ["O(log n) stack frames on average. Every axis on the board has a name. Mei takes the O(1) stamp for the Rust round."] = "平均 O(log n) 个栈帧。白板上的每条轴都有了名字。Mei 拿到 Rust 回合的 O(1) 印章。",
  ["O(log n) stack frames on average. Every axis on the last board has a name. The Python round takes the O(1) stamp; the night is over."] = "平均 O(log n) 个栈帧。最后一块白板上的每条轴都有了名字。Python 回合拿到 O(1) 印章；今晚结束。",
  ["O(log n). Balanced trees, heaps and skip lists live here too. It is the second-best cost after O(1)."] = "O(log n)。平衡树、堆和跳表也住在这里。它是 O(1) 之后第二好的代价。",
  ["O(log n). Err(i) even tells you where to insert. BTreeMap and BinaryHeap live at the same cost."] = "O(log n)。Err(i) 甚至告诉你该插在哪里。BTreeMap 和 BinaryHeap 住在同样的代价上。",
  ["O(log n). heapq lives at the same cost per push and pop. The second-best cost after O(1)."] = "O(log n)。heapq 每次 push 和 pop 也是同样的代价。O(1) 之后第二好的代价。",
  ["O(log n): each step halves what is left. Binary search on a sorted slice: 1024 items in 10 steps, a million in 20. Needs sorted input."] = "O(log n)：每一步把剩下的减半。有序切片上的二分查找：1024 项 10 步，一百万项 20 步。需要有序输入。",
  ["O(log n): each step halves what is left. bisect on a sorted list: 1024 items in 10 steps, a million in 20. Needs sorted input."] = "O(log n)：每一步把剩下的减半。有序列表上的 bisect：1024 项 10 步，一百万项 20 步。需要有序输入。",
  ["O(log n): each step halves what is left. slice::binary_search on a sorted Vec: 1024 items in 10 steps, a million in 20. Needs sorted input."] = "O(log n)：每一步把剩下的减半。有序 Vec 上的 slice::binary_search：1024 项 10 步，一百万项 20 步。需要有序输入。",
  ["O(n log k) time, O(k) space: better than sorting all n when k is small."] = "O(n log k) 时间，O(k) 空间：k 很小时比把 n 个全排序更好。",
  ["O(n log n) for the sort; everything after is O(n). Lists sort by first element anyway, so shifts.sort() works here too."] = "排序 O(n log n)；之后全是 O(n)。列表本来就按第一个元素排，所以 shifts.sort() 在这里也行。",
  ["O(n log n), and after it every overlap sits next to its neighbour. slices.SortFunc does the same in Go 1.21."] = "O(n log n)，之后每处重叠都挨着邻居。Go 1.21 的 slices.SortFunc 做的是同一件事。",
  ["O(n log n), and it dominates: the merge walk after it is O(n). mut iv lets the function sort in place."] = "O(n log n)，而且它占主导：之后的合并遍历是 O(n)。mut iv 让函数能就地排序。",
  ["O(n log n). A million items: about 20 million comparisons, not a trillion. The proven lower bound for comparison sorts."] = "O(n log n)。一百万项：大约两千万次比较，不是一万亿。比较排序已被证明的下界。",
  ["O(n log n). A million items: about 20 million comparisons. The proven lower bound for comparison sorts."] = "O(n log n)。一百万项：大约两千万次比较。比较排序已被证明的下界。",
  ["O(n log n). A million items: about 20 million comparisons. Timsort is O(n) on already-sorted input, a bonus."] = "O(n log n)。一百万项：大约两千万次比较。Timsort 对已经有序的输入是 O(n)，算是奖励。",
  ["O(n log n): the cost of a good sort. Merge sort has log n levels, each doing O(n) work. sort, sort_unstable and sort_by_key all live here. Sort once, search many times."] = "O(n log n)：一次好排序的代价。归并排序有 log n 层，每层做 O(n) 的工作。sort、sort_unstable 和 sort_by_key 都住这里。排一次，查很多次。",
  ["O(n log n): the cost of a good sort. Merge sort has log n levels, each doing O(n) work. sort.Ints, sort.Strings and slices.Sort all live here. Sort once, search many times."] = "O(n log n)：一次好排序的代价。归并排序有 log n 层，每层做 O(n) 的工作。sort.Ints、sort.Strings 和 slices.Sort 都住这里。排一次，查很多次。",
  ["O(n log n): the cost of a good sort. Merge sort has log n levels, each doing O(n) work. sorted and list.sort are Timsort and live here. Sort once, search many times."] = "O(n log n)：一次好排序的代价。归并排序有 log n 层，每层做 O(n) 的工作。sorted 和 list.sort 是 Timsort，住在这里。排一次，查很多次。",
  ["O(n) instead of O(n * k): the sum is updated, never recomputed. Fixed windows are always this trick."] = "O(n) 而不是 O(n * k)：和是更新出来的，从不重算。固定窗口永远是这个套路。",
  ["O(n) per level times log n levels. That product is the whole reason n log n exists."] = "每层 O(n) 乘 log n 层。这个乘积就是 n log n 存在的全部原因。",
  ["O(n) time, O(n) table. Keep only the last two entries and it is O(1) space."] = "O(n) 时间，O(n) 表。只保留最后两项就是 O(1) 空间。",
  ["O(n) with a dict instead of O(n^2) with two loops. Check before storing so x does not pair with itself."] = "用 dict 是 O(n)，而不是两个循环的 O(n^2)。先检查再存储，x 就不会和自己配对。",
  ["O(n). Big O keeps only the fastest-growing term and drops its coefficient. Sequential loops add; nested loops multiply."] = "O(n)。Big O 只保留增长最快的项，并丢掉它的系数。先后的循环相加；嵌套的循环相乘。",
  ["O(n). Every element is touched once. The most common cost in everyday code, and often the best possible."] = "O(n)。每个元素碰一次。日常代码里最常见的代价，往往也是可能的最好。",
  ["O(n). Memoization trades O(n) memory for the exponential time. The biggest win in this whole quest."] = "O(n)。记忆化用 O(n) 内存换掉指数时间。整个任务里最大的胜利。",
  ["O(n). Memoization trades O(n) memory for the exponential time. The single biggest win in this whole quest."] = "O(n)。记忆化用 O(n) 内存换掉指数时间。整个任务里最大的一次胜利。",
  ["O(n). Merge sort needs the same: an O(n) scratch buffer for merging. Python's sorted() copies too."] = "O(n)。归并排序也需要同样的：一个用于合并的 O(n) 临时缓冲。Python 的 sorted() 也会复制。",
  ["O(n). Rust makes the cost visible: clone() is a word you have to type. Python's sorted() copies silently."] = "O(n)。Rust 让代价看得见：clone() 是你必须亲手敲的词。Python 的 sorted() 悄悄复制。",
  ["O(n). Sequential passes add and the constant drops. Nested passes multiply: that is the next street but one."] = "O(n)。先后的遍历相加，常数丢掉。嵌套的遍历相乘：那是下下条街。",
  ["O(n). Sequential passes add and the constant drops. Nested passes multiply: that is two streets on."] = "O(n)。先后的遍历相加，常数丢掉。嵌套的遍历相乘：那是两条街之后。",
  ["O(n). sorted() always copies; a.sort() never does. Choose by whether you still need the original order."] = "O(n)。sorted() 总是复制；a.sort() 从不复制。按你是否还需要原来的顺序来选。",
  ["O(n). sum, map, filter, count: every adapter is one pass. Zero-cost abstractions are still O(n) abstractions."] = "O(n)。sum、map、filter、count：每个适配器都是一次遍历。零成本抽象仍然是 O(n) 的抽象。",
  ["O(n). sum, max, min, any, all, list.count: every one is a pass. Faster in C, same order."] = "O(n)。sum、max、min、any、all、list.count：每一个都是一次遍历。在 C 里更快，阶数相同。",
  ["O(n): one pass over the input; double n, double the work. A range loop, a sum, a scan for a value. O(n) + O(n) is still O(n): constants drop."] = "O(n)：对输入走一遍；n 翻倍，工作量翻倍。一个 range 循环、一次求和、一次找值扫描。O(n) + O(n) 仍然是 O(n)：常数丢掉。",
  ["O(n): one pass over the input; double n, double the work. iter().sum(), any(), Vec::contains. O(n) + O(n) is still O(n): constants drop."] = "O(n)：对输入走一遍；n 翻倍，工作量翻倍。iter().sum()、any()、Vec::contains。O(n) + O(n) 仍然是 O(n)：常数丢掉。",
  ["O(n): one pass over the input; double n, double the work. sum, max, x in list. O(n) + O(n) is still O(n): constants drop."] = "O(n)：对输入走一遍；n 翻倍，工作量翻倍。sum、max、x in list。O(n) + O(n) 仍然是 O(n)：常数丢掉。",
  ["O(n*m). Only when both loops run over the same n does it collapse to n^2. The seating chart is fixed."] = "O(n*m)。只有两个循环都遍历同一个 n 时才会坍缩成 n^2。座位表修好了。",
  ["O(n^2). Double the guests, four times the checks. Bubble sort and selection sort live here too."] = "O(n^2)。客人翻倍，检查四倍。冒泡排序和选择排序也住这里。",
  ["O(n^2): a loop inside a loop over the same n. Comparing every pair. 100 items is 4950 pairs; 10,000 is fifty million. A HashSet turns most of these into O(n)."] = "O(n^2)：同一个 n 的循环里再套一个循环。比较每一对。100 项是 4950 对；10,000 项是五千万。用 HashSet 能把大多数变成 O(n)。",
  ["O(n^2): a loop inside a loop over the same n. Comparing every pair. 100 items is 4950 pairs; 10,000 is fifty million. A map turns most of these into O(n)."] = "O(n^2)：同一个 n 的循环里再套一个循环。比较每一对。100 项是 4950 对；10,000 项是五千万。用 map 能把大多数变成 O(n)。",
  ["O(n^2): a loop inside a loop over the same n. Comparing every pair. 100 items is 4950 pairs; 10,000 is fifty million. A set turns most of these into O(n)."] = "O(n^2)：同一个 n 的循环里再套一个循环。比较每一对。100 项是 4950 对；10,000 项是五千万。用 set 能把大多数变成 O(n)。",
  ["OK"] = "好",
  ["Octopus tap. The gate function returns ok, err."] = "拍八达通。闸机函数返回 ok, err。",
  ["Off the map on any side: stop. Fill the width the column index is checked against."] = "任何一边出了地图：停。填列下标要对照的宽度。",
  ["Ok(2). On an unsorted slice the result is meaningless, so sort first. Err(i) is where to insert to stay sorted."] = "Ok(2)。在没排序的切片上结果毫无意义，所以先排序。Err(i) 是保持有序时该插入的位置。",
  ["Old tutorials talk about GOPATH. What is GO111MODULE since Go 1.16?"] = "老教程都在讲 GOPATH。从 Go 1.16 起 GO111MODULE 是什么？",
  ["Once, plus the word for what a function gives back. There is a two-result twin for (T, error)."] = "Once，加上表示函数返回值的那个词。还有一个处理 (T, error) 的双结果孪生版本。",
  ["One CPython process runs bytecode under a global interpreter lock, so eight threads doing arithmetic still use one core. The GIL is released around I/O and inside C extensions, which is why threads help downloads and not sums. multiprocessing sidesteps it: every process has its own interpreter and its own lock."] = "一个 CPython 进程在全局解释器锁之下运行字节码，所以八条线程做算术仍然只用一个核。GIL 在 I/O 前后以及 C 扩展内部会被释放，这就是线程帮得了下载、帮不了求和的原因。multiprocessing 绕开了它：每个进程都有自己的解释器和自己的锁。",
  ["One HashSet method adds m and tells you whether it was new. Which one?"] = "有个 HashSet 方法既加入 m，又告诉你它是不是新的。是哪个？",
  ["One Unicode character in single quotes. Which type?"] = "单引号里的一个 Unicode 字符。是哪种类型？",
  ["One cargo command builds the crate and starts it. Which word?"] = "一条 cargo 命令编译 crate 并启动它。哪个词？",
  ["One character passes the error straight back to the caller. Which?"] = "一个字符把错误直接传回调用方。哪个？",
  ["One character, the ampersand. The call site already uses it."] = "一个字符，& 符号。调用处已经在用它。",
  ["One character, the one in an email address. Rust uses it for attributes with #[...] instead."] = "一个字符，电子邮件地址里那个。Rust 改用 #[...] 属性。",
  ["One character. Go and Rust use two slashes; Python uses the hash sign."] = "一个字符。Go 和 Rust 用两条斜线；Python 用井号。",
  ["One character. The same one that returns Err early in a Result function."] = "一个字符。和在 Result 函数里提前返回 Err 的是同一个。",
  ["One character. The same underscore Go uses to throw a value away."] = "一个字符。和 Go 用来丢弃值的下划线一样。",
  ["One cook, one thread. The grill must not wait for the kettle."] = "一个厨师，一个线程。烤架不能等水壶。",
  ["One counter, changed by many threads. Which wrapper allows only one writer at a time?"] = "一个计数器，多个线程修改。哪个包装一次只允许一个写者？",
  ["One decorator remembers every result by argument. Which one, from functools?"] = "一个装饰器按参数记住每个结果。functools 里的哪一个？",
  ["One directory is one package: every .go file in it says the same package name, normally the directory's. Only identifiers that start with a capital letter are visible from outside. You import a package by its full path, module path plus directory, never by a relative path, and an import you do not use is a compile error."] = "一个目录就是一个包：里面每个 .go 文件都写同一个包名，通常就是目录名。只有以大写字母开头的标识符才对外可见。导入一个包要用完整路径，模块路径加目录，绝不能用相对路径，而导入了不用就是编译错误。",
  ["One function for muffin or hash brown. Don't copy-paste."] = "松饼和薯饼共用一个函数。别复制粘贴。",
  ["One go.mod at the root"] = "根目录只有一个 go.mod",
  ["One less than n. fact(n) would never terminate."] = "n 减一。fact(n) 永远不会终止。",
  ["One less than n. u64 cannot go below zero, which is why the base case checks <= 1."] = "比 n 小一。u64 不能低于零，所以 base case 才检查 <= 1。",
  ["One less than zero. Go spells the same thing items[len(items)-1]."] = "零减一。Go 把同样的东西写成 items[len(items)-1]。",
  ["One letter in front of Lock. Its partner is RUnlock."] = "在 Lock 前面加一个字母。它的搭档是 RUnlock。",
  ["One letter: the loop variable. Each goroutine owns exactly one slot."] = "一个字母：循环变量。每个 goroutine 只拥有一个格子。",
  ["One line: 'open' when bowls remain, otherwise 'closed'. Which keyword completes the conditional expression?"] = "一行：还有碗就 'open'，否则 'closed'。哪个关键字补全这个条件表达式？",
  ["One loop over n prices, adding each: what is the cost in Big O?"] = "一个循环遍历 n 个价格，逐个相加：用 Big O 说代价是多少？",
  ["One main.go with nine hundred lines. Time to split it into packages, and the first question is what to call the module."] = "一个九百行的 main.go。该拆成包了，第一个问题是模块叫什么。",
  ["One megabyte every process can map. Which class from multiprocessing.shared_memory?"] = "一兆字节，每个进程都能映射。multiprocessing.shared_memory 的哪个类？",
  ["One more than the amount itself: no real answer uses more coins than the amount."] = "比金额本身多一：真实答案用的硬币数不会超过金额。",
  ["One pass, Bo. Keep the run if it's still helping, drop it the moment it isn't."] = "一趟扫过，Bo。这一段还有帮助就留着，一没帮助就立刻丢掉。",
  ["One pass, one HashMap: O(n) instead of the O(n^2) double loop. seen[&want] then fetches the partner's index."] = "一趟，一个 HashMap：O(n)，不用 O(n^2) 的双重循环。然后 seen[&want] 取出搭档的下标。",
  ["One pass, one map: O(n). Store after checking so x does not pair with itself."] = "一次遍历，一个 map：O(n)。先查再存，x 才不会和自己配对。",
  ["One pass. If the running total goes negative, it can only hurt: start again."] = "一趟扫过。累计总和一旦变负，只会拖累：重新开始。",
  ["One pointer per node: singly linked. Two (Prev) makes it doubly linked."] = "每个节点一个指针：单链表。两个（加 Prev）就是双链表。",
  ["One printer, eight cooks"] = "一台打印机，八个厨师",
  ["One put crashes with TypeError. What must everything on the queue be?"] = "有一次 put 抛了 TypeError。放上队列的一切必须是怎样的？",
  ["One slash. On integers Rust truncates, so no floor operator is needed. lo + (hi-lo)/2 avoids overflow."] = "一条斜线。对整数 Rust 会截断，所以不需要向下取整运算符。lo + (hi-lo)/2 避免溢出。",
  ["One slash. On ints Go rounds toward zero, so no floor operator is needed."] = "一条斜线。对 int Go 向零舍入，所以不需要向下取整运算符。",
  ["One ticket rail: the front sends boxed jobs, the cooks receive them. Which mpsc function makes the (tx, rx) pair?"] = "一条挂单轨：前台发出装箱的任务，厨师们接收。哪个 mpsc 函数造出 (tx, rx) 这一对？",
  ["One tray, one owner. Hand it over and it is gone. Lend it with & and you keep it."] = "一个托盘，一个主人。交出去就没了。用 & 借出去，还是你的。",
  ["One type, several ways an order can fail. Which keyword declares it?"] = "一个类型，订单失败的几种方式。哪个关键字声明它？",
  ["One word, no underscore: the largest size the cache may reach. None means unbounded."] = "一个词，没有下划线：缓存可达到的最大大小。None 表示无上限。",
  ["One writer at the printer. Which multiprocessing primitive?"] = "打印机前一次只能有一个写者。用哪个 multiprocessing 原语？",
  ["Only four riders out at a time. Complete the release at the end of the trip."] = "同一时间只有四个骑手在外面。把送完之后的归还补完。",
  ["Only land spreads the flood. Which byte marks land in the grid?"] = "只有陆地会传播洪水。网格里哪个字节表示陆地？",
  ["Only land spreads. Which cell value means a building?"] = "只有陆地会扩散。哪个格子值表示楼？",
  ["Only names that start with a capital letter leave their package. Which fmt function prints a line?"] = "只有大写字母开头的名字才能走出自己的包。fmt 里哪个函数打印一行？",
  ["Only one move reaches the first step: a single step of one."] = "只有一种走法能到第一级：跨一步。",
  ["Only the sender closes. Sending after this panics."] = "只有发送方关闭。之后再发送会 panic。",
  ["Only the sender should call it. Never close from the receive side."] = "只应由发送方调用。绝不要在接收端关闭。",
  ["Only three workers may hit the payments API at once. Which primitive counts?"] = "同一时间只有三个 worker 可以打支付 API。用哪个会数数的原语？",
  ["Only types with this marker trait may move to another thread. Which one?"] = "只有带这个标记 trait 的类型才能移到另一个线程。哪一个？",
  ["Only useful inside defer. Returns nil if we are not panicking."] = "只在 defer 里有用。没有 panic 时返回 nil。",
  ["Open the file so it is closed no matter what happens inside. Which keyword?"] = "打开文件，让它不管里面发生什么都会被关闭。哪个关键字？",
  ["Open the middle, decide left or right, throw half away. The bisect module did it first."] = "翻开中间，决定左还是右，扔掉一半。bisect 模块早就做好了。",
  ["Open the middle, decide left or right, throw half away. The std library already wrote it."] = "翻开中间，决定左还是右，扔掉一半。std 库早就写好了。",
  ["Opposite of var. Compile error if you try to change it."] = "var 的反义。试图修改会编译错误。",
  ["Option does the empty case for free: a closer with nothing to pop is a mismatch, no extra if needed."] = "Option 免费处理了空栈的情况：右括号却无东西可 pop 就是不匹配，不需要额外的 if。",
  ["Option<Box<ListNode>>: each node owns the next, the last one holds None. Same size as a raw pointer."] = "Option<Box<ListNode>>：每个节点拥有下一个，最后一个装着 None。大小和裸指针一样。",
  ["Option<T> is an enum in the standard library, generic like your own types. No null anywhere in Rust."] = "Option<T> 是标准库里的 enum，和你自己的类型一样是泛型的。Rust 里哪儿都没有 null。",
  ["Option<u32> is an enum: Some(12) or None. The caller must handle both, so no nil crash."] = "Option<u32> 是个 enum：Some(12) 或 None。调用方必须两种都处理，所以不会有 nil 崩溃。",
  ["Option<usize> would be more Rust; the interview version returns -1. Either way: check the marker before trusting the cell."] = "Option<usize> 更有 Rust 味；面试版返回 -1。无论哪种：先检查标记值，再相信格子里的数。",
  ["Optional[str] is str | None. Rust's Option<String>, made visible to the checker."] = "Optional[str] 就是 str | None。Rust 的 Option<String>，让检查器看得见。",
  ["Order 18. Morning set. Don't forget to cancel the context."] = "18 号单。早餐套餐。别忘了取消 context。",
  ["Order is a struct. Point at it. The till talks through an interface."] = "Order 是 struct。用指针指向它。收银机通过 interface 沟通。",
  ["Orders come through the web now. Put a handler on /order."] = "订单现在从网页来了。给 /order 挂一个 handler。",
  ["Over capacity: the least recently used sits at the far end of the list. Which method finds it?"] = "超出容量：最久未使用的在链表的另一端。哪个方法找到它？",
  ["Overlap: the current interval starts no later than the last one ends. (1,3) and (3,5) touch and should merge. Which comparison?"] = "重叠：当前区间的起点不晚于上一个的终点。(1,3) 和 (3,5) 相接，应当合并。用哪个比较？",
  ["Overlaps are only neighbours once the intervals are ordered by start. Which Vec method sorts by a key closure?"] = "只有按起点排好序，重叠的区间才会挨在一起。哪个 Vec 方法按键闭包排序？",
  ["Owner says: ship before 18:00 and the dinner set is on the house."] = "老板说：18:00 前上线，晚餐套餐店里请。",
  ["Ownership and borrowing"] = "所有权与借用",
  ["PARALLEL  -  the night batch"] = "PARALLEL  -  夜间批处理",
  ["PARALLEL  ·  the night batch"] = "PARALLEL  ·  夜间批处理",
  ["PERFECT STREET"] = "完美一条街",
  ["PERFECT!"] = "完美！",
  ["POLYGLOT"] = "多语通",
  ["PORT"] = "竖屏",
  ["Package name and directory name are separate things that everyone keeps identical. Short, lowercase, no underscores: menu, not menuUtils."] = "包名和目录名是两回事，可所有人都让它们保持一致。短、小写、不带下划线：是 menu，不是 menuUtils。",
  ["Packages and imports"] = "包与导入",
  ["Palindrome with two pointers: i at the start, j at the end. Fill: j = len(s) ___ 1"] = "用两个指针判回文：i 在开头，j 在末尾。填：j = len(s) ___ 1",
  ["Palindrome: the chars read the same backwards. Which iterator method walks from the end?"] = "回文：字符倒着读也一样。哪个迭代器方法从末尾往回走？",
  ["Partial, then the word for ordering. Ord alone is too strict for f64."] = "Partial，然后是表示排序的词。光用 Ord 对 f64 来说太严。",
  ["Pause here until fetch has its answer, letting other tasks run. Which keyword?"] = "在这里暂停直到 fetch 有了答案，让其他任务运行。哪个关键字？",
  ["Pause this thread for 300 ms. Which function?"] = "让这个线程暂停 300 毫秒。哪个函数？",
  ["Pay() can fail. Check the error. Close the drawer with defer."] = "Pay() 可能失败。检查错误。用 defer 关抽屉。",
  ["Peek at the most recent opener without removing it. Which index?"] = "窥视最近的开括号但不移除。哪个下标？",
  ["Percival Street"] = "波斯富街",
  ["Percival Street at dawn. Walk if the crossing is clear, else wait. Go has no while: a for with a condition is the while."] = "黎明的波斯富街。路口没车就走，否则等。Go 没有 while：带条件的 for 就是 while。",
  ["Percival Street tram stop"] = "波斯富街电车站",
  ["Pick a branch by value without a chain of ifs. Which keyword?"] = "按值选分支，不用一串 if。哪个关键字？",
  ["Pick the bigger of a and b in one line. Which keyword starts the expression?"] = "一行选出 a 和 b 中较大的。哪个关键字开头？",
  ["Pipe() gives two Connection objects with send and recv. It is faster than a Queue and safe for exactly two processes."] = "Pipe() 给你两个带 send 和 recv 的 Connection 对象。它比 Queue 快，而且只对恰好两个进程是安全的。",
  ["Plain dicts keep insertion order since 3.7, but only this one has move_to_end and popitem(last=False)."] = "普通 dict 从 3.7 起就保持插入顺序，但只有这个有 move_to_end 和 popitem(last=False)。",
  ["Plain integers: equal values are indistinguishable, so stability is wasted. The faster in-place sort with no allocation?"] = "纯整数：相等的值根本分不出来，稳定性就浪费了。那个更快、原地、不分配内存的排序是哪个？",
  ["Plural of the type a single Unicode scalar has in Rust."] = "Rust 里单个 Unicode 标量值的类型，复数形式。",
  ["Point the current node backwards. Fill: cur.Next = ___"] = "让当前节点指回前一个。填空：cur.Next = ___",
  ["Point the import path at the folder next door while you work. Which directive?"] = "干活期间把导入路径指向隔壁的文件夹。哪个指令？",
  ["Pointer receiver to mutate or for big structs; value receiver for small read-only types."] = "要修改或 struct 很大时用指针接收者；小的只读类型用值接收者。",
  ["Pointer to the same struct type, like the tree node."] = "指向同一 struct 类型的指针，和树节点一样。",
  ["Pool: map, imap, starmap, chunks"] = "Pool：map、imap、starmap、分块",
  ["Price list is a map. Hash brown: 8 dollars."] = "价目表是个 map。薯饼：8 块。",
  ["Price now returns cents, not dollars: a breaking change. What does the module path gain?"] = "Price 现在返回分而不是元：破坏性变更。模块路径要加上什么？",
  ["Print every dish with its price. Which method walks the key-value pairs?"] = "把每道菜和价格一起打印。哪个方法遍历键值对？",
  ["Print the missing key from the error object. Which keyword binds the exception to a name?"] = "从错误对象打印缺失的键。哪个关键字把异常绑定到一个名字？",
  ["Print the struct with its field names. Which verb?"] = "连字段名一起打印 struct。哪个动词？",
  ["Print the values sorted: left subtree, node, right subtree. Fill the first call."] = "按序打印：左子树、节点、右子树。填第一个调用。",
  ["Print then ln. fmt.println with a small p does not exist outside fmt."] = "Print 加 ln。小写 p 的 fmt.println 在 fmt 之外不存在。",
  ["Problem five: search and sort. Binary search on a sorted slice with half-open bounds, then merge sort, the recursion every interviewer loves. And the one-liner from the library."] = "第五题：查找与排序。在有序 slice 上用半开区间做二分查找，然后是归并排序，面试官最爱的递归。还有标准库的一行代码。",
  ["Problem four: the order queue as a singly linked list. Reverse it in place with three pointers, then detect a cycle with two runners of different speed."] = "第四题：把订单队列做成单链表。用三个指针原地反转，再用快慢两个指针检测环。",
  ["Problem seven, the one they always ask: N workers pull jobs from a channel and push results. Get the close and the wait in the right order and the job is yours."] = "第七题，必考题：N 个 worker 从 channel 取任务并推送结果。close 和 wait 顺序对了，这份工作就是你的。",
  ["Problem six: the classics. Two numbers that add up to the set price, a palindrome check that handles CJK, and whether two dish names are anagrams."] = "第六题：经典题。两个数加起来等于套餐价，能处理中日韩文字的回文判断，以及两个菜名是否为变位词。",
  ["Problem three: walk the MTR graph. Breadth-first with a queue for shortest hops, depth-first with recursion for reachability. Both need a visited set."] = "第三题：遍历港铁图。用队列做广度优先求最少站数，用递归做深度优先判可达性。两者都需要已访问集合。",
  ["Problem two: a binary search tree of order numbers. Insert, walk in order, measure the height. In Go a tree is just a struct with two pointers and a nil at every leaf."] = "第二题：订单号的二叉搜索树。插入、中序遍历、量高度。在 Go 里树就是带两个指针的 struct，每片叶子都是 nil。",
  ["Process, start, join, __main__"] = "Process、start、join、__main__",
  ["ProcessPoolExecutor and choosing"] = "ProcessPoolExecutor 与怎么选",
  ["Processes share nothing, so everything travels: a multiprocessing.Queue is a pipe plus a feeder thread plus pickle at both ends. put and get carry any picklable object; a Pipe is the raw two-ended version. Workers stop on a sentinel, usually None, and a JoinableQueue lets the parent wait with task_done and join."] = "进程之间什么都不共享，所以样样都要运：一个 multiprocessing.Queue 是一条管道加一条喂料线程加两头的 pickle。put 和 get 能运走任何 picklable 的对象；Pipe 则是原始的两端版本。worker 见到哨兵值（通常是 None）就停，而 JoinableQueue 让父进程用 task_done 和 join 来等。",
  ["Pull a *RefundError out of the chain to read its fields. Fill: errors.___(err, &re)"] = "从链里取出一个 *RefundError 来读它的字段。填：errors.___(err, &re)",
  ["Pull a crate in from the terminal without editing the file by hand. Which subcommand?"] = "在终端里拉进一个 crate，不用手改文件。哪个子命令？",
  ["Pull exactly one bowl from the generator by hand. Which built-in?"] = "手动从生成器里拉出正好一碗。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Push appends through the pointer, because it must change the slice itself. Fill the receiver type."] = "Push 通过指针追加，因为它必须修改切片本身。填上接收者类型。",
  ["Push, Pop and Min all O(1): low[len(low)-1] is always the smallest thing still on the stack."] = "Push、Pop 和 Min 全是 O(1)：low[len(low)-1] 永远是栈里剩下的最小值。",
  ["Put a new key: a new node at the front, and its address in the map. Fill the list method."] = "Put 一个新键：在最前放一个新节点，并把它的地址存进 map。填上链表方法。",
  ["Python 3.13 ships an experimental build without the lock. What is it called?"] = "Python 3.13 提供了一个没有这把锁的实验性构建。它叫什么？",
  ["Python has no braces, Alex. The indentation is the block."] = "Python 没有大括号，Alex。缩进就是代码块。",
  ["Python ignores the rest of a line after which character?"] = "Python 会忽略哪个字符之后的整行？",
  ["Python's nothing, capital N. Go's nil pointer, Rust's Option::None."] = "Python 的“无”，大写 N。Go 的 nil 指针，Rust 的 Option::None。",
  ["Python's nothing, capitalised. One per worker, because each one eats exactly one."] = "Python 的「什么都没有」，首字母大写。每个 worker 一个，因为它们一人吃一个。",
  ["Q other quest"] = "Q 其他任务",
  ["Q: "] = "问：",
  ["QUEST %d"] = "任务 %d",
  ["QUEST CLEAR!"] = "任务完成！",
  ["Quadratic time"] = "二次时间",
  ["Quadratic: n squared. Write the power with a caret."] = "二次：n 的平方。用 ^ 写次方。",
  ["Queue board is stuck at zero. Nobody can order until it counts."] = "排队看板卡在零。它不计数，谁也点不了餐。",
  ["Queue for wide, stack for deep. Same loop, different end of the Vec."] = "横着走用队列，往深走用栈。同一个循环，只是取 Vec 的另一头。",
  ["Queues, pipes and pickle"] = "Queue、Pipe 与 pickle",
  ["R then Lock. Writers still use Lock and Unlock."] = "R 然后 Lock。写者仍用 Lock 和 Unlock。",
  ["RLock blocks only while a writer holds the lock. Readers never block each other."] = "RLock 只在有人持有写锁时才会阻塞。读者之间从不互相阻塞。",
  ["ROUND 1  -  the brackets"] = "第 1 回合  -  括号",
  ["ROUND 1  -  the buzzer"] = "第 1 回合  -  抢答器",
  ["ROUND 2  -  the stairs"] = "第 2 回合  -  楼梯",
  ["ROUND 2  -  the tree"] = "第 2 回合  -  树",
  ["ROUND 3  -  the map"] = "第 3 回合  -  地图",
  ["ROUND 3  -  the window"] = "第 3 回合  -  窗口",
  ["ROUND 4  -  the chain"] = "第 4 回合  -  链",
  ["ROUND 4  -  the top k"] = "第 4 回合  -  前 k 名",
  ["ROUND 5  -  the shifts"] = "第 5 回合  -  排班",
  ["ROUND 5  -  the shuffle"] = "第 5 回合  -  洗牌",
  ["ROUND 6  -  the cache"] = "第 6 回合  -  缓存",
  ["ROUND 6  -  the classics"] = "第 6 回合  -  经典题",
  ["ROUND 7  -  the kitchen"] = "第 7 回合  -  厨房",
  ["RUST SET  -  the walk"] = "RUST SET  -  步行",
  ["RWMutex: RLock for readers, Lock for the one writer. Use it when reads dominate."] = "RWMutex：读者用 RLock，唯一的写者用 Lock。读远多于写时用它。",
  ["Race the cooking against the cancel. Which method gives the channel to select on?"] = "让做菜和取消赛跑。哪个方法给出可以 select 的那条 channel？",
  ["Rc counts on one thread only. Which shared pointer may cross threads?"] = "Rc 只能在一个线程上计数。哪个共享指针可以跨线程？",
  ["Reached an empty spot: make the node here. Fill: if n == ___"] = "到了空位：在这里建节点。填空：if n == ___",
  ["Read JSON bytes into the struct. Fill: json.___(b, &order)"] = "把 JSON 字节读进 struct。填：json.___(b, &order)",
  ["Read a price that may not exist, with 0 as the fallback, without a crash. Which method?"] = "读一个可能不存在的价格，以 0 为后备，不崩溃。哪个方法？",
  ["Read and write, then the word for lock. Readers share it; a writer gets it alone."] = "读和写，再加上表示锁的那个词。读者可以共用，写者独占。",
  ["Read the counter without a lock and without a race. Which method?"] = "不加锁、也不产生竞态地读这个计数器。用哪个方法？",
  ["Read the root value without moving the Box out of the Option. Which Option method borrows the inside?"] = "读根节点的值，又不把 Box 从 Option 里移出去。哪个 Option 方法借用里面的内容？",
  ["Reading items[3] from a Vec of n items: how many steps, in Big O?"] = "从 n 个元素的 Vec 读 items[3]：用 Big O 说是多少步？",
  ["Reading items[3] from a list of n items: how many steps, in Big O?"] = "从 n 个元素的列表读 items[3]：用 Big O 说是多少步？",
  ["Reading items[3] from a slice of n items: how many steps, in Big O?"] = "从 n 个元素的切片读 items[3]：用 Big O 说是多少步？",
  ["Real life: sort orders by price, cheapest first, equal prices keep their order. Which stable slice method takes a key closure?"] = "现实场景：按价格给订单排序，最便宜的在前，价格相同的保持原序。哪个稳定的切片方法接收一个取键的闭包？",
  ["Receipt holds a &'a str. What must the struct declare after its name?"] = "Receipt 持有一个 &'a str。struct 名字后面必须声明什么？",
  ["Receipt<'_> means some lifetime, I do not need to name it. Clearer than impl<'a> Display for Receipt<'a> when 'a is never used."] = "Receipt<'_> 意思是某个生命周期，我不需要给它起名。'a 用不上时，比 impl<'a> Display for Receipt<'a> 更清楚。",
  ["Receive until the channel is closed. Fill: for m := ___ ch"] = "一直接收直到 channel 关闭。填空：for m := ___ ch",
  ["Receiver is Send but not Sync: three cooks cannot read the rail at once. Arc shares it; what hands out turns?"] = "Receiver 是 Send 但不是 Sync：三个厨师不能同时读这条轨。Arc 负责共享；那谁来分配先后？",
  ["Recurse into the same side you assign to. Mirror of the else branch."] = "递归进哪边就赋值给哪边。和 else 分支对称。",
  ["Recursion and memoization"] = "递归与记忆化",
  ["Recursion uses the call stack. Quicksort's average recursion depth, hence stack space, is O(___)"] = "递归使用调用栈。快速排序的平均递归深度，也就是栈空间，是 O(___)",
  ["Recursive types need a pointer. nil children mark the end."] = "递归类型需要指针。nil 子节点表示到头了。",
  ["Reduce with your own start value and closure. Which method?"] = "用自己的初始值和闭包做归约。哪个方法？",
  ["Refill the ice only if nobody is at the machine. Which method returns false instead of waiting?"] = "只有没人在用机器时才加冰。哪个方法不等待，直接返回 false？",
  ["Reformat every file to the standard style before the commit. Which subcommand?"] = "提交前把每个文件重排成标准风格。哪个子命令？",
  ["Release the lock however the function exits. Fill: defer mu.___()"] = "无论函数怎么退出都释放锁。填空：defer mu.___()",
  ["Release the lock however the function leaves, error or not. Which keyword?"] = "不管函数怎么离开、有没有出错，都要把锁放掉。用哪个关键字？",
  ["Release the module. Which git command names the commit?"] = "发布这个模块。哪个 git 命令给提交起名？",
  ["Remember which stations were seen, with O(1) lookup. Which built-in?"] = "记住哪些车站见过，O(1) 查找。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Remove a key from a map. Which built-in?"] = "从 map 里删除一个键。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Repeat forever until break hands back a value. Which keyword?"] = "一直重复，直到 break 交回一个值。哪个关键字？",
  ["Repeat while a condition holds. Which keyword?"] = "条件成立时一直重复。哪个关键字？",
  ['Report a failed check and keep the test running. Fill: t.___("got %d", n)'] = '报告一次检查失败并让测试继续。填空：t.___("got %d", n)',
  ["Resize every photo and keep the input order. Which method?"] = "缩掉每一张照片，并保持输入顺序。用哪个方法？",
  ["Response + Writer. An interface, so no star. It is also an io.Writer."] = "Response 加 Writer。是 interface，所以没有星号。它也是一个 io.Writer。",
  ["ResponseWriter: headers, status, body. Write the status before the body."] = "ResponseWriter：header、状态码、body。先写状态码，再写 body。",
  ["Result and the ? operator"] = "Result 与 ? 运算符",
  ["Result<T, E> is either Ok(value) or Err(error). The compiler makes you check. The till lights up."] = "Result<T, E> 要么是 Ok(value) 要么是 Err(error)。编译器逼你检查。收银机亮了。",
  ["Return a plus b without the return keyword. What is the last line of the body?"] = "不用 return 关键字返回 a 加 b。函数体最后一行是什么？",
  ["Return an iterator without naming its long type. Which keyword in the return position?"] = "返回一个迭代器，却不写出它冗长的类型。返回位置上用哪个关键字？",
  ["Return the cached answer if it is there. Fill the comma-ok test: if v, ok := memo[n]; ___"] = "缓存里有答案就直接返回。填 comma-ok 判断：if v, ok := memo[n]; ___",
  ["Returning &o is safe in Go: the compiler sees the reference outlive the frame and moves the value to the heap. Sharing across goroutines does the same."] = "在 Go 里返回 &o 是安全的：编译器看到这个引用活得比栈帧久，就把值搬到堆上。跨 goroutine 共享也是一样。",
  ["Returns a channel that fires once, later. Capital A."] = "返回一个稍后触发一次的 channel。大写 A。",
  ["Reverse in place: point the current node back at the one before it. Fill: cur.next = ___"] = "就地反转：让当前节点指回它前面那个。填：cur.next = ___",
  ["Reverse with prev/cur/next pointers. Floyd's cycle check: slow moves one, fast moves two."] = "用 prev/cur/next 指针反转。Floyd 判环：slow 走一步，fast 走两步。",
  ["Reverse(3) < Reverse(2). Wrapping at push time is the whole trick; no custom Ord impl needed."] = "Reverse(3) < Reverse(2)。push 时包一下就是全部诀窍；不需要自定义 Ord 实现。",
  ["Reverse: point the current node backwards. Fill: node.next = ___"] = "反转：让当前节点往回指。填空：node.next = ___",
  ["Right minus left, plus one for the inclusive end."] = "右减左，再加一，因为末端包含在内。",
  ["Room made: store the value. Which HashMap method writes k to v, replacing an old value if there was one?"] = "腾出位置了：存值。哪个 HashMap 方法把 k 写成 v，有旧值就替换？",
  ["Round five. A shoebox of receipts on the screen. Bo writes merge sort by hand for the crowd, then admits that sorted() has been Timsort all along, and finds a receipt by amount with bisect."] = "第五回合。屏幕上一个装收据的鞋盒。Bo 为观众手写归并排序，然后承认 sorted() 一直都是 Timsort，再用 bisect 按金额找收据。",
  ["Round five. Every cook's shift as [start, end]. When is the kitchen staffed at all, as one clean list?"] = "第五回合。每个厨师的班次是 [start, end]。厨房什么时候有人，整理成一份干净的列表？",
  ["Round five. Merge the intervals, Mei. Sort first; the interviewer always waits for that word."] = "第五回合。合并区间，Mei。先排序；面试官总在等这个词。",
  ["Round five. Staff shifts as {start, end}. Merge the overlapping ones into one schedule."] = "第五回合。员工班次是 {start, end}。把重叠的合并成一张排班表。",
  ["Round five. The night market's noodle stall next door lends its counter as a second whiteboard. Siu Ming lists the cooks' shifts, overlapping every which way, and wants the hours the kitchen is covered as a list of clean blocks. Sort, then one pass: every merged interval is either extended or started."] = "第五回合。隔壁夜市的面摊把柜台借来当第二块白板。小明列出厨师们的班次，重叠得乱七八糟，想要把厨房有人的时段整理成一份干净的区块列表。先排序，再走一遍：每个合并区间要么被延长，要么新开。",
  ["Round five: sort the night's receipts. Write merge sort, then use the built-ins like a grown-up."] = "第五回合：给今晚的收据排序。写归并排序，然后像大人一样用内置函数。",
  ["Round five: the shuffle. Write merge sort by hand, then show me you know the std sorts. O(n log n) or bust!"] = "第五回合：洗牌。手写归并排序，然后让我看看你懂不懂 std 的排序。要么 O(n log n)，要么出局！",
  ["Round four. A chain of delivery stops, each pointing to the next. Bo reverses it in place, sends two riders down it at different speeds to find the middle, and checks whether the route loops."] = "第四回合。一条外卖站点的链，每个指向下一个。Bo 就地反转它，派两个不同速度的骑手沿链找中点，再检查路线是否成环。",
  ["Round four. A million order totals stream past. The third largest, without sorting them all."] = "第四回合。一百万个订单总额流过。第三大的那个，不许全部排序。",
  ["Round four. A million receipts stream past. The third biggest, at any moment, without sorting."] = "第四回合。一百万张收据流过。任何时刻的第三大，不排序。",
  ["Round four. Receipts by the million, and Siu Ming wants the kth biggest while they are still arriving. Sorting everything is n log n and needs it all in memory; a heap of k keeps just the contenders. Bo draws a small pile with the smallest on top and starts pushing."] = "第四回合。上百万张收据，小明想在它们还在陆续到达时就拿到第 k 大的。全部排序是 n log n，还得全放进内存；一个大小为 k 的堆只留下候选者。Bo 画了一小堆，最小的在顶上，开始往里推。",
  ["Round four. Ten thousand receipts: the third biggest, and the five dishes ordered most. Without sorting all of it."] = "第四回合。一万张收据：第三大的一张，还有点得最多的五道菜。不许全部排序。",
  ["Round four: a linked list. Reverse it, find the middle, catch the loop."] = "第四回合：链表。反转它，找中点，抓住环。",
  ["Round four: reverse the chain, then find its middle. The borrow checker is watching."] = "第四回合：反转这条链，再找出它的中点。借用检查器看着呢。",
  ["Round six, the one we always ask. A cache of the last 100 menus. Get and Put in O(1). Go."] = "第六回合，我们每次必问的那道。缓存最近 100 份菜单。Get 和 Put 都要 O(1)。开始。",
  ["Round six. A cache that holds n routes. When it is full, the one nobody asked for longest goes."] = "第六回合。一个装 n 条路线的缓存。满了的时候，最久没人问的那条走人。",
  ["Round six. Fast hands, Mei. The crab on the kiosk is keeping time."] = "第六回合。手要快，Mei。自助机上那只螃蟹在计时。",
  ["Round six. The classics: which two receipts add up to the till's total, are two dish names anagrams, is the shop's slogan a palindrome. A dict, a sort and two pointers. The crowd knows these; Bo has to be fast."] = "第六回合。经典题：哪两张收据加起来是收银机的总数，两个菜名是不是字母异位词，店里的口号是不是回文。一个 dict、一次排序、两个指针。观众都会；Bo 必须快。",
  ["Round six. The delivery app looks up the same few routes all night, and the map API charges per call. Siu Ming wants a cache of n routes where the least recently used one leaves first, with get and put in O(1). Bo writes one dict that remembers its order and two methods."] = "第六回合。外卖 app 整晚都在查同样几条路线，而地图 API 按调用收费。小明想要一个装 n 条路线的缓存，最久没人用的先离开，get 和 put 都是 O(1)。Bo 写了一个记得顺序的 dict 和两个方法。",
  ["Round six. The menu API caches the last hundred dishes. Which one goes when the hundred-and-first arrives?"] = "第六回合。菜单 API 缓存最近一百道菜。第一百零一道来了，谁出局？",
  ["Round six: the three questions every interview asks. Two-sum, anagram, palindrome. Go!"] = "第六回合：每场面试都会问的三道题。两数之和、字母异位词、回文。开始！",
  ["Round three. A week of profits and losses per hour. Which run of hours made the most?"] = "第三回合。一周里每小时的盈亏。哪一段小时赚得最多？",
  ["Round three. Daily sales, some negative. Which stretch of days made the most money?"] = "第三回合。每日销售额，有些是负的。哪一段日子赚得最多？",
  ["Round three. Siu Ming writes a row of numbers on the board: the till, hour by hour, some hours negative. The best run of hours, the best three hours in a row, then the longest streak of orders with no dish repeated. Three windows, each slid across the row exactly once."] = "第三回合。小明在板上写下一排数字：收银机每小时的账，有些小时是负数。最赚的一段小时、连续最赚的三小时，然后是没有重复菜品的最长一串订单。三个窗口，每个在这一排上恰好滑过一次。",
  ["Round three. The MTR map: stations are nodes, lines are edges. Bo builds the adjacency dict, then finds every station reachable from Causeway Bay, breadth first, then depth first."] = "第三回合。MTR 地图：车站是节点，线路是边。Bo 构建邻接 dict，然后从铜锣湾出发找到每个可达的车站，先广度优先，再深度优先。",
  ["Round three: the MTR map as a graph. Breadth first, then depth first. Do not visit a station twice!"] = "第三回合：把港铁线路图当成图。先广度优先，再深度优先。同一个站别走两次！",
  ["Round three: the MTR map as a graph. Build it, sweep it wide, then sweep it deep."] = "第三回合：MTR 地图作为图。构建它，横着扫，再竖着扫。",
  ["Round three: the best run of sales in a week, the busiest k hours, the longest streak of different dishes. All one pass."] = "第三回合：一周里最赚的一段销售、最忙的 k 小时、最长的不重复菜品连击。全部一次遍历。",
  ["Round two. Siu Ming draws a staircase and a pile of coins. Bo has climbed the MTR exit ten thousand times and counted the till's change every night; now the question is how many ways and how few coins. A table that fills from the bottom up, and a marker for the impossible."] = "第二回合。小明画了一段楼梯和一堆硬币。Bo 爬过地铁出口一万次，每晚都数收银机里的零钱；现在的问题是有多少种走法，以及最少几枚硬币。一张自底向上填满的表，加一个表示不可能的标记。",
  ["Round two. The MTR exit has n steps, you take one or two at a time. How many ways up?"] = "第二回合。地铁出口有 n 级台阶，一次走一级或两级。有多少种走法？",
  ["Round two. The Times Square stairs: one or two steps at a time. How many ways up? Then make change for the till."] = "第二回合。时代广场的楼梯：一次一步或两步。有多少种上法？然后给收银台找零。",
  ["Round two. The screen shows the whiteboard from the back office: a tree of order numbers. Smaller to the left, larger to the right. Bo has to grow it, walk it in order, measure it and sweep it level by level."] = "第二回合。屏幕上显示后勤室的白板：一棵订单号的树。小的向左，大的向右。Bo 要把它长大、中序遍历、测量高度，再逐层扫一遍。",
  ["Round two: a binary search tree. Insert, walk it in order, measure it, then level by level."] = "第二回合：二叉搜索树。插入、中序遍历、测量，然后逐层。",
  ["Rows go 0..len, so len itself is out. The same test on c covers the right edge; the top and left are handled by wrapping."] = "行号范围是 0..len，所以 len 本身就在外面。对 c 做同样的检查覆盖右边缘；上边和左边由回绕处理。",
  ["Rows run from 0 to len(g)-1; len(g) itself is already outside."] = "行从 0 到 len(g)-1；len(g) 本身已经在外面了。",
  ["Run close() when this function returns, even on error. Which keyword?"] = "函数返回时执行 close()，出错也要执行。哪个关键字？",
  ["Run cross(), then test its error in the same if. Fill the operator: err ___ nil"] = "运行 cross()，再在同一个 if 里检查它的错误。填入运算符：err ___ nil",
  ["Run every function marked with the #[...] attribute for checks. Which subcommand?"] = "运行每个标了 #[...] 检查属性的函数。哪个子命令？",
  ["Run fry beside the main thread. Which class from threading?"] = "在主线程旁运行 fry。threading 的哪个类？",
  ["Run grind on its own core. Which multiprocessing class?"] = "让 grind 在自己的核上跑。用哪个 multiprocessing 类？",
  ["Run the cooks, stop on the first error, wait for all. Fill: g.___()"] = "启动厨师们，遇到第一个错误就停，等所有人完成。填空：g.___()",
  ["Rune, Count, In, String: one long name. Or len([]rune(s))."] = "Rune、Count、In、String：连成一个长名字。或者用 len([]rune(s))。",
  ["Russell Street"] = "罗素街",
  ["Rust ignores the rest of a line after which two characters?"] = "Rust 会忽略哪两个字符之后的整行内容？",
  ["Rust? I only know Go. Is it far?"] = "Rust？我只会 Go。远不远？",
  ["RwLock: many .read() guards at once, or one .write(). Use it when reads far outnumber writes; Mutex is simpler otherwise."] = "RwLock：同时多个 .read() 守卫，或者一个 .write()。读远多于写时用它；否则 Mutex 更简单。",
  ["S  THIS STREET"] = "S  这条街",
  ["S  WHOLE QUEST"] = "S  整个任务",
  ["S  WHOLE TRACK"] = "S  整条路线",
  ["S for string, then printf. Fprintf writes to a writer, Printf to stdout."] = "S 代表 string，后接 printf。Fprintf 写到 writer，Printf 写到 stdout。",
  ["SAVED  %s"] = "已保存  %s",
  ["SAVED %d FILES  in %s"] = "已保存 %d 个文件  到 %s",
  ["SHARE"] = "分享",
  ["SHARE THIS QUIZ"] = "分享这道题",
  ["SHARED IT"] = "分享过",
  ["SPEED TYPER"] = "快手打字",
  ["STOP"] = "停止",
  ["STREAK x%d"] = "连胜 x%d",
  ["STREET CLEAR!"] = "过街！",
  ["Same &mut memo goes into both calls, one after the other. The borrow checker is happy: they do not overlap."] = "同一个 &mut memo 一前一后进了两次调用。借用检查器很满意：它们不重叠。",
  ["Same board, Rust this time. The question never changes: input doubles, then what?"] = "同一块白板，这次是 Rust。问题永远不变：输入翻倍，然后呢？",
  ["Same built-in as for slices. A literal map[string]int{} also works."] = "和 slice 用同一个内置函数。字面量 map[string]int{} 也行。",
  ["Same keyword as for slices. No index; just the value."] = "和遍历 slice 用的关键字一样。没有索引，只有值。",
  ["Same lesson as the Go till, one floor up: the resource is shared even when the memory is not."] = "和楼上 Go 收银那一课一样：就算内存不共享，资源还是共享的。",
  ["Same name as Go's entry function, but it needs no package line."] = "和 Go 的入口函数同名，但不需要 package 那一行。",
  ["Same name as on HashMap, but on a set it returns bool. No contains check needed first."] = "和 HashMap 上同名，但在 set 上它返回 bool。不用先 contains 一次。",
  ["Same name as strings.Contains. Index returns the position or -1."] = "和 strings.Contains 同名。Index 返回位置，找不到返回 -1。",
  ["Same name as the Display helper on any value. to_string_pretty adds newlines."] = "和任何值上那个 Display 辅助方法同名。to_string_pretty 会加换行。",
  ["Same name as the blocking one in the time module, but awaited."] = "和 time 模块里那个阻塞版同名，但要 await。",
  ["Same name as the derived trait, in lowercase."] = "和派生的 trait 同名，小写。",
  ["Same row, one column to the left."] = "同一行，左边一列。",
  ["Same six letters as Go. Use it for early exits, not for the last line."] = "和 Go 一样的六个字母。用来提前退出，不用在最后一行。",
  ["Same thing for both repos at once, with no edit to either go.mod. Which subcommand?"] = "两个仓库一起来，任何一个 go.mod 都不改。哪个子命令？",
  ["Same thing from a generator: setup, yield, teardown. Which contextlib decorator?"] = "用生成器做同样的事：准备、yield、清理。哪个 contextlib 装饰器？",
  ["Same verb as go run. cargo build only compiles."] = "和 go run 同一个动词。cargo build 只编译。",
  ["Same word as Go and Rust. Its sibling skips to the next turn instead."] = "和 Go、Rust 同一个词。它的兄弟则是跳到下一轮。",
  ["Same word as Go, but a method that changes the list in place and returns None."] = "和 Go 同一个词，但是一个方法，就地修改列表并返回 None。",
  ["Same word as Go, no quotes, no parentheses. from x import y picks one name out."] = "和 Go 同一个词，不带引号，不带括号。from x import y 只挑一个名字出来。",
  ["Same word as Go. Rust can drop it on the last line; Python cannot."] = "和 Go 同一个词。Rust 在最后一行可以省掉；Python 不能。",
  ["Same word as WaitGroup's. It returns the first non-nil error."] = "和 WaitGroup 的那个词一样。它返回第一个非 nil 的 error。",
  ["Same word as a single import, then parentheses."] = "和单个 import 用同一个词，后面加括号。",
  ["Same word as in switch. Turns select into a poll."] = "和 switch 里的词一样。把 select 变成轮询。",
  ["Same word, one letter changed. Go has no public keyword; the first letter is the keyword."] = "同一个词，改一个字母。Go 没有 public 关键字；首字母就是关键字。",
  ["Same. Big O drops constants: O(2), O(500) are all O(1). The flat line is drawn."] = "一样。Big O 丢掉常数：O(2)、O(500) 都是 O(1)。平线画好。",
  ["Same. Big O drops constants: O(2), O(500) are all written O(1). The flat line is drawn; the counter street is done."] = "一样。Big O 丢掉常数：O(2)、O(500) 都写成 O(1)。平线画好；柜台街完成。",
  ["Satisfied implicitly: any type with those methods implements it."] = "隐式满足：任何拥有这些方法的类型都实现了它。",
  ["Save next, flip the link, advance both. prev is the new head when the loop ends."] = "保存 next，翻转链接，两者前进。循环结束时 prev 就是新头。",
  ["Save nxt, flip the pointer, step. Three names, one pass, O(1) space. The tuple swap on the last line steps both."] = "存 nxt、翻转指针、前进。三个名字，一次遍历，O(1) 空间。最后一行的元组交换让两者一起前进。",
  ["Schedules a call for later. Last in, first out. After the return happens."] = "把调用安排到之后执行。后进先出。在 return 之后运行。",
  ["Second python, second core"] = "第二个 python，第二个核",
  ["Semantic import versioning: v1 and v2 are different packages with different paths, so one binary can depend on both and nothing breaks by surprise."] = "语义化导入版本：v1 和 v2 是路径不同的两个包，于是一个二进制可以同时依赖两者，没有什么会突然坏掉。",
  ["Semver tags and the /v2 rule"] = "semver 标签和 /v2 规则",
  ["Send a value into the channel. Fill the operator: ch ___ muffin"] = "向 channel 发送一个值。填运算符：ch ___ muffin",
  ["Send one job now and keep the handle. Which method?"] = "现在就把一件活儿送出去，并留着句柄。用哪个方法？",
  ["Send results back to the parent. Which multiprocessing class?"] = "把结果送回父进程。用哪个 multiprocessing 类？",
  ["Send the jobs, then tell the workers there are no more. Which built-in?"] = "发完 jobs，再告诉 worker 没有更多了。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Send: safe to move to another thread. Sync: safe to share by &T. Rc has neither, Arc<T> has both when T does. The count is right. Milk tea and a pineapple bun: the afternoon tea set is yours."] = "Send：可以安全地移到另一个线程。Sync：可以安全地通过 &T 共享。Rc 两者都没有，T 有时 Arc<T> 两者都有。计数对了。奶茶加菠萝包：下午茶套餐是你的了。",
  ["Sender is Clone, Receiver is not: that is the mp and the sc in mpsc. Both tills feed one kitchen."] = "Sender 是 Clone，Receiver 不是：这就是 mpsc 里的 mp 和 sc。两台收银机喂同一个厨房。",
  ["Separate interpreters mean separate memory: nothing is shared by accident, and everything shared on purpose has to be sent."] = "解释器分开就意味着内存分开：不会有什么被意外共享，而有意共享的一切都必须发送过去。",
  ['Serve /order with the function serve. Fill: http.___("/order", serve)'] = '用函数 serve 处理 /order。填：http.___("/order", serve)',
  ["Serve three bowls, numbered 0, 1, 2. Which built-in counts for the for loop?"] = "端出三碗，编号 0、1、2。哪个内置函数替 for 循环计数？",
  ["SetMeal extends Order and must run Order's __init__ first. Which built-in reaches the parent?"] = "SetMeal 继承 Order，必须先运行 Order 的 __init__。哪个内置函数触及父类？",
  ["Setting a channel to nil disables its case without touching the loop. It is the standard way to drain two inputs that end at different times."] = "把 channel 设成 nil，不用动循环就关掉了那个分支。这是抽干两个在不同时间结束的输入的标准做法。",
  ["Seven letters, an adverb: at the end, no matter what. Go's defer."] = "七个字母，一个副词：最后，无论如何。Go 的 defer。",
  ["Seven letters, the end of almost every iterator chain. The type annotation on the left tells it what to build."] = "七个字母，几乎每条迭代器链的结尾。左边的类型标注告诉它要构建什么。",
  ["Seven letters, the opposite of acquire. Go writes it defer mu.Unlock()."] = "七个字母，acquire 的反面。Go 写作 defer mu.Unlock()。",
  ["Seven letters, the unbounded one. sync_channel(n) would take a capacity."] = "七个字母，无界的那个。sync_channel(n) 则要传一个容量。",
  ["Seven letters, to take back a statement. Go 1.16. The tag stays; go get stops choosing it."] = "七个字母，收回一句话。Go 1.16。标签还在；go get 不再选它。",
  ["Seven letters. Does the value ... this pattern? Same verb, plural form."] = "七个字母。这个值是否 ... 这个模式？同一个动词，第三人称单数形式。",
  ["Seven letters. For humans; Debug is for {:?}."] = "七个字母。给人看的；Debug 是给 {:?} 的。",
  ["Seven letters. Gather everything into a container: Vec, String, HashMap, even Result."] = "七个字母。把所有东西收进一个容器：Vec、String、HashMap，甚至 Result。",
  ["Seven letters. Go spelled it chan."] = "七个字母。Go 拼成 chan。",
  ["Seven letters. The opposite of a debug build. The binary lands in target/ under that name."] = "七个字母。debug 构建的反面。二进制文件落在 target/ 下同名的目录里。",
  ["Seven letters: a whole server process that owns the objects and answers questions about them."] = "七个字母：一个专门持有这些对象、并回答关于它们的问题的服务进程。",
  ["Seven letters: swap one thing for another. The arrow reads 'with'."] = "七个字母：用一个换另一个。箭头读作「换成」。",
  ["Seven letters: to need. Several of them go in one parenthesised block."] = "七个字母：需要。有好几个时放在一个带括号的块里。",
  ["Seven streets of Big O. Read a loop, name its cost, then write the faster one, in Go."] = "七条 Big O 街。读一个循环，说出它的代价，再用 Go 写出更快的版本。",
  ["Seven streets of Big O. Read a loop, name its cost, then write the faster one, in Python."] = "七条 Big O 街。读一个循环，说出它的代价，再用 Python 写出更快的版本。",
  ["Seven streets of Big O. Read a loop, name its cost, then write the faster one, in Rust."] = "七条 Big O 街。读一个循环，说出它的代价，再用 Rust 写出更快的版本。",
  ["Shared and mutable across threads: wrap it, then lock it."] = "跨线程共享又可变：先包起来，再加锁。",
  ["Shared references and data races"] = "共享引用与数据竞态",
  ["Shipped. One more: the code still sorts by hand."] = "发布了。还有一件：代码还在手写排序。",
  ["Short declaration. Fill the operator: floor ___ 8"] = "短变量声明。填入运算符：floor ___ 8",
  ["Short for format. Println lives there."] = "format 的缩写。Println 就在里面。",
  ["Short for function. Then the name, then arguments in parentheses."] = "function 的缩写。然后是名字，再是括号里的参数。",
  ["Shout the shop name. Which strings function upper-cases?"] = "大声喊出店名。strings 的哪个函数转大写？",
  ["Shouted in capitals, and also an environment variable. GO, MAX, and short for processors."] = "用全大写喊出来，同时也是一个环境变量。GO、MAX，再加处理器的缩写。",
  ["Signed, 32 bits, the default integer type. Write the annotation."] = "有符号，32 位，默认的整数类型。写出类型标注。",
  ["Since Go 1.17 go.mod lists every module the build needs, direct or not, so one file describes the whole graph. go mod tidy keeps the comments honest."] = "从 Go 1.17 起 go.mod 列出构建需要的每一个模块，不管直接还是间接，于是一个文件描述整张图。go mod tidy 让这些注释保持诚实。",
  ["Since Go 1.19 the type itself is atomic, so no &x is needed. Name and bit width."] = "从 Go 1.19 起类型本身就是原子的，所以不需要 &x。名字加位宽。",
  ["Since Python 3.8 this is real POSIX shared memory: one block of bytes, mapped into every process that asks for it by name."] = "从 Python 3.8 起这是真正的 POSIX 共享内存：一块字节，映射进每个按名字来要它的进程。",
  ["Siu Ming"] = "小明",
  ["Siu Ming draws the Causeway Bay MTR exit: n steps. Then the till: coins of 1, 3 and 4, and an amount to make with the fewest coins. Two problems, one trick: write the answer for the small cases, then build every bigger one out of the ones already on the board."] = "小明画出铜锣湾地铁出口：n 级台阶。然后是收银机：面值 1、3、4 的硬币，要用最少的硬币凑出一个金额。两道题，一个诀窍：先写出小情况的答案，再用板上已有的答案搭出每个更大的。",
  ["Siu Ming pins a strip of numbers to the board: Lucky Mac's daily profit for a month, red on the bad days. Best run of days, best k days in a row, longest run of distinct dishes on the specials board. Three questions, one shape: a window that slides right and never looks back."] = "小明把一条数字纸带钉到板上：幸运麦一个月的每日利润，亏损的日子标红。最赚钱的连续天数、连续 k 天的最佳、特价板上最长的一段不重复菜品。三个问题，一个形状：一扇向右滑、从不回头的窗口。",
  ["Siu Ming pins the week's roster to the board: thirty shifts, half of them overlapping, the manager wants one clean line per stretch of coverage, and then how many cooks are ever on at once. Mei taps the first column: sort by start and the mess becomes a walk."] = "小明把这周的排班表钉到板上：三十个班次，一半互相重叠，经理想要每段连续覆盖只留一条干净的线，然后还要知道最多同时有几个厨师在岗。Mei 敲敲第一列：按起点排序，乱麻就变成了一趟走。",
  ["Siu Ming's phone book of suppliers, sorted by name. Nobody reads it from the front. Open the middle, go left or right, and the book is half as thick every time. Mei draws a line that climbs, then almost stops."] = "Siu Ming 的供应商电话簿，按名字排序。没人从头读。翻开中间，向左或向右，每次书都薄一半。Mei 画一条爬升然后几乎停下的线。",
  ["Siu Ming's phone book of suppliers, sorted by name. Open the middle, go left or right, and the book is half as thick every time. Mei draws the line that climbs, then almost lies down."] = "Siu Ming 的供应商电话簿，按名字排序。翻开中间，向左或向右，每次书都薄一半。Mei 画那条爬升然后几乎躺平的线。",
  ["Six goroutines write one slice with no lock. Which expression keeps that safe?"] = "六个 goroutine 不加锁地写同一个 slice。哪个表达式让它安全？",
  ["Six letters, capital O. Rust's answer to nil: the type itself says maybe."] = "六个字母，大写 O。Rust 对 nil 的回答：类型本身就写着「也许」。",
  ["Six letters, same word as Go, but there is no type keyword in front."] = "六个字母，和 Go 同一个词，但前面没有 type 关键字。",
  ["Six letters, takes a reference to the key, returns the old value as Option."] = "六个字母，接受键的引用，以 Option 返回旧值。",
  ["Six letters, the most recent. @v1 or @main work too: a major, a branch, a commit hash."] = "六个字母，最近的那个。@v1 或 @main 也行：一个主版本、一个分支、一个提交哈希。",
  ["Six letters, the noun for what a function gives back. This one blocks until it exists."] = "六个字母，指函数交还给你的那样东西的名词。它会阻塞到它存在为止。",
  ["Six letters, the same method a HashMap uses to store a key. Takes the value, not a reference."] = "六个字母，和 HashMap 存键用的是同一个方法。接受值，不是引用。",
  ["Six letters, the same word the C library uses for deleting a file."] = "六个字母，和 C 库删除文件用的词一样。",
  ["Six letters, the word Unix uses for a background service."] = "六个字母，Unix 用来称呼后台服务的那个词。",
  ["Six letters, the word for a supplier. The folder it makes has the same name."] = "六个字母，表示供应商的词。它建出来的文件夹也叫这个名。",
  ["Six letters, the write of every HashMap. Returns the previous value as Option."] = "六个字母，每个 HashMap 的写入方法。以 Option 返回之前的值。",
  ["Six letters, under sync/. Go 1.19 also has atomic.Int64 with .Add(1)."] = "六个字母，在 sync/ 下。Go 1.19 还有 atomic.Int64，用 .Add(1)。",
  ["Six letters, what you do with a form. It returns immediately, with a Future."] = "六个字母，你对一张表格做的那件事。它立刻返回，还给你一个 Future。",
  ["Six letters. Every result, in order, comma separated."] = "六个字母。所有结果按顺序，用逗号分隔。",
  ["Six letters. Generic over T: Some(T) or None."] = "六个字母。对 T 泛型：Some(T) 或 None。",
  ["Six letters. Give the field a different name on the wire. rename_all does a whole struct."] = "六个字母。给字段在传输时换个名字。rename_all 对整个 struct 生效。",
  ["Six letters. Like a coffee one: only what passes the test comes through."] = "六个字母。像咖啡用的那个：只有通过测试的才能过。",
  ["Six letters. The closure gets &char and returns bool; true keeps the item."] = "六个字母。闭包拿到 &char 并返回 bool；true 就保留这个元素。",
  ["Six letters. The compiler writes the trait implementation for you."] = "六个字母。编译器替你写 trait 实现。",
  ["Six letters. The word in fmt spelled out. Variables can go straight inside the braces."] = "六个字母。fmt 的完整拼写。变量可以直接写进花括号里。",
  ["Six letters. To obtain from a source."] = "六个字母。从来源推导出来。",
  ["Six letters. Two arms: Ok(T) and Err(E)."] = "六个字母。两个分支：Ok(T) 和 Err(E)。",
  ["Six letters. What you do when you are sure it is there."] = "六个字母。你确定它在那里时做的事。",
  ["Six letters: straight to the source, no proxy in between."] = "六个字母：直接去源头，中间没有代理。",
  ["Six letters: to bring together. tokio::join! does the same for a fixed number."] = "六个字母：聚在一起。tokio::join! 对固定数量做同样的事。",
  ["Six letters; other languages say catch. Name the type after it, never bare."] = "六个字母；其他语言叫 catch。后面写上类型，永远不要光秃秃的。",
  ["Six riders wait on the kerb because the backend asks the map API one address at a time."] = "六个骑手在路边等着，因为后端一次只向地图 API 问一个地址。",
  ["Six tickets sent. Now end the cooks' loops: recv must return Err. What do you do with tx?"] = "六张单发出去了。现在结束厨师们的循环：recv 必须返回 Err。你要对 tx 做什么？",
  ["Six woks, one tray rack, one map of dish counts. The program died with: concurrent map writes."] = "六个炒锅、一个托盘架、一个记菜数的 map。程序死了，写着：concurrent map writes。",
  ["Six workers, one out channel. Who ends the range over out, and how?"] = "六个 worker，一条 out channel。谁来结束对 out 的 range，怎么结束？",
  ["Size the pool by the machine. Which runtime call reports the cores?"] = "按机器来定池子大小。哪个 runtime 调用报告核心数？",
  ["Skip a closed shop and go on to the next one. Which keyword?"] = "跳过关门的店，继续下一家。哪个关键字？",
  ["Skip writing __init__, __repr__ and __eq__ by hand. Which decorator generates them from the fields?"] = "不想手写 __init__、__repr__ 和 __eq__。哪个装饰器根据字段生成它们？",
  ["Slices alias. Use copy() or append([]int(nil), a...) when you need your own."] = "slice 会别名共享。需要自己的一份时用 copy() 或 append([]int(nil), a...)。",
  ["Sliding window, two pointers"] = "滑动窗口，双指针",
  ["Sliding window: O(n) instead of O(n*k) for summing every window from scratch."] = "滑动窗口：O(n)，而不是每个窗口从头求和的 O(n*k)。",
  ["Sliding windows and two pointers"] = "滑动窗口与双指针",
  ["Smaller goes left, bigger goes right. Draw it before you type it."] = "小的往左，大的往右。先画图再敲代码。",
  ["Smaller goes left, bigger goes right. In Rust a leaf is None and a child is a Box."] = "小的往左，大的往右。在 Rust 里，叶子是 None，子节点是一个 Box。",
  ["Smaller left, larger right: the BST invariant. Assigning the result back handles the None case."] = "小的向左，大的向右：BST 不变式。把结果赋值回去处理了 None 的情况。",
  ["Smaller values go down one side. Fill the arm: if v < n.val => insert(&mut n.___, v)"] = "更小的值往一边走。填这条分支：if v < n.val => insert(&mut n.___, v)",
  ["Smaller values go left. Fill: n.Left = insert(n.___, v)"] = "小的值往左。填空：n.Left = insert(n.___, v)",
  ["Smaller wins: the smallest value floats to index 0."] = "小的赢：最小值浮到下标 0。",
  ["So I only have to know which one waits and which one computes."] = "那我只要知道哪个是等、哪个是算就行了。",
  ["So binary search on n sorted items costs how much, in Big O?"] = "那么 n 个有序项上的二分查找代价多少，用 Big O 说？",
  ["So binary_search on n sorted items costs how much, in Big O?"] = "那么 n 个有序项上的 binary_search 代价多少，用 Big O 说？",
  ["So bisect on n sorted items costs how much, in Big O?"] = "那么 n 个有序项上的 bisect 代价多少，用 Big O 说？",
  ["So put it somewhere they cannot reach. Go has a folder name for exactly that."] = "那就把它放到他们够不着的地方。Go 正好有个文件夹名干这个。",
  ["So share the bytes and send only the name of the block?"] = "所以共享那些字节，只把这块内存的名字发过去？",
  ["Sockets, file handles, locks and lambdas do not travel. Send plain data and let the child open what it needs on its own side."] = "socket、文件句柄、锁和 lambda 都运不过去。发送纯数据，让子进程在自己那边打开它需要的东西。",
  ["Sogo"] = "崇光",
  ["Sogo's directory is a map from shop name to floor. Missing keys return the zero value, so you must ask comma-ok before you trust the number."] = "崇光的楼层索引是从店名到楼层的 map。不存在的键返回零值，所以相信那个数字之前必须先问 comma-ok。",
  ["Some or None. Rust has no null, so the possibly-empty next is spelled out in the type."] = "Some 或者 None。Rust 没有 null，所以可能为空这件事直接写在类型里。",
  ["Sort by start, then walk once: if the next interval starts before the last merged one ends, extend that end to the larger; otherwise push a new interval. O(n log n) for the sort, O(n) for the walk."] = "按起点排序，然后走一遍：如果下一个区间在上一个已合并区间结束前就开始，就把结束点延长到较大者；否则 push 一个新区间。排序 O(n log n)，遍历 O(n)。",
  ["Sort by start. Walk once: if the next interval starts before the last merged one ends, extend that end to the larger of the two; otherwise start a new block."] = "按起点排序。走一遍：如果下一个区间在上一个合并块结束前就开始，把那个终点延长到两者中较大的；否则开一个新块。",
  ["Sort first, Bo. Once they're in order, overlaps are always neighbours."] = "先排序，Bo。排好序之后，重叠的永远是相邻的。",
  ["Sort first. Sorted, the only interval that can overlap is the one you just kept."] = "先排序。排好序后，唯一可能重叠的就是你刚保留的那一个。",
  ["Sort intervals by start; then every overlap is adjacent. Overlap when cur's start <= last's end: extend last's end with max. Otherwise append. Rooms: sort starts and ends separately, two pointers."] = "按起点给区间排序；之后每处重叠都相邻。cur 的起点 <= last 的终点即重叠：用 max 延长 last 的终点。否则追加。会议室：起点和终点分别排序，双指针。",
  ["Sort once for O(n log n), then look items up many times. Each lookup then costs O(___)"] = "排一次 O(n log n)，然后查很多次。之后每次查找代价 O(___)",
  ["Sort orders by price with a one-line function. Which keyword makes it?"] = "用一个单行函数按价格给订单排序。哪个关键字创造它？",
  ["Sort the amounts a little faster, when equal items may swap order. Which Vec method?"] = "在相等项可以交换顺序时，把金额排得快一点。哪个 Vec 方法？",
  ["Sort the dish names by length, into a new list. Which built-in?"] = "把菜名按长度排到一个新列表里。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Sort the dish names shortest first, in place. Which built-in is the key?"] = "把菜名按最短优先就地排序。哪个内置函数做 key？",
  ["Sort the intervals by start, earliest first. Fill the comparison."] = "按起点给区间排序，最早的在前。填上比较。",
  ["Sort the names in place. Fill: slices.___(names)"] = "原地排序 names。填：slices.___(names)",
  ["Sort the shifts by start time so overlaps sit side by side. Which element does the key pick?"] = "按开始时间给班次排序，让重叠的挨在一起。key 选哪个元素？",
  ["Sort the supplier names. Which function from the sort package?"] = "给供应商的名字排序。sort 包的哪个函数？",
  ["Sort, then one pass with a running last: O(n log n) total, O(n) output. The gaps are between the blocks."] = "排序，然后带着 last 走一遍：总共 O(n log n)，输出 O(n)。空档就在块与块之间。",
  ["Sorted input trades the HashMap for two indices: O(n) time and O(1) space after the sort."] = "有序输入用两个下标换掉了 HashMap：排序之后 O(n) 时间、O(1) 空间。",
  ["Sorted prices. Find 25 in log n. Then sort the unsorted ones in n log n."] = "有序的价格。用 log n 找到 25。再用 n log n 排好乱序的。",
  ["Sorted. Sorting costs O(n log n) once; every search after is O(log n). The phone book street is done."] = "有序。排序花一次 O(n log n)；之后每次查找都是 O(log n)。电话簿街完成。",
  ["Sorting and searching"] = "排序与查找",
  ["Sorting: n log n"] = "排序：n log n",
  ["Sounds like request, spelled with a w. Built on hyper and tokio."] = "读起来像 request，拼写里带个 w。建在 hyper 和 tokio 之上。",
  ["Space complexity"] = "空间复杂度",
  ["Space counts extra memory, not the input. In-place sort: O(1). A copy of the list: O(n). Recursion uses stack: quicksort O(log n) on average. Memos trade space for time."] = "空间数的是额外内存，不是输入。原地排序：O(1)。列表的一份副本：O(n)。递归用栈：快速排序平均 O(log n)。memo 用空间换时间。",
  ["Space counts extra memory, not the input. list.sort in place: O(1). sorted() makes a copy: O(n). Recursion uses stack: quicksort O(log n) on average. Memos trade space for time."] = "空间数的是额外内存，不是输入。原地 list.sort：O(1)。sorted() 会复制：O(n)。递归用栈：快速排序平均 O(log n)。memo 用空间换时间。",
  ["Space counts extra memory, not the input. sort_unstable in place: O(1). A clone of the Vec: O(n). Recursion uses stack: quicksort O(log n) on average. Memos trade space for time."] = "空间数的是额外内存，不是输入。原地 sort_unstable：O(1)。Vec 的一份 clone：O(n)。递归用栈：快速排序平均 O(log n)。memo 用空间换时间。",
  ["Spawn re-imports your file in the child. Anything at top level runs again, including the spawning."] = "spawn 会在子进程里重新 import 你的文件。最外层的一切都会再跑一遍，包括那句启动进程。",
  ["Split in half, sort each half, merge. The merge is where the n comes from."] = "分成两半，各自排序，合并。n 就来自合并。",
  ["Split the app into packages and let the Times Square shop import it from GitHub. Paths, go.mod, go get, tags. Ship v1.0.0."] = "把 App 拆成包，让时代广场那家店从 GitHub 导入它。路径、go.mod、go get、标签。发布 v1.0.0。",
  ["Spread to all four neighbours: down, up, right, and the last one. Fill it."] = "扩散到四个邻居：下、上、右，还有最后一个。填上它。",
  ["Sprintf returns the text. %s string, %d int, %v anything."] = "Sprintf 返回文本。%s 是 string，%d 是 int，%v 什么都行。",
  ["Stairs, one or two steps at a time. How many ways reach step 2?"] = "楼梯，一次一级或两级。到第 2 级有几种走法？",
  ["Star before the type. & takes the address. *p reads through it."] = "类型前加星号。& 取地址。*p 通过它读取。",
  ["Star then the type name. A value receiver (o Order) would change a copy."] = "星号加类型名。值接收者 (o Order) 只会改一份副本。",
  ["Start a new module for the project. Fill the subcommand: go ___ init"] = "为项目新建一个 module。填子命令：go ___ init",
  ["Start a new thread that runs this closure. Which function?"] = "启动一个运行这个闭包的新线程。哪个函数？",
  ["Start a task in the background and keep going. Which tokio function?"] = "在后台启动一个任务，自己继续往下走。哪个 tokio 函数？",
  ["Start an anonymous function as a goroutine. What closes the line?"] = "把匿名函数作为 goroutine 启动。这一行怎么收尾？",
  ["Start fetch in the background and keep going without awaiting it yet. Which asyncio function?"] = "在后台启动 fetch，先不 await 它继续往下走。哪个 asyncio 函数？",
  ["Start fry() in a new goroutine. Which keyword?"] = "在新的 goroutine 里启动 fry()。哪个关键字？",
  ["Start the event loop with main(). Which asyncio function?"] = "用 main() 启动事件循环。哪个 asyncio 函数？",
  ["Start the fetch without waiting for it. Which keyword is Go's async?"] = "启动这次 fetch，但不等它。Go 的 async 是哪个关键字？",
  ['Start the server on port 8080 and block. Fill: http.___(":8080", nil)'] = '在 8080 端口启动服务器并阻塞。填：http.___(":8080", nil)',
  ["Start them all first, then join them all: otherwise the second loop waits for the first wok before lighting the second."] = "先全部 start，再全部 join：否则第二个循环会等第一口锅完了才点第二口。",
  ["Start three workers, counting each one first. Fill: wg.___(1)"] = "启动三个 worker，每个先计数。填空：wg.___(1)",
  ["Start with an empty dict. What literal is it?"] = "从一个空 dict 开始。字面量是什么？",
  ["Starting at 0 would answer 0 for [-3, -1]; the right answer is -1. Seed from the data."] = "从 0 开始会给 [-3, -1] 答 0；正确答案是 -1。用数据打底。",
  ["Starts like is_some(), then one more word joining a condition. Three words, two underscores."] = "开头像 is_some()，再接一个词连上条件。三个词，两个下划线。",
  ["Station to its neighbours: a dict whose missing keys start as an empty list. Fill the factory."] = "车站对应它的邻站：一个缺失键从空列表开始的 dict。填上工厂。",
  ["Steam. Hash brown. We did it."] = "热气。薯饼。我们做到了。",
  ["Step i is reached from one step below or two steps below. Fill dp[i]."] = "第 i 级从下一级或下两级到达。填上 dp[i]。",
  ["Stop everything: the till has no paper and that is a bug. Which built-in raises the crash?"] = "全部停下：收银机没纸了，这是个 bug。哪个内置函数触发崩溃？",
  ["Stop the child from spawning children. Which dunder goes in the guard?"] = "别让子进程再生子进程。guard 里放哪个 dunder？",
  ["Stop when the guest walks out. Fill: case <-ctx.___()"] = "客人走了就停。填空：case <-ctx.___()",
  ["StopIteration ends the protocol; return inside a generator raises it. The conveyor serves ten thousand bowls, one at a time."] = "StopIteration 结束协议；生成器里的 return 会抛出它。传送带一碗一碗上完一万碗。",
  ["Store into memo[n] before returning. Same shape works for any overlapping subproblem."] = "返回前先存进 memo[n]。任何重叠子问题都能用同样的套路。",
  ["String and &str"] = "String 与 &str",
  ["String owns, &str borrows. len() counts bytes, chars().count() counts characters."] = "String 拥有，&str 借用。len() 数字节，chars().count() 数字符。",
  ["String() string satisfies fmt.Stringer. Println and %v call it automatically."] = "String() string 满足 fmt.Stringer。Println 和 %v 会自动调用它。",
  ['String::from("..") or "..".to_string(). &str borrows, String owns and can grow.'] = 'String::from("..") 或 "..".to_string()。&str 借用，String 拥有并且可以增长。',
  ['Strings, not ints: "1" != 1 in Python. Read the input type before the first line.'] = '字符串，不是整数：在 Python 里 "1" != 1。写第一行之前先看清输入类型。',
  ["Strings, runes, bytes"] = "string、rune、byte",
  ["Struct tags and encoding/json"] = "struct tag 与 encoding/json",
  ["Struct tags are strings after the type. json, xml, db... each package reads its own."] = "struct tag 是类型后面的字符串。json、xml、db……每个包读自己的。",
  ["Structs, pointers, methods, interfaces"] = "struct、指针、方法、interface",
  ["Sum of every window of k items: add the newcomer, subtract the one that just left. Which index left?"] = "每个 k 个元素窗口的和：加上新来的，减去刚离开的。离开的是哪个下标？",
  ["Summing n prices with an iterator: what is the cost in Big O?"] = "用迭代器对 n 个价格求和：用 Big O 说代价多少？",
  ["Swap the first word for Thread and the same block does I/O instead. That is the whole API: one word decides which kind of parallelism you get."] = "把第一个词换成 Thread，同一段代码就改做 I/O 了。整套 API 就是这样：一个词决定你拿到哪一种并行。",
  ["Swap the whole menu in one step while readers are reading. Which atomic type?"] = "在读者正在读的时候，一步换掉整份菜单。用哪个原子类型？",
  ["Switch one select case off for good. What do you set the channel to?"] = "永久关掉 select 的一个分支。把 channel 设成什么？",
  ["T: PartialOrd + Copy. Bounds are checked at compile time, so largest(&[1.5, 2.5]) and largest(&[18, 22]) both work."] = "T: PartialOrd + Copy。约束在编译期检查，所以 largest(&[1.5, 2.5]) 和 largest(&[18, 22]) 都能用。",
  ["TAB again: answer   ESC map"] = "再按 TAB：答案   ESC 地图",
  ["TAB hint   F5 auto   ESC map"] = "TAB 提示   F5 自动   ESC 地图",
  ["TAB hint   F5 auto   F6 share   ESC map"] = "TAB 提示   F5 自动   F6 分享   ESC 地图",
  ["THREADS  -  the lunch rush"] = "THREADS  -  午市高峰",
  ["THREADS  ·  the lunch rush"] = "THREADS  ·  午市高峰",
  ["THREE LANGUAGES"] = "三种语言",
  ["Table 7 has a seat. Every other table has nothing. What does the last line return?"] = "7 号桌有座位。其他桌什么都没有。最后一行返回什么？",
  ["Tag it v1.0.0"] = "打上 v1.0.0 标签",
  ["Tags are immutable in Go's world: moving one breaks every go.sum that saw it. retract, then tag v1.0.2, is the only honest fix."] = "在 Go 的世界里标签是不可变的：移动一个标签会弄坏所有见过它的 go.sum。retract，然后打 v1.0.2，是唯一诚实的修法。",
  ["Take any Cook without naming a type parameter. Which keyword goes before the trait?"] = "接收任何 Cook，不用写类型参数名。trait 前面放哪个关键字？",
  ["Take one back out of the buffered channel. Arrow, then the channel's name."] = "从带缓冲的 channel 里取回一个。箭头，再加 channel 的名字。",
  ["Take one from stock, but only if nobody moved it since you read it. Which method?"] = "从库存里扣一件，但只有在你读完之后没人动过它时才扣。用哪个方法？",
  ['Take the address of a new Order so p is a *Order. Fill: p := ___Order{Item: "set"}'] = '取新 Order 的地址，让 p 成为 *Order。填空：p := ___Order{Item: "set"}',
  ["Take the front station off the queue. Fill: queue = queue[___]"] = "把队首车站出队。填空：queue = queue[___]",
  ["Take the next result, waiting if the queue is empty. Which method?"] = "取下一个结果，队列空了就等。用哪个方法？",
  ["Take the second and third tray, items 1 and 2. What goes in the brackets?"] = "取第二和第三个托盘，即第 1 和第 2 项。方括号里写什么？",
  ["Take the station that has waited longest. Which VecDeque method returns Option<u32> from the front?"] = "取出等得最久的那个站。哪个 VecDeque 方法从前面返回 Option<u32>？",
  ["Takes the key and the value by value. Returns the old value as an Option, which we ignore here."] = "按值接收键和值。把旧值作为 Option 返回，这里我们不管它。",
  ["Tea first, lifetimes second. The set is almost ready."] = "先喝茶，再学生命周期。套餐快好了。",
  ['Teach println!("{}") to print an Order. Which fmt trait?'] = '教 println!("{}") 打印 Order。哪个 fmt trait？',
  ["Tell an empty order from a shut belt. Name the second variable of the receive."] = "区分空订单和停下的传送带。说出接收的第二个变量名。",
  ["Tell receivers no more hash browns will come. Which built-in?"] = "告诉接收方不会再有薯饼了。哪个内置函数？",
  ["Test the package the way a caller sees it. Fill the suffix of the test package name."] = "以调用者看到的方式测试这个包。填上测试包名的后缀。",
  ["Text plus a number fails. Which built-in turns 4 into text first?"] = "文本加数字会失败。哪个内置函数先把 4 变成文本？",
  ["That is BFS: pop front, push unseen neighbours. First arrival is the shortest path."] = "这就是 BFS：弹出队首，压入未访问的邻居。最先到达的就是最短路径。",
  ["That is a trait. Go had interfaces; Rust makes you say impl."] = "那就是 trait。Go 有 interface；Rust 要你明说 impl。",
  ["That is the module path doing its job. Now he needs it pinned, or tomorrow's build is a different program."] = "那是模块路径在干它的活。现在他得把版本钉住，不然明天构建出来的就是另一个程序。",
  ["That is the second value of a receive. One line tells you which."] = "那是接收的第二个值。一行就能告诉你是哪一种。",
  ["That is why the sender closes: only the side that knows nothing more is coming can say so safely."] = "这就是由发送方关闭的原因：只有知道不会再有东西来的那一边，才能安全地这么说。",
  ["That push is the release. The proxy notices the tag the first time anyone asks for it; there is nothing else to upload."] = "那次推送就是发布。第一次有人来要时代理就会注意到这个标签；没有别的东西要上传。",
  ["The ! marks a macro call. Macros can take any number of arguments; functions cannot."] = "! 标记宏调用。宏可以接收任意数量的参数；函数不行。",
  ["The * you would write in resize(*job), spelled out, then map."] = "你会在 resize(*job) 里写的那个 *，用英文拼出来，再加 map。",
  ["The 1 a.m. callback is the Python round. Seven whiteboard classics. Get the OFFER."] = "凌晨一点的复试是 Python 回合。七道白板经典题。拿到 OFFER。",
  ["The 11:00 price change holds the write side. Which call does a reader make?"] = "11:00 的改价握着写的那一边。读者这边怎么调用？",
  ["The Express counter"] = "Express 柜台",
  ["The Express kiosks run Rust. Finish your coffee, I will show you main."] = "Express 的自助机跑的是 Rust。喝完咖啡，我带你看 main。",
  ["The Express kitchen"] = "Express 厨房",
  ["The Express set"] = "Express 套餐",
  ["The Express till"] = "Express 收银台",
  ["The GIL protects CPython's own memory bookkeeping. It makes single-threaded code fast and multi-threaded arithmetic pointless."] = "GIL 保护的是 CPython 自己的内存记账。它让单线程代码很快，也让多线程算术毫无意义。",
  ["The GIL serializes bytecode; C extensions and I/O release it. Python 3.13 can build without it. Three woks fry at once; the shift is over."] = "GIL 把字节码串行化；C 扩展和 I/O 会释放它。Python 3.13 可以构建成没有它。三口锅同时煎；夜班结束。",
  ["The Go 1.21 builtin that picks the larger of two ints."] = "Go 1.21 里取两个 int 较大值的内置函数。",
  ["The I in the middle of GIL, written out: the thing that runs your bytecode."] = "GIL 中间那个 I 的全写：运行你字节码的那样东西。",
  ['The JSON says "dish" but the field is name. Which serde attribute maps them?'] = 'JSON 里写 "dish"，字段却叫 name。哪个 serde 属性把它们对上？',
  ["The MTR gate is a function: tap(card) (ok bool, err error). Go functions can return more than one value. That is how errors travel."] = "港铁闸机是一个函数：tap(card) (ok bool, err error)。Go 函数可以返回多个值。错误就是这样传递的。",
  ["The MTR map is a graph. Level by level is BFS; as deep as you can is DFS."] = "港铁路线图就是一张图。一层一层走是 BFS；一路走到底是 DFS。",
  ["The O(n) fix: remember each name as you go. What value type makes the map a set?"] = "O(n) 的修法：一路记住每个名字。哪个值类型让 map 变成集合？",
  ["The O(n) fix: remember each name as you go. Which built-in is the set?"] = "O(n) 的修法：一路记住每个名字。哪个内置函数是集合？",
  ["The O(n) fix: remember each name as you go. Which std collection is the set?"] = "O(n) 的修法：一路记住每个名字。哪个 std 集合是集合？",
  ["The __name__ guard: the script runs main() when executed, stays quiet when imported. The shift begins."] = "__name__ 守卫：脚本被执行时运行 main()，被导入时保持安静。夜班开始。",
  ["The amount still to make after spending this one coin."] = "花掉这一枚硬币后还需要凑的金额。",
  ["The ampersand, then the same word that made a changeable."] = "& 符号，然后是让 a 可变的那个词。",
  ["The argument is evaluated on the defer line. Only the call is delayed."] = "参数在 defer 那一行就求值。只有调用被推迟。",
  ["The arrow leans out of the channel this time. Mirror of the chan<- next to it."] = "这次箭头是从 channel 里出来的。和旁边的 chan<- 正好相反。",
  ["The back office robot runs on generators, decorators and asyncio. Earn the midnight bowl."] = "后勤室的机器人靠生成器、装饰器和 asyncio 运转。赢得午夜那碗面。",
  ["The base class of every catchable error, capital E. Not BaseException: that one includes Ctrl-C."] = "所有可捕获错误的基类，大写 E。不是 BaseException：那个连 Ctrl-C 都包括。",
  ["The bell"] = "取餐铃",
  ["The belt is closed and empty. What comes out of the next receive?"] = "传送带关了，也空了。下一次接收会拿到什么？",
  ["The belt kept handing me empty trays after the kitchen shut. Empty tray, or no more trays?"] = "厨房关火之后，传送带还一直递空托盘给我。是空托盘，还是没有托盘了？",
  ["The belt to the counter"] = "通往柜台的传送带",
  ["The blank identifier. Compile error if you name a value you never use."] = "空白标识符。给一个从不使用的值命名会编译错误。",
  ["The board mixes prices, names and a sold-out flag. What is v today?"] = "菜单板混着价格、名字和一个售罄标记。今天 v 是什么？",
  ["The bool from the map lookup. True when the key exists."] = "map 查找返回的 bool。键存在时为 true。",
  ["The booth"] = "卡座",
  ["The booth code used to duplicate fry for every item. Generics write it once. A Kitchen that embeds Grill gets Grill's methods for free."] = "卡座的代码以前为每样餐点都复制一份 fry。泛型只写一次。嵌入 Grill 的 Kitchen 免费获得 Grill 的方法。",
  ["The buffer size is the number of tokens. The fourth send waits."] = "缓冲大小就是令牌数。第四次发送会等待。",
  ["The built-in constraint for types that allow == and !=."] = "允许 == 和 != 的类型的内置约束。",
  ["The built-in interface for failure. Last return value by convention."] = "表示失败的内置 interface。按惯例放在最后一个返回值。",
  ["The built-in that picks the smaller of two values."] = "在两个值里挑较小那个的内置函数。",
  ["The built-in whole-number type, three letters, after the colon."] = "内置的整数类型，三个字母，放在冒号后面。",
  ["The builtin that adds an element to the end of a slice."] = "往切片末尾添加元素的内置函数。",
  ["The builtin that adds to the end of a slice and returns the new slice."] = "往切片末尾添加元素并返回新切片的内置函数。",
  ["The builtin that ends a range. One goroutine waits for the workers and then calls it once."] = "结束 range 的那个内建函数。一个 goroutine 等齐 worker，然后调用它一次。",
  ["The builtin that takes a map and a key. Six letters."] = "接受一个 map 和一个键的内置函数。六个字母。",
  ["The busiest k hours: keep one running sum. The window moves right by one: add a[i], and subtract which element?"] = "最忙的 k 小时：只维护一个累计和。窗口右移一格：加上 a[i]，减去哪个元素？",
  ["The cache is 9 GB and one entry is corrupt. Wipe it. Fill the flag."] = "缓存有 9 GB，其中一条坏了。清掉它。填上标志。",
  ["The cache is read-only on purpose, so a corrupt entry cannot be edited, only removed. go.sum makes the re-download provably the same code."] = "缓存故意是只读的，所以坏掉的条目不能改，只能删。go.sum 保证重新下载的是可证明相同的代码。",
  ["The cheapest of three prices, no loop, no import. Which built-in (Go 1.21)?"] = "三个价格里最便宜的，不用循环，不用 import。哪个内置函数（Go 1.21）？",
  ["The child adds to a global and the parent still prints 0. What did the child change?"] = "子进程往一个全局变量上加，父进程还是打印 0。子进程改的是什么？",
  ["The classic bug is forgetting max: a short interval inside a long one must not cut it. last is &mut, so this writes into out."] = "经典 bug 是忘了 max：长区间里的短区间不能把它截断。last 是 &mut，所以这里直接写进 out。",
  ["The classics! Two-sum, palindrome, anagram. Everyone has done these. Once."] = "经典题！两数之和、回文、变位词。这些人人都做过。做过一次。",
  ["The closer-to-opener map from the first blank."] = "第一个空里那个闭括号到开括号的 map。",
  ["The cold room"] = "冷藏室",
  ["The combinatorics counter"] = "组合计数柜台",
  ["The combinatorics counter at the noodle stall: pick any toppings. Bo counts the combinations and the number doubles with every topping. He draws the curve that goes vertical almost at once."] = "面摊的组合计数柜台：任选配料。Bo 数组合，每多一种配料数目翻倍。他画那条几乎立刻竖起来的曲线。",
  ["The combinatorics counter at the noodle stall: pick any toppings. Bo counts the combinations and the number doubles with every topping. Mei draws the curve that goes vertical almost at once."] = "面摊的组合计数柜台：任选配料。Bo 数组合，每多一种配料数目翻倍。Mei 画那条几乎立刻竖起来的曲线。",
  ["The combinatorics counter at the noodle stall: pick any toppings. Bo counts the combinations and the number doubles with every topping. Mei draws the last curve, the one that goes vertical almost at once."] = "面摊的组合计数柜台：任选配料。Bo 数组合，每多一种配料数目翻倍。Mei 画最后一条曲线，几乎立刻就竖起来的那条。",
  ["The comma-ok idiom. Same word twice on those two lines."] = "comma-ok 惯用法。那两行用的是同一个词。",
  ["The compound operator that walks j one step toward the smaller values, on the left."] = "那个复合运算符，让 j 朝较小的值走一步，也就是往左。",
  ["The conveyor"] = "传送带",
  ["The conveyor carries bowls from the wok to the pass. Its script builds a list of every bowl of the night before serving the first. A generator would hand them out one at a time, and the belt would never wait."] = "传送带把碗从锅送到出餐口。它的脚本在上第一碗之前先构建当晚所有碗的列表。生成器会一次交出一碗，传送带永远不用等。",
  ["The conveyor script loads every bowl into memory at once. Ten thousand bowls."] = "传送带脚本把所有碗一次装进内存。一万碗。",
  ["The counter"] = "柜台",
  ["The counts drift and nothing crashes. Which flag makes the test print WARNING: DATA RACE?"] = "数字对不上，却什么都不崩。哪个 flag 让测试打印 WARNING: DATA RACE？",
  ["The cousin asks which version is safe. Right now the answer is 'whichever commit was on main when he ran go get'."] = "表哥问哪个版本安全。现在的答案是「他跑 go get 时 main 上碰巧是哪个提交」。",
  ["The cousin wants the newest tag, whatever it is. Fill the version query."] = "表哥想要最新的标签，不管是哪个。填上版本查询。",
  ["The cousin's shop imported my rider package and now they call the function I wanted to delete."] = "表哥的店导入了我的 rider 包，现在他们在调用我本来想删掉的函数。",
  ["The crash that pairs with recover. Six letters here, in the third person."] = "和 recover 成对的那种崩溃。这里用第三人称。",
  ["The cube is a slice of ads. append one more."] = "方块是广告的 slice。再 append 一条。",
  ["The curly opener, as a char literal in single quotes."] = "花括号的左半边，用单引号包住的字符字面量。",
  ["The curly opener, as a one-character string like the other two values."] = "花括号的开括号，写成单字符字符串，和另外两个值一样。",
  ["The current index: the right edge of the window."] = "当前下标：窗口的右边缘。",
  ["The current value. Its partner is target minus it."] = "当前值。它的搭档是 target 减去它。",
  ["The customer closed the app two minutes ago and your goroutine is still fetching the ETA."] = "客人两分钟前就关掉 App 了，你的 goroutine 还在取 ETA。",
  ["The decorator builds an inner function and must hand it back. What does timer return?"] = "装饰器构建一个内层函数并且必须把它交回去。timer 返回什么？",
  ["The delivery radio"] = "外卖对讲机",
  ["The delivery radio at the door. Three riders report their position; the script asks each in turn and waits a full second for every answer. Asked at once, the three answers would arrive together."] = "门口的外卖对讲机。三个骑手报告位置；脚本逐个询问，每个答案都等足一秒。同时问的话，三个答案会一起到。",
  ["The dict defined on the first line, the one written to two lines below the blank."] = "第一行定义的那个 dict，空格下面两行写入的那个。",
  ["The dict from the first line of the body, value to index."] = "函数体第一行的那个 dict，值对应索引。",
  ["The dict method that removes and returns one (key, value) pair; last=False takes it from the front."] = "移除并返回一个 (key, value) 对的 dict 方法；last=False 从最前面取。",
  ["The digit for land, as a byte literal in single quotes."] = "表示陆地的数字，写成单引号里的字节字面量。",
  ["The digit one as a u8: a b before the single quotes."] = "数字一的 u8 形式：单引号前面加一个 b。",
  ["The directory the file sits in, nothing more. Look at how rider is done on the next line."] = "文件所在的目录，仅此而已。看看下一行 rider 是怎么写的。",
  ["The directory's name. It could legally be anything, and it should be this."] = "目录的名字。法律上写什么都行，但就应该是这个。",
  ["The door sensor counts every customer. Only one number, thousands of times a minute."] = "门口传感器数着每一位客人。只有一个数字，每分钟几千次。",
  ["The dumbwaiter"] = "送菜升降机",
  ["The element on its own: a run that begins right here and has nothing before it."] = "元素自身：一段从这里开始、前面什么都没有的序列。",
  ["The element that just fell off the left edge: k places behind i."] = "刚从左边掉出去的那个元素：在 i 后面 k 个位置。",
  ["The element that just fell off the left edge: k positions behind i."] = "刚从左边缘掉出去的那个元素：在 i 后面 k 个位置。",
  ["The element type, plural, capitalized, like sort.Ints for ints."] = "元素类型的复数，大写开头，像 int 的 sort.Ints。",
  ["The empty till. Making nothing takes no coins at all."] = "空收银台。什么都不凑，一枚硬币都不用。",
  ["The end of every Python chain, capital N."] = "每条 Python 链的尽头，大写 N。",
  ["The entry API: one lookup, insert or update. The classics done, no misses. Combo x6. One round left."] = "entry API：一次查找，要么插入要么更新。经典题做完，零失误。连击 x6。还剩一个回合。",
  ["The evening CODE RUSH is the Rust round. Seven classic problems. Get HIRED."] = "傍晚的 CODE RUSH 是 Rust 回合。七道经典题。拿到录用。",
  ["The evening callback is the Rust round. Seven whiteboard classics. Get the OFFER."] = "傍晚的复试是 Rust 回合。七道白板经典题。拿到 OFFER。",
  ["The evicted key must leave the map too, or the cache leaks. Which HashMap method deletes by key?"] = "被淘汰的键也必须离开 map，否则缓存会泄漏。哪个 HashMap 方法按键删除？",
  ["The field from stage one. Borrow it with &, and cur stays a &Link."] = "第一关的那个字段。用 & 借用它，cur 就还是 &Link。",
  ["The field that is not right. Mei said it in her speech bubble."] = "不是 right 的那个字段。Mei 在对话框里说过。",
  ["The file is menu/price.go. What does its first line say?"] = "文件是 menu/price.go。它的第一行写什么？",
  ["The final round. Three cook threads pull orders from one queue and fry them. Bo has to feed the queue, drain it safely, mark every job finished and wait for the last one before the receipt prints. Then the screen says HIRED."] = "最后一回合。三个厨师线程从一个队列取订单并煎制。Bo 要喂队列、安全地清空它、给每个任务标记完成，并在收据打印前等到最后一个。然后屏幕显示 HIRED。",
  ["The final sheet is a grid of bytes: '1' is land, '0' is water, Hong Kong Island and Kowloon and a scatter of rocks. Siu Ming wants the count. Alex writes a recursive dfs that sinks whatever it touches, then a double loop that calls it on every '1' still standing and counts the calls. The marker squeaks. Then: OFFER."] = "最后一张纸是一个字节网格：'1' 是陆地，'0' 是水，香港岛、九龙，还有零星几块礁石。小明要数出个数。Alex 写一个递归 dfs，碰到什么就沉掉什么，再写一个双重循环，对每个还立着的 '1' 调用它并数调用次数。马克笔吱吱作响。然后：OFFER。",
  ["The final. 01:40. Siu Ming draws Causeway Bay as a grid: 1 for a building, 0 for the road. Bo has to count the islands of buildings, each a patch of 1s touching up, down, left or right. One DFS per island, sinking it as it goes; the count of sinkings is the answer, and the answer is the OFFER."] = "决赛。01:40。小明把铜锣湾画成网格：1 是楼，0 是路。Bo 要数出楼组成的岛，每座岛是一片上下左右相连的 1。每座岛一次 DFS，边走边沉；沉岛的次数就是答案，而答案就是 OFFER。",
  ["The first element of each pair is the start."] = "每一对的第一个元素就是起点。",
  ["The first element. The loop then starts from the second, see the slice."] = "第一个元素。循环随后从第二个开始，看那个切片。",
  ["The first handler argument is where the reply goes. Fill its type: w http.___"] = "handler 的第一个参数是回复要写去的地方。填它的类型：w http.___",
  ["The first letter of format. Since Python 3.6."] = "format 的第一个字母。从 Python 3.6 开始。",
  ["The first line of go.mod names the module. Which keyword?"] = "go.mod 的第一行给 module 命名。哪个关键字？",
  ["The flat"] = "公寓",
  ["The flood function from the blanks above."] = "上面几个空里的那个洪水填充函数。",
  ["The flood stops at the edge of the map. Fill the row check."] = "洪水到地图边缘就停。填上行的检查。",
  ["The footbridge to Times Square"] = "通往时代广场的天桥",
  ["The four-letter function from the prelude that ends a value early. Not close: channels have no close."] = "prelude 里那个四个字母的函数，提前结束一个值的生命。不是 close：channel 没有 close。",
  ["The free slots are the gaps between merged blocks: pair each block with the next. Fill the slice."] = "空闲时段就是合并块之间的空隙：把每个块和下一个配对。填这个切片。",
  ["The free-threaded build removes the GIL and pays for it in single-thread speed and C extension support. Until it is the default, processes are the answer."] = "free-threaded 构建拿掉了 GIL，代价是单线程速度和 C 扩展支持。在它成为默认之前，答案还是进程。",
  ["The full word this time. Then the go version, then require lines."] = "这次是完整的词。然后是 go 版本，再是 require 行。",
  ["The function calls itself. Same name as on the last line."] = "函数调用自己。名字和最后一行相同。",
  ["The function itself. The map is shared, so a plain map argument works."] = "函数自己。map 是共享的，直接传 map 参数即可。",
  ["The function that measures a string, passed by name, no parentheses."] = "测量字符串的那个函数，按名字传入，不带括号。",
  ["The function's own name. The recursion is the stack."] = "函数自己的名字。递归就是栈。",
  ["The generic one that holds an address, not a number."] = "那个装地址而不是装数字的泛型类型。",
  ["The go directive also picks language semantics: for-loop variables became per-iteration only for modules that say go 1.22 or later."] = "go 指令还决定语言语义：for 循环变量变成每次迭代独立，只对声明 go 1.22 或更高的模块生效。",
  ["The grid holds bytes, not ints: '1' is 49, 1 is 1. Compare with the character."] = "网格存的是字节，不是 int：'1' 是 49，1 是 1。要和字符比较。",
  ["The grid holds one-character strings, and the road is the zero."] = "网格里放的是单字符字符串，路是零。",
  ["The grill line"] = "烤架流水线",
  ["The growable array. Three letters, capital V. A neighbour can be pushed on."] = "可增长的数组。三个字母，大写 V 开头。可以往里 push 一个邻居。",
  ["The heap never grows past k: O(n log k) time, O(k) space. Sorting would be O(n log n) and O(n)."] = "堆从不超过 k：O(n log k) 时间，O(k) 空间。排序会是 O(n log n) 和 O(n)。",
  ["The heap package does the sifting; your Pop only trims the tail. O(log n) per operation."] = "heap 包负责上浮下沉；你的 Pop 只需截掉尾巴。每次操作 O(log n)。",
  ["The host, the user, the repo, joined with slashes, no https://. The tool echoes it back on the next line."] = "主机、用户、仓库，用斜杠连起来，不要 https://。工具会在下一行原样回显。",
  ["The index enumerate hands out, one letter. The return line reads it back."] = "enumerate 交出来的索引，一个字母。return 那一行把它读回来。",
  ["The index just checked, plus one: everything up to it is too small."] = "刚检查过的索引加一：到它为止的全部都太小。",
  ["The index of the left half, mirroring j++ in the else."] = "左半段的下标，对应 else 里的 j++。",
  ["The inner def's name, without parentheses: the function itself, not a call of it."] = "内层 def 的名字，不带括号：函数本身，不是对它的调用。",
  ["The int32 code point type. Indexing a string gives bytes."] = "int32 的码点类型。对字符串取下标得到的是字节。",
  ["The interview asked me this three times. Let's get it right in Go first."] = "面试问了我三次这个。先用 Go 把它搞对。",
  ["The interview convention: a negative one, since cached values are non-negative."] = "面试惯例：负一，因为缓存的值都是非负的。",
  ["The invariant: map.len() == order.len(), always. Break it once and the cap check lies."] = "不变量：map.len() == order.len()，永远成立。破坏一次，cap 检查就会说谎。",
  ["The jobs are tiny and the pool is slower than one core. Which argument fixes it?"] = "任务很小，池子比一个核还慢。改哪个参数能救？",
  ["The key exactly as the phone spells it, inside the quotes."] = "引号里填 key，和手机的写法一模一样。",
  ["The keyword type, where a type name would go. Only inside a switch."] = "关键字 type，放在类型名的位置。只能在 switch 里用。",
  ["The kiosk"] = "自助机",
  ['The kiosk reads "18" from the keypad. Turn it into an i32. Which method?'] = '自助机从键盘读到 "18"。把它变成 i32。哪个方法？',
  ["The kiosk row"] = "自助机一排",
  ["The kiosk wants one function for prices and for weights. Go had any; what now?"] = "自助机想用一个函数同时处理价格和重量。Go 有 any；现在怎么办？",
  ["The kitchen"] = "厨房",
  ["The kitchen at 23:00"] = "23:00 的厨房",
  ["The kitchen build box has no internet. Copy every dependency into the repo. Fill the subcommand."] = "厨房的构建机没有网络。把每个依赖复制进仓库。填上子命令。",
  ["The kitchen is concurrent. One cook cannot wait for the hash brown before starting the muffin. go fry() starts a function in a new goroutine."] = "厨房是并发的。厨师不能等薯饼做完再开始做松饼。go fry() 在新的 goroutine 里启动函数。",
  ["The kitchen sends one more order after closing. What happens?"] = "关闭之后厨房又发了一张单。会怎样？",
  ["The kitchen waits until an order arrives. Which method blocks and takes one?"] = "厨房一直等到订单到来。哪个方法阻塞并取一个？",
  ["The label maker"] = "标签机",
  ["The label maker printed 'None' on forty bowls. Somebody returned nothing."] = "标签机在四十碗上打印了 'None'。有人什么都没返回。",
  ["The label maker prints a name and a price per bowl. Half its functions return None by accident and nobody noticed until forty bowls said so. Type hints would have caught it before the shift."] = "标签机为每碗打印名字和价格。它一半的函数不小心返回 None，直到四十碗都这样写才有人发现。类型标注本可以在开工前抓到。",
  ["The larger of the two ends wins; a shift fully inside another must not shrink the block."] = "两个终点中较大的胜出；完全落在另一个里面的班次不能让块缩小。",
  ["The last arm must catch every other number. Which pattern matches anything?"] = "最后一个分支必须接住其余所有数字。哪个模式匹配一切？",
  ["The last expression is the return value. One pass, one stack: O(n) time, O(n) space at worst."] = "最后一个表达式就是返回值。一次遍历，一个栈：O(n) 时间，最坏 O(n) 空间。",
  ["The last index of a slice of n items."] = "n 个元素的切片的最后一个下标。",
  ["The last item of a Vec in one step, as an Option. Which method?"] = "一步取 Vec 的最后一项，以 Option 形式。哪个方法？",
  ["The last item of a list in one step, without len. Which index?"] = "不用 len 一步取列表的最后一项。哪个索引？",
  ["The last item of a slice in one step. What is subtracted from the length?"] = "一步取切片的最后一项。长度减去什么？",
  ["The last sheet before the break is the classic: an LRU cache. Lucky Mac's menu service is slow, keep the hundred most recently asked-for menus in memory, throw out the one nobody has touched for longest. Alex draws a map on the left and a doubly linked list on the right and joins them with arrows."] = "休息前的最后一张纸是经典题：LRU 缓存。幸运麦的菜单服务很慢，把最近被查询的一百份菜单留在内存里，把最久没人碰的那份扔掉。Alex 在左边画一张 map，右边画一条双向链表，再用箭头把它们连起来。",
  ["The last stop points nowhere. What is next set to at creation?"] = "最后一站不指向任何地方。创建时 next 设成什么？",
  ["The last tray, without len. Which index?"] = "不用 len 取最后一个托盘。哪个索引？",
  ["The left pointer only ever moves right, so the while loop costs O(n) over the whole run, not per r."] = "左指针只会向右移，所以整个过程中 while 循环总共只花 O(n)，而不是每个 r 都花。",
  ["The length of any collection has which unsigned, pointer-sized type?"] = "任何集合的长度都是哪个无符号、指针大小的类型？",
  ["The letter v and the new major number, as the last element of the path. Tag it v2.0.0."] = "字母 v 加新的主版本号，作为路径的最后一段。打标签 v2.0.0。",
  ["The lift"] = "电梯",
  ["The lift panel is a tiny Go program. Floor, name, and a constant for Lucky Mac's opening hour. Zero values matter: an unset int is not blank."] = "电梯面板是个小 Go 程序。楼层、名字，还有 Lucky Mac 营业时间的常量。零值很重要：未赋值的 int 不是空白。",
  ["The list forgot the node; the map must forget the key too. Which builtin removes a map entry?"] = "链表忘掉了节点；map 也必须忘掉这个键。哪个内置函数删除 map 条目？",
  ["The list method that grows the end. The end of the list is the top of the stack."] = "让列表末尾变长的那个方法。列表末尾就是栈顶。",
  ["The lock needs no constructor: its zero value is ready. Which type?"] = "这把锁不需要构造函数，零值就能用。是哪个类型？",
  ["The log tailer must not keep the batch alive. Which flag makes a child die with its parent?"] = "日志跟踪器不该把整批活儿吊着。哪个标志让子进程随父进程一起死？",
  ["The loop keyword, inside the brackets, after the expression."] = "循环关键字，放在方括号里、表达式后面。",
  ["The mall atrium"] = "商场中庭",
  ["The map finds the node in O(1); the list moves it in O(1). Neither alone can do both."] = "map 用 O(1) 找到节点；链表用 O(1) 移动它。单靠任何一个都做不到两者兼得。",
  ["The menu board"] = "菜单板",
  ["The menu board at the shutter. Prices live in a dict, dish to dollars. It is Go's map with braces instead of make, and a KeyError instead of a zero value when the dish is missing."] = "卷帘门旁的菜单板。价格住在一个 dict 里，菜名对应元。它是 Go 的 map，用大括号代替 make，菜不存在时抛 KeyError 而不是零值。",
  ["The menu board reads prices from a dict. Ask for a dish we do not have and it crashes."] = "菜单板从一个 dict 读价格。问一道我们没有的菜，它就崩。",
  ["The menu is read by two hundred goroutines and written once an hour. Which lock?"] = "菜单被两百个 goroutine 读，一小时才写一次。用哪种锁？",
  ["The menu is read often, written rarely. Which method takes a shared read guard?"] = "菜单常读少写。哪个方法拿一个共享的读守卫？",
  ["The menu maps dish names to prices. Which generic takes two types?"] = "菜单把菜名映射到价格。哪个泛型接收两个类型？",
  ["The merge pass is O(n); the sort before it makes the whole thing O(n log n)."] = "合并这一趟是 O(n)；前面的排序让整体变成 O(n log n)。",
  ["The method reads its own item. What is the first parameter of every method?"] = "方法读取自己的 item。每个方法的第一个参数是什么？",
  ["The middle index without overflow. Fill: mid := lo + (hi-lo)/___"] = "不溢出的中点下标。填空：mid := lo + (hi-lo)/___",
  ["The midnight CODE RUSH is the Python round. Seven classic problems. Get HIRED."] = "午夜的 CODE RUSH 是 Python 回合。七道经典题。拿到录用。",
  ["The mirror of the helper on the next line: n, then the superlative of big."] = "下一行那个辅助函数的镜像：n，然后是 big 的最高级。",
  ["The module name, singular, capitalized. Go's go keyword, as an object."] = "模块名的单数，大写。Go 的 go 关键字，作为一个对象。",
  ["The module path from the comment, a slash, the directory. Not menu on its own, not ./menu."] = "注释里的模块路径、一个斜杠、目录。不是光写 menu，也不是 ./menu。",
  ["The module path is a name, not a URL: nothing is fetched when you init. It only has to match the repo later, when somebody else runs go get on it."] = "模块路径是一个名字，不是 URL：init 时什么都不会下载。它只需要在以后别人 go get 时和仓库对得上。",
  ["The module path is the import path"] = "模块路径就是导入路径",
  ["The module's name, an underscore, and the side an equal item is inserted on: the left one here."] = "模块名、一条下划线，以及相等项插入的那一边：这里是左边。",
  ["The module's name, capitalized. Not deque: that one has no locks."] = "模块名，大写开头。不是 deque：那个没有锁。",
  ["The module's name, singular, after the dot. It is a decorator, so it sits on the line above the class."] = "模块名的单数，放在点后面。它是装饰器，所以坐在 class 上面一行。",
  ["The module's own name in CamelCase, the two words joined."] = "模块自己的名字写成 CamelCase，两个词拼在一起。",
  ["The module's own name, in double underscores. It is '__main__' only in the script you ran."] = "模块自己的名字，前后各两条下划线。只有在你运行的那个脚本里它才是 '__main__'。",
  ["The morning set"] = "早餐套餐",
  ["The multiplicative identity. Returning 0 would zero every factorial."] = "乘法单位元。返回 0 会让所有阶乘都变成 0。",
  ["The name imported on the first line. Since 3.10 you may write the type, a pipe, and None instead."] = "第一行导入的名字。3.10 起可以写类型、一条竖线、None 代替。",
  ["The name imported on the first line: a pool of threads that executes."] = "第一行导入的名字：一个会执行的线程池。",
  ["The name is a short string, so the argument you pickle is tiny no matter how large the block is. That is the whole trick."] = "这个名字是一小串字符，所以不管这块内存多大，你 pickle 的参数都极小。诀窍全在这里。",
  ["The name saved on the first line of the loop, before the pointer was flipped. cur.next is no longer it."] = "循环第一行、翻转指针之前存下的名字。cur.next 已经不是它了。",
  ["The name x, wrapped in the vertical bar character on both sides."] = "名字 x，两边各包一个竖线字符。",
  ["The new sign says 銅鑼灣. The app counts it as nine letters."] = "新招牌写着 銅鑼灣。app 数成了九个字母。",
  ["The next sheet is a stream: order totals arriving faster than anyone could sort them. Siu Ming wants the kth largest at any moment. Go has no heap type, only container/heap and an interface to satisfy. Alex writes IntHeap on the board, five methods, and a loop that never lets the heap grow past k."] = "下一张纸是一条数据流：订单总额涌来的速度快得没人能排序。小明要随时知道第 k 大。Go 没有堆类型，只有 container/heap 和一个要实现的接口。Alex 在板上写下 IntHeap，五个方法，再加一个绝不让堆超过 k 的循环。",
  ["The night shift at Lucky Mac runs on Chef Bo's Python scripts. Fix every station before closing."] = "幸运麦的夜班靠 Bo 厨师的 Python 脚本运转。关门前修好每一个岗位。",
  ["The node that was before cur, saved on the first line. That is what reversing means."] = "cur 前面的那个节点，第一行存起来的。这就是反转的意思。",
  ["The node we just came from. nil on the first step, which becomes the new tail."] = "我们刚经过的节点。第一步时是 nil，它会成为新的尾部。",
  ["The note may be text or None. Which typing name says so?"] = "备注可能是文本也可能是 None。哪个 typing 名字这么说？",
  ["The number of columns: the length of one row, say the first."] = "列数：一行的长度，比如第一行。",
  ["The number of times you can halve n. Same answer as the phone book, applied to memory."] = "能把 n 减半的次数。和电话簿一样的答案，用在内存上。",
  ["The old position of this char, from the map lookup."] = "这个字符的旧位置，来自 map 查找。",
  ["The one everybody gets asked, Chef. In Python the dict already remembers the order for you."] = "人人都被问过的那题，厨师。在 Python 里 dict 已经替你记着顺序了。",
  ["The one package name that does not follow its directory. The same word as the function."] = "唯一一个不跟随目录名的包名。和那个函数是同一个词。",
  ["The opposite end from the front, where the untouched ones drift."] = "和最前相反的那一端，没人碰的都漂到那里。",
  ["The opposite of Lock. defer it on the very next line."] = "Lock 的反义。紧接着下一行就 defer 它。",
  ["The opposite of absolute. Paths that start with ./ or ../ are it."] = "absolute 的反面。以 ./ 或 ../ 开头的路径就是。",
  ["The opposite of direct. Your code never names it; something you require does."] = "direct 的反面。你的代码从没提到它；是你 require 的某个东西需要它。",
  ["The opposite of held. Past participle, eight letters."] = "「握着」的反面。过去分词。",
  ["The opposite of insert, six letters. Takes a reference, returns whether it was there."] = "insert 的反面，六个字母。接受引用，返回它原本是否存在。",
  ["The opposite of output. It shows the prompt and returns a str, always a str."] = "output 的反义词。它显示提示并返回 str，永远是 str。",
  ["The opposite of the -- below. Go's ++ is a statement, not an expression."] = "下面 -- 的反义。Go 的 ++ 是语句，不是表达式。",
  ["The order app"] = "点单 app",
  ["The order queue"] = "订单队列",
  ["The order robot"] = "点餐机器人",
  ["The other child. max is a Go 1.21 built-in."] = "另一个子节点。max 是 Go 1.21 的内置函数。",
  ["The other direction: struct to bytes. Same word without the De in front."] = "反方向：struct 到字节。同一个词，去掉前面的 De。",
  ["The other half of Option. Not nil, not null. Four letters, capital N."] = "Option 的另一半。不是 nil，也不是 null。四个字母，大写 N 开头。",
  ["The other variant of Option. Capital N, no parentheses."] = "Option 的另一个变体。大写 N，不带括号。",
  ["The p >= l test matters: a repeat before the window's left edge is already outside and must not pull l back."] = "p >= l 这个判断很重要：窗口左边缘之前的重复项已经在窗口外，不能把 l 往回拉。",
  ["The package function that removes the root and returns it."] = "移除堆顶并返回它的包级函数。",
  ["The package that holds WaitGroup and Once, then the six-letter word for a lock."] = "装着 WaitGroup 和 Once 的那个包，再加上表示锁的那六个字母。",
  ["The package the Go tool looks for when you type go run."] = "输入 go run 时，Go 工具要找的那个 package。",
  ["The parameter, the station already in seen on the line above."] = "那个参数，上一行已经在 seen 里的车站。",
  ["The parent must not print the total before the child finishes. Which method?"] = "子进程没做完，父进程不能先打印总数。用哪个方法？",
  ["The parse fails. Which method gives a fallback value instead of a panic?"] = "解析失败了。哪个方法给一个兜底值而不是 panic？",
  ["The part already flipped. None on the first lap, which becomes the new tail."] = "已经翻过来的那一段。第一圈是 None，它会变成新的尾巴。",
  ["The pass"] = "出餐口",
  ["The pass holds three trays; a fourth send should wait. Which constructor?"] = "出餐口放得下三个托盘；第四次 send 应该等。哪个构造函数？",
  ["The pass window"] = "出餐窗口",
  ["The pass window is a channel. One goroutine fries, another plates. Do not share the same variable; send the value through the pipe."] = "出餐口是一个 channel。一个 goroutine 煎，另一个装盘。不要共享同一个变量；把值通过管道送过去。",
  ["The pass window, 22:30. Chef Bo's recipe file is a list of functions: fry, brew, plate. Alex knows func; here it is three letters and a colon, and the body is whatever is indented under it."] = "出餐窗口，22:30。Bo 厨师的菜谱文件是一串函数：fry、brew、plate。Alex 认识 func；这里是三个字母加一个冒号，函数体就是下面缩进的一切。",
  ["The pass, 21:00"] = "出餐口，21:00",
  ["The path is long but unambiguous: two modules can both have a menu directory and never collide. The name you use in code is the package's own name, menu."] = "路径长，但没有歧义：两个模块都可以有 menu 目录而永不相撞。代码里用的名字是包自己的名字 menu。",
  ["The phone book"] = "电话簿",
  ["The phone book street's answer, without the O( ). Halving each step."] = "电话簿街的答案，去掉 O( )。每步减半。",
  ["The phone calls the field dish, not Item. Fill the tag so json reads that key."] = "手机把这个字段叫 dish，不叫 Item。填 tag，让 json 读那个 key。",
  ['The phone sends the price as text. Parse "18" into an int. Which strconv function?'] = '手机把价格当文本发过来。把 "18" 解析成 int。用 strconv 的哪个函数？',
  ['The phone sends {"dish":"set"}. Our struct says Item. Nothing arrives.'] = '手机发来 {"dish":"set"}。我们的 struct 写的是 Item。什么都没收到。',
  ["The pickup bell is a select. Whichever channel is ready first wins. If none are ready, default fires instead of blocking the till."] = "取餐铃是一个 select。哪个 channel 先就绪就选哪个。都没就绪时，default 执行，不会卡住收银机。",
  ["The pickup queue"] = "取餐队伍",
  ["The pointer field, twice in a row. The while condition guards both hops."] = "指针字段，连续两次。while 条件守住两次跳跃。",
  ["The pointer that walks the list. prev is the new head once it is nil."] = "遍历链表的那个指针。它变成 nil 时 prev 就是新头。",
  ["The pot is empty mid-loop. Which keyword leaves the loop at once?"] = "循环中途锅空了。哪个关键字立刻离开循环？",
  ["The prices are sorted. Find 45 in O(log n). Which slice method returns Result<usize, usize>?"] = "价格已经有序。用 O(log n) 找到 45。哪个切片方法返回 Result<usize, usize>？",
  ["The proxy and the private repo"] = "代理与私有仓库",
  ["The proxy is why go get is fast and why a deleted GitHub repo does not break the world: it keeps every version it ever served."] = "代理是 go get 快的原因，也是一个被删掉的 GitHub 仓库不会弄坏全世界的原因：它留着自己提供过的每一个版本。",
  ["The queue"] = "队列",
  ["The queue at Lucky Mac Express"] = "幸运麦 Express 的队伍",
  ["The queue begins with one station. Which one?"] = "队列从一个车站开始。哪一个？",
  ["The queue counter"] = "排队计数器",
  ["The queue is a linked list. Reverse it without allocating, then find the loop."] = "队列是一个链表。不分配内存把它反转，再找出环。",
  ["The queue is a struct of orders. A method with a pointer receiver can change the order. The till only knows the Pay() interface, not the card type."] = "排队是一个订单的 struct。指针接收者的方法能修改订单。收银机只认识 Pay() interface，不认识卡的类型。",
  ["The queue outside the shutter. To total everyone's bill you visit each person once. Bo draws the diagonal, and reminds Alex that a built-in like sum hides the loop, not its cost."] = "卷帘门外的队。要算出每个人的账单总额，每人访问一次。Bo 画出对角线，并提醒 Alex：像 sum 这样的内置函数藏起了循环，藏不起代价。",
  ["The queue outside the shutter. To total everyone's bill you visit each person once. Mei draws the diagonal again, and Alex writes it as an iterator chain instead of a loop."] = "卷帘门外的队。要算出每个人的账单总额，每人访问一次。Mei 再画对角线，Alex 用迭代器链而不是循环写出来。",
  ["The queue outside the shutter. To total the bill of everyone in it you visit each person once. Mei draws the second line on the whiteboard: a straight diagonal. Double the queue, double the work."] = "卷帘门外的队。要算出队里每个人的账单总额，每人访问一次。Mei 在白板上画第二条线：一条笔直的对角线。队伍翻倍，工作翻倍。",
  ["The race detector watches real memory accesses, so it only sees races the run actually hits. Run your tests with it in CI."] = "竞态检测器盯着真实的内存访问，所以它只看得到这次运行真的撞上的竞态。在 CI 里带着它跑测试。",
  ["The rack script lists trays. It drops the last one every time."] = "货架脚本列出托盘。每次都漏掉最后一个。",
  ["The receipt borrows your name. It must not outlive you. That is all a lifetime says."] = "收据借用了你的名字。它不能活得比你久。生命周期说的就这么多。",
  ["The recursive call must shrink the problem. Fill: n * fact(___)"] = "递归调用必须让问题变小。填空：n * fact(___)",
  ["The recursive call must shrink the problem. Fill: return n * fact(___)"] = "递归调用必须缩小问题。填空：return n * fact(___)",
  ["The recursive flood written above, four letters. Takes &mut g and the cell."] = "上面写的那个递归洪泛，四个字母。接受 &mut g 和那一格。",
  ["The refund desk"] = "退款台",
  ["The repeat is gone: b[r] joins the window. Which HashSet method adds it?"] = "重复的没了：b[r] 加入窗口。哪个 HashSet 方法添加它？",
  ["The repeat sits at p, inside the window. The window must restart just after it. Fill."] = "重复项在 p，位于窗口之内。窗口必须从它之后重新开始。填空。",
  ["The repo is private and the proxy answers 404. Which variable sends those paths straight to git?"] = "仓库是私有的，代理回答 404。哪个变量把这些路径直接送去 git？",
  ["The rest of the chain, or nothing at the end. Which type wraps Box<ListNode> so it can be empty?"] = "链条剩下的部分，或者末尾什么都没有。哪个类型把 Box<ListNode> 包起来，让它可以为空？",
  ['The rider app sends JSON with "dish", our struct says "name". serde can bridge it.'] = '骑手 app 发来的 JSON 里写 "dish"，我们的 struct 却叫 "name"。serde 能架起桥。',
  ["The rider app sends text. Parse it back into an Order. Which function?"] = "骑手 app 发来文本。把它解析回 Order。哪个函数？",
  ["The rider who gave up"] = "放弃等待的骑手",
  ["The road value, as a one-character string. Sinking is the visited set for free."] = "路的值，写成单字符字符串。沉掉就等于免费的 visited 集合。",
  ["The robot is a class. One Order per bowl. It forgot how to make itself."] = "机器人是一个类。一碗一个 Order。它忘了怎么创造自己。",
  ["The rooftop"] = "天台",
  ["The root of a heap lives at the first index of the slice."] = "堆顶在切片的第一个下标。",
  ["The root of every request tree. Fill: ctx := context.___()"] = "每棵请求树的根。填空：ctx := context.___()",
  ["The round opener, as a rune literal in single quotes."] = "圆括号的开括号，写成单引号里的 rune 字面量。",
  ["The run so far with x added. If that is worse than x alone, the old run was dead weight."] = "到目前为止的这段加上 x。如果比 x 单独还差，旧的那段就是累赘。",
  ["The safe"] = "保险柜",
  ["The safe behind the till holds the stock file. The script opens it, writes, and forgets to close when a line is bad. Alex knows defer f.Close(); Python puts the whole idea into one keyword."] = "收银机后面的保险柜放着库存文件。脚本打开它、写入，遇到坏行就忘了关。Alex 认识 defer f.Close()；Python 把整个想法放进一个关键字。",
  ["The same customer is in the queue list twice. Which built-in keeps each name once?"] = "同一个顾客在排队列表里出现两次。哪个内置函数让每个名字只留一次？",
  ["The same function the right side of the == already uses. It takes a string and returns a list of characters."] = "== 右边已经在用的同一个函数。它接收一个字符串，返回一个字符列表。",
  ["The same keyword as for slices, now on an int. No i := 0; i < 3; i++."] = "和遍历 slice 用的同一个关键字，现在用在 int 上。不用 i := 0; i < 3; i++。",
  ["The same mark that ends a question."] = "和问句结尾的是同一个符号。",
  ["The same method that appends to any Vec. The top of the stack is the end of the Vec."] = "和往任何 Vec 末尾追加的方法一样。栈顶就是 Vec 的末尾。",
  ["The same shape as threading.Thread, one word, capitalised. What the operating system schedules."] = "和 threading.Thread 一样的形状，一个词，首字母大写。操作系统调度的那样东西。",
  ["The same three letters as the file next to go.mod. The proxy's sibling."] = "和 go.mod 旁边那个文件一样的三个字母。代理的兄弟。",
  ["The same trait String::from comes from. Capital F, one generic parameter."] = "String::from 出自的同一个 trait。大写 F，一个泛型参数。",
  ["The same word as a C-style counted loop."] = "和 C 风格计数循环用同一个词。",
  ["The same word as in 'the ___ value of a struct is all fields blank'."] = "和「struct 的 ___ 值就是所有字段都空着」里的那个词一样。",
  ["The same word as the blank import above. Go 1.16."] = "和上面空白 import 的是同一个词。Go 1.16。",
  ["The same word as the builtin, capitalised, living in sync."] = "和内建那个词一样，首字母大写，住在 sync 里。",
  ["The same word the till used to shut the drawer. It fires on the way out."] = "收银机用来关钱箱的那个词。它在离开的路上执行。",
  ["The seating chart"] = "座位表",
  ["The seating chart for a banquet. Siu Ming's script checks every guest against every other for a duplicate. Bo draws the curve that leaves the board. Nested loops over the same list: the shape to avoid."] = "宴会的座位表。Siu Ming 的脚本把每位客人和其他每位客人比较找重复。Bo 画出冲出白板的曲线。同一个列表的嵌套循环：要避开的形状。",
  ["The seating chart for a banquet. Siu Ming's script checks every guest against every other for a duplicate. Mei draws a curve that bends upward and leaves the board. Nested loops over the same list: the shape to avoid."] = "宴会的座位表。Siu Ming 的脚本把每位客人和其他每位客人比较找重复。Mei 画一条向上弯出白板的曲线。同一个列表的嵌套循环：要避开的形状。",
  ["The seating chart for a banquet. Siu Ming's script checks every guest against every other for a duplicate. Mei draws the curve that leaves the board. Nested loops over the same Vec: the shape to avoid."] = "宴会的座位表。Siu Ming 的脚本把每位客人和其他每位客人比较找重复。Mei 画出冲出白板的曲线。同一个 Vec 的嵌套循环：要避开的形状。",
  ["The second argument holds the URL, method and body. Fill its type: r *http.___"] = "第二个参数装着 URL、方法和 body。填它的类型：r *http.___",
  ["The second argument to make is the buffer size."] = "make 的第二个参数是缓冲区大小。",
  ["The second file guards against a tampered download. Name it."] = "第二个文件防范被篡改的下载。说出它的名字。",
  ["The second return value is not optional: not calling cancel leaks the context and whatever the parent holds for it."] = "第二个返回值不是可有可无的：不调用 cancel 会漏掉这个 context 以及父级为它保存的一切。",
  ["The second value of the map lookup, the boolean that says the key was present."] = "map 查找的第二个值，表示键存在的那个布尔值。",
  ["The sentinel is the poison pill. Go closes the channel once and every receiver wakes; Python has to send one pill per worker."] = "哨兵值就是毒药丸。Go 关一次 channel，所有接收者都会醒；Python 得给每个 worker 发一粒。",
  ["The set method that takes one element out; it raises KeyError if the element is missing."] = "把一个元素拿出去的 set 方法；元素不存在时抛 KeyError。",
  ["The seven-letter word from the second street of this quest."] = "这个任务第二条街上那个七个字母的词。",
  ["The shared till"] = "共享收银机",
  ["The shared tray rack"] = "共用的托盘架",
  ["The shutter queue"] = "卷帘门前的队",
  ["The side smaller values live on. The else branch already shows the other side."] = "小值住的那一边。else 分支已经展示了另一边。",
  ["The side the larger values live on, visited last."] = "大值住的那一边，最后访问。",
  ["The signboard"] = "招牌",
  ["The slice built-in that grows. Mark visited when you enqueue, not when you pop."] = "让 slice 增长的内置函数。入队时就标记已访问，别等出队。",
  ["The smallest buffer that still holds something. One result, one slot."] = "还能装下东西的最小缓冲。一个结果，一个位置。",
  ["The sorting hat"] = "分类帽",
  ["The sorting hat: a shoebox of receipts. Alex sorts them by splitting the pile in half, again and again, then merging back in order. Bo draws the line between linear and quadratic and labels it n log n."] = "分类帽：一个装收据的鞋盒。Alex 把这堆一分为二，再分再分，然后按顺序合并回来。Bo 画出线性与二次之间的那条线，标上 n log n。",
  ["The sorting hat: a shoebox of receipts. Alex sorts them by splitting the pile in half, again and again, then merging back in order. Mei draws the line between linear and quadratic and labels it n log n."] = "分类帽：一个装收据的鞋盒。Alex 把这堆一分为二，再分再分，然后按顺序合并回来。Mei 画出线性与二次之间的那条线，标上 n log n。",
  ["The sorting hat: a shoebox of the night's receipts. Alex sorts them by splitting the pile in half, again and again, then merging the piles back in order. Mei draws the line between linear and quadratic."] = "分类帽：一个装着今晚收据的鞋盒。Alex 把这堆一分为二，再分再分，然后按顺序把小堆合并回来，以此排序。Mei 画出线性与二次之间的那条线。",
  ["The stamp desk"] = "盖章台",
  ["The stamp desk. Bo wants every kitchen function timed and logged without touching its body. In Python a function is a value: wrap it in another and put the wrapper's name, with an @, on the line above."] = "盖章台。Bo 想给每个厨房函数计时和记录，却不碰它的主体。在 Python 里函数是一个值：用另一个函数包住它，再把包装者的名字带上 @ 放在上面一行。",
  ["The startup calls back. Seven whiteboard classics: stack, DP, window, heap, intervals, LRU, grid. Get the OFFER."] = "创业公司打来复试电话。七道白板经典题：栈、DP、窗口、堆、区间、LRU、网格。拿到 OFFER。",
  ["The stock file is left open every night. Then the count is wrong in the morning."] = "库存文件每晚都开着不关。然后早上的数目就错了。",
  ["The stock room"] = "储藏室",
  ["The stock room. A script counts eggs, trays and coffee beans, and it has been dividing with the wrong slash all year. Alex has typed := ten thousand times; here a plain = will do, and there is no type to write."] = "储藏室。一个脚本数鸡蛋、托盘和咖啡豆，一整年都用错了斜线来除。Alex 打过一万次 :=；这里一个普通的 = 就够，也没有类型要写。",
  ["The stock script counts trays. It says we have 4.1666 trays of eggs. We do not."] = "库存脚本数托盘。它说我们有 4.1666 盘鸡蛋。才没有。",
  ["The storeroom"] = "储藏室",
  ["The storeroom is small. Sort the trays where they stand; do not build a second rack."] = "储藏室很小。托盘在原位排；不要搭第二个架子。",
  ["The storeroom: every algorithm needs somewhere to put things. Sorting the trays where they stand costs no shelf; cloning them onto a new rack costs a rack the size of the input. Mei adds the second axis."] = "储藏室：每个算法都需要放东西的地方。托盘在原位排序不用多一个架子；clone 到新架子上就要一个和输入一样大的架子。Mei 加上第二条轴。",
  ["The storeroom: every algorithm needs somewhere to put things. Sorting the trays where they stand costs no shelf; copying them onto a new rack costs a rack the size of the input. Mei adds the second axis to the board."] = "储藏室：每个算法都需要放东西的地方。托盘在原位排序不用多一个架子；复制到新架子上就要一个和输入一样大的架子。Mei 给白板加上第二条轴。",
  ["The storeroom: every algorithm needs somewhere to put things. Sorting the trays where they stand costs no shelf; copying them onto a new rack costs a rack the size of the input. Mei adds the second axis to the last board of the night."] = "储藏室：每个算法都需要放东西的地方。托盘在原位排序不用多一个架子；复制到新架子上就要一个和输入一样大的架子。Mei 给今晚最后一块白板加上第二条轴。",
  ["The table starts with what is already known. One way to stand at the bottom, and how many ways to reach step 1?"] = "表从已知的开始填。站在底部只有一种方式，那到达第 1 级有几种？",
  ["The tea table"] = "茶桌",
  ["The thread may outlive this scope. Which keyword gives the closure ownership of order?"] = "线程可能活得比这个作用域久。哪个关键字把 order 的所有权交给闭包？",
  ["The three biggest prices, biggest first, in one call. Which heapq helper?"] = "最大的三个价格，最大的在前，一次调用。哪个 heapq 辅助函数？",
  ["The ticket printer skips dish zero and prints dish five twice. Fix the loop."] = "出票机跳过了第零道菜，第五道菜打了两次。修好这个循环。",
  ["The till"] = "收银机",
  ["The till returns (receipt, err). If err is not the zero value of error, stop. defer close() runs even if you return early."] = "收银机返回 (receipt, err)。如果 err 不是 error 的零值，就停下。defer close() 即使提前返回也会执行。",
  ["The till says Err and then just stops. Mei, does Rust not have nil?"] = "收银机报了 Err 然后就停了。Mei，Rust 没有 nil 吗？",
  ['The till sends "12" as text. Which built-in turns it into a whole number?'] = '收银机把 "12" 当文本发过来。哪个内置函数把它变成整数？',
  ["The till thinks every order is a tuple. Give it a struct with names."] = "收银机以为每个订单都是元组。给它一个带名字的 struct。",
  ["The trait behind {}. Debug is behind {:?}. You cannot derive this one."] = "{} 背后的 trait。{:?} 背后的是 Debug。这个不能 derive。",
  ["The tray is on the table. One last lesson: a request has a context so the kitchen can stop if the guest walks out. And a test so the next morning still compiles."] = "托盘上桌了。最后一课：请求带着 context，客人走了厨房就能停。还有测试，保证明天早上照样能编译。",
  ["The tray rack"] = "托盘架",
  ["The tray rack. Bo's rack script keeps trays in a list and reads the last one with index len minus one, off by one, every night. Python has a shorter way to say 'last'."] = "托盘架。Bo 的货架脚本把托盘放在列表里，用 len 减一的索引读最后一个，每晚都差一。Python 有更短的方式说“最后”。",
  ["The tray rail"] = "托盘架",
  ["The tuple assignment does all three moves at once: Go evaluates the right side first."] = "元组赋值一次完成三个动作：Go 先求值右侧。",
  ["The two seconds ran out. Which context error is that?"] = "两秒用完了。这是哪个 context 错误？",
  ["The type itself, used as a constructor. a[:] and a.copy() are the other two spellings."] = "类型本身，当构造器用。a[:] 和 a.copy() 是另外两种写法。",
  ["The type name works as the conversion. Floor and int never mix silently."] = "类型名本身就是转换。Floor 和 int 绝不会悄悄混用。",
  ["The type name, inside the parentheses. The second line shows the safe two-value form."] = "括号里填类型名。第二行是安全的双值形式。",
  ["The type of [] itself, with the item type in square brackets. Older code imported a capitalized one from typing."] = "[] 本身的类型，元素类型放在方括号里。旧代码从 typing 导入大写版。",
  ["The type of {} itself, lowercase, key type then value type inside the brackets."] = "{} 本身的类型，小写，方括号里先键类型再值类型。",
  ["The type whose empty value the append needs. Passed as a callable, no parentheses."] = "append 需要的那个空值的类型。作为可调用对象传入，不带括号。",
  ["The typed-nil trap: return a plain nil error, never a nil *MyError."] = "带类型 nil 的陷阱：返回纯粹的 nil error，绝不要返回 nil 的 *MyError。",
  ["The usual 'no answer' for a count: negative one."] = "计数题常用的“无解”：负一。",
  ["The usual 'not found' number, which is why the return type is i64 and not usize."] = "通常的“没找到”数字，这就是为什么返回类型是 i64 而不是 usize。",
  ["The usual impossible marker: a negative one, since a real count is never below zero."] = "惯用的不可能标记：负一，因为真正的个数从不小于零。",
  ["The value a function without return gives back, capital letter, used as the type here."] = "没有 return 的函数返回的值，大写开头，这里当作类型用。",
  ["The value of nothing, capital letter. Every function without a return statement gives it back."] = "“什么都没有”的值，大写开头。每个没有 return 语句的函数都返回它。",
  ["The walk stops when the runner falls off the end. Fill the condition: ___ != nil"] = "游标走到末尾就停。填条件：___ != nil",
  ["The water byte. Same shape as the land literal, other digit."] = "水的字节。和陆地字面量同样的形式，换个数字。",
  ["The web counter"] = "网络柜台",
  ["The whiteboard again, the Rust column this time. Mei redraws the axes: n across, work up. First street: the operations whose line stays flat, written the Rust way."] = "又是白板，这次是 Rust 那一栏。Mei 重画两条轴：横是 n，竖是工作量。第一条街：线保持平坦的操作，用 Rust 的写法。",
  ["The whiteboard in the back office, wiped clean. Mei draws one axis: n, the size of the input. The other axis is work. First street: operations whose line stays flat however far n goes."] = "后勤室的白板，擦得干干净净。Mei 画一条轴：n，输入的大小。另一条轴是工作量。第一条街：无论 n 走多远，线都保持平坦的操作。",
  ["The whiteboard one more time, the Python column. Chef Bo takes the marker: n across, work up. First street: the operations whose line stays flat, written the Python way."] = "白板再来一次，Python 那一栏。Bo 厨师拿起笔：横是 n，竖是工作量。第一条街：线保持平坦的操作，用 Python 的写法。",
  ["The window is s[l..r], both ends included. Fill its length."] = "窗口是 s[l..r]，两端都包含。填上它的长度。",
  ["The window is s[l:r+1]. Record its width if it is the widest yet. Fill the width."] = "窗口是 s[l:r+1]。如果它是目前最宽的就记下宽度。填这个宽度。",
  ["The with block closes and joins the pool for you. Without it, a forgotten pool keeps eight interpreters resident."] = "with 块会帮你 close 并 join 这个池子。没有它，一个被遗忘的池子会一直养着八个解释器。",
  ["The word package, capitalised, followed by the package's name. One comment per package, in one file."] = "package 这个词，大写开头，后面跟包名。每个包一条注释，写在一个文件里。",
  ["The word that follows an if block, here in the middle of one line. Python has no ? : operator."] = "跟在 if 块后面的那个词，这里放在一行的中间。Python 没有 ? : 运算符。",
  ["The worker appended to my list and my list stayed empty. Every single time."] = "worker 往我的列表 append 了，我的列表还是空的。每一次都这样。",
  ["The worker has to attach to the same block. Which attribute do you send it?"] = "worker 得接到同一块内存上。你把哪个属性发给它？",
  ["The workers want a real dict everyone can see. Which class serves one over a proxy?"] = "worker 们想要一个大家都看得到的真 dict。哪个类通过代理提供一个？",
  ["The workshop"] = "工作间",
  ["The zero pointer. This is the base case of the tree recursion."] = "零值指针。这是树递归的基准情形。",
  ["The zero value of a channel. Receiving on it blocks for ever, which select reads as 'never ready'."] = "channel 的零值。在它上面接收会永远阻塞，select 把这读作「永远没准备好」。",
  ["The zero value of a pointer, slice, map, chan, func, or error is ___."] = "指针、slice、map、chan、func 或 error 的零值是 ___。",
  ["Then I owe him a tag. And a promise about what the number means."] = "那我欠他一个标签。还有一个关于那个数字意味着什么的承诺。",
  ["There are no relative imports in Go, ever. An import path is always the full name of a package, so it means the same thing from every file in the world."] = "Go 里从来没有相对导入。导入路径永远是一个包的全名，所以在世界上任何文件里含义都相同。",
  ["There is exactly one way to stand still, and one way to take a single step."] = "原地不动恰好一种走法，走一级也恰好一种。",
  ["They asked me this one too. A stack, Bo. Every closer looks at the top."] = "他们也问过我这题。一个栈，Bo。每个闭括号都看栈顶。",
  ["They overlap: stretch the merged interval to whichever end is farther. Fill the builtin."] = "它们重叠：把合并区间拉到更远的那个终点。填上内置函数。",
  ["They overlap: the merged block ends at the later of the two ends. Which built-in?"] = "它们重叠：合并块的终点是两个终点中较晚的。哪个内置函数？",
  ["They overlap: the merged block ends at the later of the two ends. Which method picks the larger end?"] = "它们重叠：合并块的终点取两者中较晚的。哪个方法选较大的终点？",
  ["This cell is land and part of the island. Sink it before flooding onward, so it is never visited twice. What does the cell become?"] = "这一格是陆地，属于这座岛。继续洪泛前先把它沉掉，这样它永远不会被访问两次。这一格变成什么？",
  ["This is the trap every threading programmer walks into once. Processes share nothing implicitly: results come back through a Queue, a return value, or shared memory."] = "这是每个写惯线程的程序员都会掉一次的坑。进程之间不会隐式共享任何东西：结果要经由 Queue、返回值或共享内存回来。",
  ["This scan is O(n): the honest cost of a VecDeque order. A doubly linked list with map-held nodes makes it O(1)."] = "这次扫描是 O(n)：VecDeque 存顺序的真实代价。用 map 持有节点的双向链表能做到 O(1)。",
  ["Thread(target=fn, args=(...)) wraps a call. It is an OS thread, heavier than a goroutine, fine for I/O."] = "Thread(target=fn, args=(...)) 包住一次调用。它是 OS 线程，比 goroutine 重，做 I/O 够用。",
  ["Threads"] = "线程",
  ["Threads and the GIL"] = "线程与 GIL",
  ["Threads do help downloads. What happens to the GIL around a socket read?"] = "线程对下载确实有帮助。socket 读取前后 GIL 会怎样？",
  ["Threads that borrow menu and are all joined before the block ends. Which function?"] = "线程借用 menu，并且在块结束前全部 join。哪个函数？",
  ["Three bowls left. If it says zero, we close."] = "还剩三碗。它说零，我们就关门。",
  ["Three cooks, one ticket rail, one lock on the rail. That is a worker pool."] = "三个厨师，一条挂单轨，轨上一把锁。这就是工作池。",
  ["Three cooks, one ticket rail, one pass. That is a worker pool."] = "三个厨师，一条单据架，一个出餐口。这就是工作池。",
  ["Three cooks, three OS threads. Which thread function runs a closure and returns a JoinHandle?"] = "三个厨师，三个操作系统线程。哪个 thread 函数跑一个闭包并返回 JoinHandle？",
  ["Three dots then the element type. Inside the function fares is a []int."] = "三个点加元素类型。在函数内部 fares 是一个 []int。",
  ["Three letters for the chip, an underscore, then the verb for counting. os has the same one."] = "芯片的三个字母、一条下划线，再加表示计数的那个动词。os 里也有一个一样的。",
  ["Three letters from Ord, the twin of the one that picks the smaller."] = "三个字母，来自 Ord，选较小者那个方法的孪生兄弟。",
  ["Three letters from Ord. A plain assignment of cur.1 would shrink a block that already reached further."] = "三个字母，来自 Ord。直接赋值 cur.1 会把已经伸得更远的块缩短。",
  ["Three letters from Ord: the smaller of the current entry and the new candidate."] = "三个字母，来自 Ord：当前项和新候选值中较小的那个。",
  ["Three letters in front of Lock, Go 1.18 and up. It attempts, it does not queue."] = "在 Lock 前面加三个字母，Go 1.18 起有。它只是试一下，不会排队。",
  ["Three letters, O(1) itself: the slice header stores it."] = "三个字母，本身是 O(1)：切片头存着它。",
  ["Three letters, a label on a commit. The v in front is not optional for Go."] = "三个字母，贴在提交上的标签。前面的 v 对 Go 来说不是可选的。",
  ["Three letters, a method with parentheses. Go has the same word as a builtin."] = "三个字母，带括号的方法。Go 里同一个词是内建函数。",
  ["Three letters, a statement not a method. Go's delete(m, k), shortened."] = "三个字母，是语句不是方法。Go 的 delete(m, k) 缩短版。",
  ["Three letters, a verb: attempt it. The except below only makes sense after this."] = "三个字母，一个动词：试一试。下面的 except 只有在它之后才有意义。",
  ["Three letters, an underscore, and the four-letter word for a mutex."] = "三个字母、一条下划线，再加表示 mutex 的那四个字母。",
  ["Three letters, as in checksum. Commit it next to go.mod, always."] = "三个字母，checksum 里的那个。永远和 go.mod 一起提交。",
  ["Three letters, capital N. Takes the message, returns an error."] = "三个字母，大写 N。接收消息，返回一个 error。",
  ["Three letters, from Ord. Its twin picks the larger one."] = "三个字母，来自 Ord。它的孪生兄弟选较大的那个。",
  ["Three letters, from the Ord trait. a.max(b) reads better than std::cmp::max(a, b)."] = "三个字母，来自 Ord trait。a.max(b) 比 std::cmp::max(a, b) 读起来舒服。",
  ["Three letters, like the fastener that joins two sides tooth by tooth."] = "三个字母，像那个把两边一齿一齿扣起来的拉链。",
  ["Three letters, no underscore. The opposite of push. Returns Option<T>."] = "三个字母，没有下划线。push 的反向操作。返回 Option<T>。",
  ["Three letters, same as the module behind println!. Runs rustfmt."] = "三个字母，和 println! 背后的那个模块同名。它运行 rustfmt。",
  ["Three letters, same name as on a Vec. It counts bytes, never characters."] = "三个字母，和 Vec 上的那个同名。它数字节，从不数字符。",
  ["Three letters, short for buffer."] = "三个字母，buffer 的缩写。",
  ["Three letters, short for command. A convention, not a rule, but one every Go repo follows."] = "三个字母，command 的缩写。是惯例不是规则，但每个 Go 仓库都这么做。",
  ["Three letters, short for dynamic."] = "三个字母，dynamic 的缩写。",
  ["Three letters, short for module. The same word as in go.mod."] = "三个字母，module 的缩写。和 go.mod 里是同一个词。",
  ["Three letters, short for module. Under GOPATH, read-only, shared by every project on the machine."] = "三个字母，module 的缩写。在 GOPATH 下面，只读，这台机器上所有项目共用。",
  ["Three letters, short for reverse. Only a DoubleEndedIterator has it, and Chars is one."] = "三个字母，reverse 的缩写。只有 DoubleEndedIterator 才有它，而 Chars 就是一个。",
  ["Three letters, short for sequence. Seq2 yields pairs, like index and value."] = "三个字母，sequence 的缩写。Seq2 产出成对的值，比如下标和值。",
  ["Three letters, the abbreviation everybody uses. It is a convention, not a rule the compiler knows."] = "三个字母，人人都用的缩写。这是约定，不是编译器知道的规则。",
  ["Three letters, the math word for a collection with no duplicates. Go has no built-in one; map[T]bool stands in."] = "三个字母，数学里“没有重复的集合”那个词。Go 没有内置的；用 map[T]bool 顶替。",
  ["Three letters, the name of the type itself. float() is its cousin."] = "三个字母，就是类型本身的名字。float() 是它的表亲。",
  ["Three letters, the opposite of min. Built in; Go only got it in 1.21."] = "三个字母，min 的反义词。内置的；Go 到 1.21 才有。",
  ["Three letters, the opposite of push. With no argument it takes the last item."] = "三个字母，push 的反义。不带参数就取最后一项。",
  ["Three letters, the opposite of put. Go's <-jobs."] = "三个字母，put 的反义词。Go 的 <-jobs。",
  ["Three letters, the opposite of the last blank. None when the stack is already empty, and None != Some(open)."] = "三个字母，上一个空的反面。栈已空时返回 None，而 None != Some(open)。",
  ["Three letters, the opposite of the method a worker calls. Go's jobs <- order."] = "三个字母，工人调用的那个方法的反义词。Go 的 jobs <- order。",
  ["Three letters, the partner of Put."] = "三个字母，Put 的搭档。",
  ["Three letters, the partner of put. Pass timeout= if you would rather not wait for ever."] = "三个字母，put 的搭档。不想永远等下去就传个 timeout=。",
  ["Three letters, the plainest verb for starting a program. Once, at the top level."] = "三个字母，启动一个程序最朴素的动词。在顶层用一次。",
  ["Three letters, the plainest verb there is. go work use ./kiosk writes the same line."] = "三个字母，最朴素的动词。go work use ./kiosk 写出的也是同一行。",
  ["Three letters, the same as Go. Not a method: it is a function that takes the list."] = "三个字母，和 Go 一样。不是方法：是一个接收列表的函数。",
  ["Three letters, the same builtin a slice uses for its capacity."] = "三个字母，和 slice 用来看容量的内建函数一样。",
  ["Three letters, the same name as on a Vec, but here it returns the top of the heap in O(log k)."] = "三个字母，和 Vec 上的同名，但这里以 O(log k) 返回堆顶。",
  ["Three letters, the same name as the builtin it replaces."] = "三个字母，和它取代的那个内建函数同名。",
  ["Three letters, the start of 'define'. Go's func, Rust's fn."] = "三个字母，'define' 的开头。Go 的 func，Rust 的 fn。",
  ["Three letters, the text type's own name. An f-string would do the same without the call."] = "三个字母，文本类型自己的名字。用 f-string 不用调用也能做到。",
  ["Three letters, what you do to fetch something. The @ picks the version; without it, latest."] = "三个字母，去取东西的动作。@ 选版本；不写就是 latest。",
  ["Three letters. A slice of pairs would need a scan, O(n); this hashes the key instead."] = "三个字母。成对的切片需要扫描，O(n)；这个改为哈希键。",
  ["Three letters. Bigger than any coin count, so the first real answer replaces it."] = "三个字母。比任何硬币数都大，所以第一个真正的答案就能替换它。",
  ["Three letters. Capacity, not length."] = "三个字母。容量，不是长度。",
  ["Three letters. Go has var and :=; Rust has one word for both."] = "三个字母。Go 有 var 和 :=；Rust 一个词管两样。",
  ["Three letters. Heap pointer. dyn has no known size, so it must live behind one."] = "三个字母。堆指针。dyn 没有已知大小，所以必须藏在一个指针后面。",
  ["Three letters. Lists append; sets do this."] = "三个字母。列表用 append；集合用这个。",
  ["Three letters. Plus. Built into cargo since 1.62; remove is its opposite."] = "三个字母。加。1.62 起内置在 cargo 里；remove 是它的反面。",
  ["Three letters. Rust's word for Go's import, one path at a time."] = "三个字母。Rust 版的 Go import，一次一条路径。",
  ["Three letters. Same word as Vec::new. Add --lib for a library instead."] = "三个字母。和 Vec::new 是同一个词。加 --lib 则建库。",
  ["Three letters. Short for mutable, the opposite of the default."] = "三个字母。mutable 的缩写，默认行为的反面。",
  ["Three letters. Takes a reference to the key, returns Option<&V>."] = "三个字母。接收键的引用，返回 Option<&V>。",
  ["Three letters. Takes a reference to the key, returns Option<&V>. The &v pattern copies the u64 out."] = "三个字母。接收键的引用，返回 Option<&V>。&v 模式把 u64 拷出来。",
  ["Three letters. The maths word for adding up. product() is its cousin."] = "三个字母。数学里表示求和的词。product() 是它的表亲。",
  ["Three letters. The owned heap pointer: one owner, freed when dropped. Not Rc, nobody shares a child."] = "三个字母。带所有权的堆指针：一个所有者，drop 时释放。不是 Rc，没人共享子节点。",
  ["Three letters. The type on the left, : i32, tells it what to produce."] = "三个字母。左边的类型 : i32 告诉它要产出什么。",
  ["Three letters. This is Python's await: the work started at apply_async."] = "三个字母。这就是 Python 的 await：活儿在 apply_async 那一刻就开始了。",
  ["Three letters. Works anywhere; := only works inside a function."] = "三个字母。哪里都能用；:= 只能在函数内部用。",
  ["Three letters. impl Trait ___ Type."] = "三个字母。impl Trait ___ Type。",
  ["Three letters. max is its twin. Both take any number of ordered values."] = "三个字母。max 是它的孪生兄弟。两者都接收任意个有序值。",
  ["Three letters. menu[k] raises when k is missing; this one returns the default instead."] = "三个字母。menu[k] 在 k 不存在时抛错；这个则返回默认值。",
  ["Three letters: Atomic Reference Counted."] = "三个字母：Atomic Reference Counted。",
  ["Three letters: is there any element for which the closure is true. Vec::contains does the same for one value."] = "三个字母：是否有任何元素让闭包为真。Vec::contains 对单个值做同样的事。",
  ["Three letters: to examine. ./... means this package and everything under it."] = "三个字母：审查的意思。./... 表示这个包及其下的所有包。",
  ["Three letters; the loop calls .add on it. len(set(guests)) < len(guests) is the one-liner."] = "三个字母；循环对它调用 .add。len(set(guests)) < len(guests) 是一行版。",
  ["Three letters; the next line calls .add on it. Go's map[string]bool, Rust's HashSet."] = "三个字母；下一行对它调用 .add。Go 的 map[string]bool，Rust 的 HashSet。",
  ["Three pairs, one match. '\\0' marks an opener; the rest of the loop branches on that."] = "三对括号，一个 match。'\\0' 标记左括号；循环的其余部分就按这个分支。",
  ["Three parts: ampersand, the mutability word, the receiver. o must be let mut to call it."] = "三部分：& 符号、表示可变的词、接收者。o 必须是 let mut 才能调用。",
  ["Three riders, three radios. The script calls them one after another and the noodles go cold."] = "三个骑手，三台对讲机。脚本一个接一个地叫，面都凉了。",
  ["Three threads add to one counter. Which threading object guards it?"] = "三个线程给同一个计数器加数。哪个 threading 对象守护它？",
  ["Three woks, one cook script. It fries one egg at a time while the other two woks sit cold."] = "三口锅，一个烹饪脚本。它一次煎一个鸡蛋，另外两口锅冷着。",
  ["Three words in one: check the old value, then put the new one. Everyone calls it CAS."] = "三个词合成一个：先比对旧值，再放进新值。大家都叫它 CAS。",
  ["Three words joined: what the operating system schedules, a pool of them, and the thing that runs your calls."] = "三个词拼起来：操作系统调度的那样东西、它们的池子，再加上运行你调用的那样东西。",
  ["Three words with underscores: relocate the key to the back of the order."] = "三个词用下划线连接：把这个键挪到顺序的末尾。",
  ["Three words with underscores: run, in, and the thing you built at the top of this street."] = "三个词用下划线连起来：run、in，再加你在这条街开头造出来的那样东西。",
  ["Three words with underscores: sort, by, and the thing the closure returns."] = "三个单词用下划线连接：sort、by，还有闭包返回的那样东西。",
  ["Three words, two underscores: skip, the verb for writing out, if. It names a predicate."] = "三个词，两个下划线：skip、表示写出的那个动词、if。它指向一个判断函数。",
  ["Throw away the bool, keep the error. What character discards?"] = "丢掉 bool，保留 error。哪个字符用来丢弃？",
  ["Ticket five: the app needs a server. net/http is in the standard library: a handler is a function, a route is a string, the server is one call."] = "第五张工单：app 需要一个服务器。net/http 就在标准库里：handler 是函数，路由是字符串，服务器只需一次调用。",
  ["Ticket four: orders arrive as JSON. The decoder only sees exported fields, and a tag on the field tells it which key to read."] = "第四张工单：订单以 JSON 形式到达。解码器只看得到导出字段，字段上的 tag 告诉它读哪个 key。",
  ["Ticket one. The receipt cuts the shop name in half. Bytes, not characters."] = "第一张工单。收据把店名切成了两半。是字节，不是字符。",
  ["Ticket seven, the rooftop. The app is live. Newer Go has generic helpers so the old hand-written loops can go: slices, maps, min, and iterators you can range over."] = "第七张工单，天台。app 上线了。新版 Go 有泛型辅助函数，老的手写循环可以退休了：slices、maps、min，还有能 range 的迭代器。",
  ["Ticket six: ship it. A module names the project, go.mod pins the dependencies, and the go tool formats, checks and builds. No Makefile needed."] = "第六张工单：发布。module 给项目命名，go.mod 锁定依赖，go 工具负责格式化、检查和构建。不需要 Makefile。",
  ["Ticket three: the menu board takes any. Before the app can print a price it must ask what is inside. Go asks with an assertion or a type switch."] = "第三张工单：菜单板接收 any。app 打印价格之前得先问里面是什么。Go 用断言或 type switch 来问。",
  ["Ticket two: refunds. An error must say what went wrong, keep its cause, and let the caller ask which kind it was. All of that is in package errors."] = "第二张工单：退款。一个 error 要说明哪里出错，保留原因，还要让调用方能问是哪一种。这些都在 errors 包里。",
  ["Tilde. Without it, type Cents int would not satisfy Number."] = "波浪号。没有它，type Cents int 就不满足 Number。",
  ["Time is one axis. Memory is the other. Every cache you loved tonight paid rent here."] = "时间是一条轴。内存是另一条。你今晚喜欢的每个 cache 都在这里交了租。",
  ["Time is one axis. Memory is the other. Every memo you loved tonight paid rent here."] = "时间是一条轴。内存是另一条。你今晚喜欢的每个 memo 都在这里交了租。",
  ["Time is one axis. Memory is the other. Rust makes you see every allocation; that is the point."] = "时间是一条轴。内存是另一条。Rust 让你看见每一次分配；这就是重点。",
  ["Time the grill. Fill the prefix: func ___Grill(b *testing.B)"] = "给烤盘计时。填前缀：func ___Grill(b *testing.B)",
  ["Times Square"] = "时代广场",
  ["Times Square atrium"] = "时代广场中庭",
  ["Times Square's LED cube is a slice of frames. An array has a fixed size in the type. A slice does not. append returns a (maybe new) slice."] = "时代广场的 LED 方块是一个帧的 slice。数组的大小固定在类型里。slice 没有。append 返回一个（可能是新的）slice。",
  ["Times Square's live coding show. Seven rounds of classic interview problems. Get HIRED."] = "时代广场的直播编程秀。七轮经典面试题。拿到录用。",
  ["To then Upper. Strings are immutable, so it returns a new one."] = "To 加 Upper。string 不可变，所以它返回一个新的。",
  ["Toast is off the menu tonight. Which statement removes the key?"] = "今晚多士下架。哪个语句删除这个键？",
  ["Top k frequent dishes: count first. Which HashMap method gives a slot for w, creating it with 0 if new?"] = "前 k 高频菜品：先计数。哪个 HashMap 方法给出 w 的槽位，若是新键就以 0 创建？",
  ["Top k most ordered dishes. Count them, then take the k highest counts. Which Counter method?"] = "点得最多的前 k 道菜。先计数，再取 k 个最高的计数。哪个 Counter 方法？",
  ["Top-down instead: recurse, but remember every result. Which functools decorator?"] = "改成自顶向下：递归，但记住每个结果。哪个 functools 装饰器？",
  ["Traits"] = "Trait",
  ["Tram or walk? if the light is green, we go."] = "坐电车还是走路？if 灯是绿的，我们就走。",
  ["Tray::default() comes from the Default trait: 0 for numbers, empty String, empty Vec. Also ..Default::default() in struct literals."] = "Tray::default() 来自 Default trait：数字为 0，空 String，空 Vec。结构体字面量里还能写 ..Default::default()。",
  ["True only when nothing is left on the stack: compare its length with zero."] = "只有栈里什么都不剩才为真：把它的长度和零比较。",
  ["True when the stack is empty. An empty list is falsy; negate it."] = "栈为空时为 True。空列表是假值；取反它。",
  ["TryLock is for work you can skip, not for dodging a design problem. If you reach for it often, the shared state is wrong."] = "TryLock 是给可以跳过的工作用的，不是用来绕开设计问题。要是你经常想用它，说明共享状态有问题。",
  ["Turn an Option into a Result, with this message as the Err. Which method?"] = "把 Option 变成 Result，用这条消息当 Err。哪个方法？",
  ["Turn land into water: the byte for water."] = "把陆地变成水：表示水的字节。",
  ["Turn the Order into JSON bytes. Fill: json.___(order)"] = "把 Order 变成 JSON 字节。填：json.___(order)",
  ["Turn the Order into a JSON String. Which serde_json function?"] = "把 Order 变成 JSON String。哪个 serde_json 函数？",
  ["Turn the lazy chain back into a Vec. Which method finishes it?"] = "把惰性链条变回 Vec。哪个方法收尾？",
  ["Twelve letters. Things the project depends on. dev-... is the variant for tests only."] = "十二个字母。项目所依赖的东西。dev-... 是只给测试用的变体。",
  ["Twenty goroutines want the menu loaded; load it exactly once. Which method of sync.Once?"] = "二十个 goroutine 都要加载菜单；只加载一次。sync.Once 的哪个方法？",
  ["Two ETAs at the same time, both results in one tuple. Which tokio macro?"] = "两个 ETA 同时取，两个结果装进一个元组。哪个 tokio 宏？",
  ["Two English words glued together: this and the thing you are deriving. Not anyhow."] = "两个英文单词粘在一起：this 加上你正在 derive 的那个东西。不是 anyhow。",
  ["Two binaries, one repo. Which directory holds one main package per binary?"] = "两个二进制，一个仓库。哪个目录为每个二进制放一个 main 包？",
  ["Two braces with nothing between. Note: this makes a dict, not a set; set() is spelled out."] = "两个大括号，中间什么都没有。注意：这创建的是 dict，不是 set；set 要写 set()。",
  ["Two braces with nothing inside. Not %d, not %v."] = "一对花括号，里面什么都没有。不是 %d，也不是 %v。",
  ["Two characters: the receive operator, in front of the channel."] = "两个符号：接收运算符，放在 channel 前面。",
  ["Two choices per topping, multiplied n times. Two, a caret, n."] = "每种配料两个选择，乘 n 次。2、^、n。",
  ["Two colons, then the type in angle brackets. It looks like a fish."] = "两个冒号，然后是尖括号里的类型。看起来像条鱼。",
  ["Two cooks increment the same tray count. Without a lock that is a race. WaitGroup.Add, Done, Wait is how the pass knows both items are ready."] = "两位厨师给同一个托盘计数加一。不加锁就是竞争。WaitGroup.Add、Done、Wait 让出餐口知道两样都好了。",
  ["Two dots and one more character that says the end counts too."] = "两个点，再加一个字符，表示末端也算进去。",
  ["Two dots, then the sign that says equal too."] = "两个点，然后是表示也相等的那个符号。",
  ["Two goroutines touching one variable, one of them writing, is a data race: go test -race finds it. Share by sending on a channel instead, or protect the reference. A plain map crashes under concurrent writes; sync.Map is built for it. Closing a channel publishes everything written before the close."] = "两个 goroutine 碰同一个变量、其中一个在写，就是数据竞态：go test -race 能找出来。改成用 channel 发送来共享，或者保护好那个引用。普通 map 并发写会崩溃；sync.Map 就是为它而造的。关闭 channel 会把关闭之前写的一切都公开出去。",
  ["Two hands, one tray counter. Lock it. Then wait for both cooks."] = "两双手，一个托盘计数器。锁住它。然后等两位厨师。",
  ["Two less than n. The base case handles 0 and 1, so this never goes negative."] = "比 n 小二。基准情况处理 0 和 1，所以这里永远不会变成负数。",
  ["Two letters, the opposite of off. The empty default means the same thing now."] = "两个字母，off 的反面。现在空的默认值也是同一个意思。",
  ["Two letters, the same name a map lookup and a type assertion use."] = "两个字母，和 map 查找、类型断言用的名字一样。",
  ["Two letters, the same word except and import use to bind a name."] = "两个字母，except 和 import 用来绑定名字的同一个词。",
  ["Two letters, the same word import and with use to give something a local name."] = "两个字母，import 和 with 用来给东西起本地名字的同一个词。",
  ["Two letters, the same word the for loop uses between the name and the list."] = "两个字母，就是 for 循环放在名字和列表之间的那个词。",
  ["Two letters, the shortest keyword in the language, and the name of the language."] = "两个字母，这门语言里最短的关键字，也是这门语言的名字。",
  ["Two letters. == only checks the outer error; this unwraps."] = "两个字母。== 只检查最外层的 error；这个会逐层解包。",
  ["Two letters. Go's func with the middle taken out."] = "两个字母。Go 的 func 抽掉中间部分。",
  ["Two letters. In Rust it is an expression, so it can sit after =."] = "两个字母。在 Rust 里它是表达式，所以可以放在 = 后面。",
  ["Two letters. Is matches a value; this matches a type and fills the pointer."] = "两个字母。Is 匹配值；这个匹配类型并填充指针。",
  ["Two letters. Rust never converts numbers silently; you write the cast."] = "两个字母。Rust 从不悄悄转换数字；转换得你自己写。",
  ["Two letters. The other nineteen goroutines wait inside it until the first is finished."] = "两个字母。另外十九个 goroutine 会在它里面等到第一个跑完。",
  ["Two letters. The same word the for loop uses. Its cost depends entirely on the type on the right."] = "两个字母。for 循环用的同一个词。它的代价完全取决于右边的类型。",
  ["Two letters. Then a function call. The caller does not wait."] = "两个字母。后面跟函数调用。调用方不等待。",
  ["Two letters: the same object, not merely equal values. == would work here too, but this is the honest one."] = "两个字母：同一个对象，而不只是值相等。== 在这里也行，但这个才是诚实的那个。",
  ["Two numbers that add up to target. Store value to index; for each x ask if target - x is already there. Which method?"] = "两个数加起来等于 target。存 值到下标 的映射；对每个 x 问一句 target - x 在不在里面。哪个方法？",
  ["Two of the same character. One of them alone gives 4.1666, a float, every time."] = "两个相同的字符。只用一个的话永远得到 4.1666，一个 float。",
  ["Two packages in one file. What keyword opens the grouped list?"] = "一个文件里有两个包。用哪个关键字开启分组列表？",
  ["Two pointers that only move right: O(n) time, O(alphabet) space. 'abcabcbb' gives 3."] = "只向右移动的双指针：O(n) 时间，O(字母表) 空间。'abcabcbb' 得到 3。",
  ["Two pointers walk inward from both ends. Fill the step: i, j = i+1, ___"] = "双指针从两端向内走。填步进：i, j = i+1, ___",
  ["Two pointers: O(n) time, O(1) extra space. Same trick for sorted-array pair sums."] = "双指针：O(n) 时间，O(1) 额外空间。有序数组两数之和也是同样技巧。",
  ["Two processes, one conversation, no queue machinery. Which function?"] = "两个进程、一段对话，不要整套队列机制。用哪个函数？",
  ["Two repos, one laptop"] = "两个仓库，一台笔记本",
  ["Two runners: slow hops one node a lap, fast two. hop turns Option<Box<T>> into Option<&T>. Which method?"] = "两个跑者：slow 一圈跳一个节点，fast 跳两个。hop 把 Option<Box<T>> 变成 Option<&T>。哪个方法？",
  ["Two separate loops over the same n items, one after the other: O(n) + O(n) simplifies to O(___)"] = "对同样 n 项的两个独立循环，一前一后：O(n) + O(n) 简化为 O(___)",
  ["Two separate passes over the same n items, one after the other: O(n) + O(n) simplifies to O(___)"] = "对同样 n 项的两次独立遍历，一前一后：O(n) + O(n) 简化为 O(___)",
  ["Two singles, or one double. Count them."] = "两个一级，或一个两级。数一数。",
  ["Two slashes. A single one makes a float, and a[3.5] raises TypeError."] = "两条斜线。一条会得到 float，a[3.5] 就抛 TypeError。",
  ["Two slashes. Same as Go, C and JavaScript."] = "两个斜杠。和 Go、C、JavaScript 一样。",
  ["Two slashes: floor division. A single slash would make 3.5 and the slice would raise TypeError."] = "两条斜线：向下整除。一条斜线会得到 3.5，切片就会抛 TypeError。",
  ["Two sorted lists, two pointers: O(n log n). rooms peaks at the answer and never has to come down."] = "两个有序列表，两个指针：O(n log n)。rooms 的峰值就是答案，永远不必回落。",
  ["Two stars, then the name the body reads .items() from. Inside, it is a dict."] = "两个星号，然后是函数体读 .items() 的名字。在里面它是一个 dict。",
  ["Two stars. Go has no operator for this; Python and Rust's pow() do."] = "两个星号。Go 没有这个运算符；Python 有，Rust 用 pow()。",
  ["Two steps below i. The loop starts at 2 so this index never goes negative."] = "i 往下两级。循环从 2 开始，所以这个下标永远不会是负数。",
  ["Two steps below i. The same shape as fib, without the recursion."] = "i 往下两级。和 fib 同一个形状，只是没有递归。",
  ["Two tills need two senders into the same pipe. Which method makes the second?"] = "两台收银机需要两个发送者接到同一根管子。哪个方法造出第二个？",
  ["Two tills, both adding to sold. At 12:04 the screen says 311, the drawer says 317."] = "两台收银机都在加同一个 sold。12:04 屏幕说 311，钱箱说 317。",
  ["Two tills, one counter"] = "两台收银机，一个计数",
  ["Two tills, one kitchen. Orders pile up on my side and never arrive."] = "两台收银机，一个厨房。订单堆在我这边，从来到不了那边。",
  ["Two tills, six woks and forty riders touch the same numbers. Lock it, share it, cancel it. And find Go's await."] = "两台收银机、六个炒锅、四十个骑手碰着同一批数字。上锁、共享、取消。再找出 Go 的 await。",
  ["Two underscores, the name of the function above, two underscores. As a module the value would be the file name."] = "两条下划线，上面那个函数的名字，两条下划线。作为模块时值会是文件名。",
  ["Two underscores, the start of initialize, two underscores. Dunder methods all look like this."] = "两条下划线，initialize 的开头，两条下划线。dunder 方法都长这样。",
  ["Two words are anagrams if their letters, put in order, match. Which built-in orders them?"] = "两个词的字母排好序后一致，就是字母异位词。哪个内置函数给它们排序？",
  ["Two words as one, camelCase: use this, instead of that. The ssh form replaces the https prefix."] = "两个词合成一个，camelCase：用这个，代替那个。ssh 形式替换掉 https 前缀。",
  ["Two words glued: the verb you call to wait, and a thing you hold."] = "两个词粘在一起：你用来等待的动词，和你手里握的东西。",
  ["Two words joined by an underscore: the ones that appear the most, the way people say it."] = "两个词用下划线连起来：出现得最多的那些，就像人们平时说的那样。",
  ["Two words joined, CapWords: stop, and the thing generators do. A for loop catches it silently."] = "两个词连在一起，CapWords：停止，加上生成器做的那件事。for 循环会安静地捕获它。",
  ["Two words joined, lowercase. The first parameter is spelled cls by convention."] = "两个词连在一起，小写。第一个参数按约定写成 cls。",
  ["Two words joined, lowercase: not moving, and what a def in a class is."] = "两个词连在一起，小写：不动的，加上类里的 def 叫什么。",
  ["Two words joined, lowercase: the thing a with statement needs, as one name."] = "两个词连在一起，小写：with 语句需要的那样东西，写成一个名字。",
  ["Two words joined, no underscore: how it left, as a number. None until it has."] = "两个词拼起来，没有下划线：它是怎么离开的，用数字表示。离开之前是 None。",
  ["Two words joined: the mod folder, and what kind of folder it is. Eight letters."] = "两个词拼起来：mod 文件夹，加上它是哪种文件夹。八个字母。",
  ["Two words with an underscore: as, then the past participle of complete."] = "两个词用下划线连起来：as，加上 complete 的过去分词。",
  ["Two words with an underscore: make one of the things the loop schedules. tokio::spawn."] = "两个词用下划线连起来：创建一个循环会调度的东西。tokio::spawn。",
  ["Two words with an underscore: the task, and the state it is now in."] = "两个词用下划线连起来：任务，以及它现在所处的状态。",
  ["Two words with an underscore: the unit of work, then the past tense of finish."] = "两个词用下划线连起来：工作的单位，加上「做完了」。",
  ["Two words, CamelCase: a dict with an order."] = "两个词，驼峰式：一个有顺序的 dict。",
  ["Two words: the moment you promised, and what the clock did to it. The other one is Canceled."] = "两个词：你承诺的那一刻，以及时钟对它做的事。另一个是 Canceled。",
  ["Two-sum in one pass: for each x, is target minus x already known? Which dict is checked?"] = "一次遍历的两数之和：对每个 x，target 减 x 是否已知？检查哪个 dict？",
  ["Two-sum on a sorted slice, no HashMap: i from the left, j from the right. The sum is too big: which way does j move?"] = "有序切片上的两数之和，不用 HashMap：i 从左，j 从右。和太大了：j 往哪边走？",
  ["Two-sum, anagrams, palindromes"] = "两数之和、字母异位词、回文",
  ["Two-sum, palindrome, anagram"] = "两数之和、回文、变位词",
  ["Two-sum: a dict of seen values, one pass. Anagram: sorted(a) == sorted(b), or a Counter. Palindrome: two pointers from both ends."] = "两数之和：一个已见值的 dict，一次遍历。字母异位词：sorted(a) == sorted(b)，或者 Counter。回文：两端各一个指针。",
  ["Type hints"] = "类型标注",
  ["Type name, two colons, the method that copies a handle."] = "类型名，两个冒号，复制句柄的那个方法。",
  ["Type parameters go in [T any]. Embedding promotes methods. A closure captures nearby names."] = "类型参数写在 [T any] 里。嵌入会提升方法。闭包捕获周围的名字。",
  ["Type the answer, then ENTER."] = "输入答案，然后按 ENTER。",
  ["Un + Marshal. It needs a pointer so it can fill your variable."] = "Un 加 Marshal。它需要指针，才能填充你的变量。",
  ["Unchanged. That is the whole meaning of the 1 in O(1)."] = "不变。这就是 O(1) 里那个 1 的全部含义。",
  ["Unexported fields are skipped silently. Capital letters or nothing."] = "未导出字段会被悄悄跳过。要么大写，要么没有。",
  ["Unknown shape from the rider app. Which serde_json type holds any JSON?"] = "骑手 app 发来的形状未知。哪个 serde_json 类型能装任何 JSON？",
  ["Unmarshal(data, &v). Without & it decodes into a copy and you see nothing."] = "Unmarshal(data, &v)。不加 & 它只会解码到一份副本，你什么也看不到。",
  ["Unpack the Some or leave the function, no match block. Which keyword completes it?"] = "拆开 Some，否则离开函数，不写 match 块。哪个关键字补全它？",
  ["Unseen neighbours go to the back of the queue. Fill: queue = ___(queue, nb)"] = "未访问的邻居放到队尾。填空：queue = ___(queue, nb)",
  ["Up, down, right, left. A dirs table {{1,0},{-1,0},{0,1},{0,-1}} is the same thing in a loop."] = "上、下、右、左。一张 dirs 表 {{1,0},{-1,0},{0,1},{0,-1}} 放进循环里是同一回事。",
  ["Valid means matched and closed. O(n) time, O(n) stack in the worst case: a string of openers."] = "有效意味着全部匹配并闭合。O(n) 时间，最坏 O(n) 栈空间：一串全是开括号。",
  ["Valid parentheses and a min stack"] = "有效括号与最小栈",
  ["Valid parentheses, min stack"] = "有效括号，最小栈",
  ["Value and Array are the small end of shared memory: a type code, a size, and a lock in the box. SharedMemory is the large end."] = "Value 和 Array 是共享内存的小端：一个类型码、一个大小，还有盒子里的一把锁。SharedMemory 是大端。",
  ["Value ships with a lock so you do not invent one. Read, add, write is three steps here exactly as it was in Go."] = "Value 自带一把锁，省得你另造一个。读、加、写在这里同样是三步，和 Go 那边一模一样。",
  ["Variables need no type. int() and str() convert. // divides down, ** is power. None is no value."] = "变量不需要类型。int() 和 str() 转换。// 向下整除，** 是乘方。None 是没有值。",
  ["Variables, types, const"] = "变量、类型、const",
  ["Vec grows with push. Arrays have a fixed length in the type. HashMap stores key to value; get returns Option."] = "Vec 用 push 增长。数组的长度固定在类型里。HashMap 存键到值；get 返回 Option。",
  ["Vec plus Deque, a double-ended queue. A ring buffer: O(1) at both ends. Vec::remove(0) would be O(n)."] = "Vec 加上 Deque，一个双端队列。环形缓冲：两头都是 O(1)。Vec::remove(0) 会是 O(n)。",
  ["Vec, arrays and HashMap"] = "Vec、数组与 HashMap",
  ["Vec::sort is a merge sort; sort_unstable is pattern-defeating quicksort. Both n log n."] = "Vec::sort 是归并排序；sort_unstable 是 pattern-defeating 快速排序。两者都是 n log n。",
  ["Vec<Box<dyn Cook>>: every Box is one pointer wide, so the Vec is happy. Dispatch happens at run time. The kiosk shows one list."] = "Vec<Box<dyn Cook>>：每个 Box 都是一个指针宽，Vec 很满意。分派在运行时发生。自助机显示出一张列表。",
  ["VecDeque::from([start]) seeds the queue. seen starts with start too, so it is never queued twice."] = "VecDeque::from([start]) 给队列开个头。seen 一开始也装着 start，所以它不会被排两次。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Go basics.   PRIZE: the morning set."] = "ALEX 学到了：Go 基础。   奖励：早餐套餐。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Mutex and atomics, shared references, worker pools, pipelines, context, and that go plus a channel is await.   PRIZE: the SYNCED stamp."] = "阿力学到了：Mutex 和原子操作、共享引用、worker pool、流水线、context，还有 go 加一条 channel 就是 await。   奖品：SYNCED 印章。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: O(1) to O(2^n), and how to read a loop.   PRIZE: the O(1) stamp."] = "ALEX 学到了：从 O(1) 到 O(2^n)，以及怎样读一个循环。   奖品：O(1) 印章。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: O(1) to O(2^n), maps beat loops, sort then search.   PRIZE: the O(1) stamp."] = "ALEX 学到了：从 O(1) 到 O(2^n)，map 胜过循环，先排序再搜索。   奖品：O(1) 印章。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Python basics, lists, dicts, classes.   PRIZE: the shutter comes down."] = "ALEX 学到了：Python 基础、list、dict、class。   奖品：卷帘门落下。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Result, traits, lifetimes, threads, Arc<Mutex>.   PRIZE: milk tea and a pineapple bun."] = "阿力学到了：Result、trait、生命周期、线程、Arc<Mutex>。   奖品：奶茶和菠萝包。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Rust basics, ownership.   PRIZE: the afternoon tea set."] = "阿力学到了：Rust 基础、所有权。   奖品：下午茶套餐。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: String, errors, iterators, serde, async, cargo.   PRIZE: the service shipped."] = "阿力学到了：String、错误、迭代器、serde、async、cargo。   奖品：服务上线。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: exceptions, generators, decorators, with, asyncio, typing.   PRIZE: the midnight bowl."] = "ALEX 学到了：异常、生成器、装饰器、with、asyncio、类型标注。   奖品：午夜那碗面。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: goroutines, channels, sync.   PRIZE: the morning set."] = "ALEX 学到了：goroutine、channel、sync。   奖励：早餐套餐。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: recursion, trees, graphs, lists, sorting, hashing, workers.   PRIZE: HIRED."] = "ALEX 学到了：递归、树、图、链表、排序、哈希、worker。   奖励：录用！",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: stacks, DP, sliding windows, heaps, intervals, LRU, grid DFS.   PRIZE: the OFFER."] = "ALEX 学到了：栈、DP、滑动窗口、堆、区间、LRU、网格 DFS。   奖品：OFFER。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: strings, errors, JSON, HTTP.   PRIZE: the app is live."] = "ALEX 学到了：字符串、错误、JSON、HTTP。   奖励：app 上线了。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: the module path is the import path, a folder is a package, go get and go.sum, internal and cmd, replace and go.work, semver tags and /v2, the proxy and GOPRIVATE.   PRIZE: the v1.0.0 tag."] = "阿力学到了：模块路径就是导入路径，一个文件夹就是一个包，go get 和 go.sum，internal 和 cmd，replace 和 go.work，semver 标签和 /v2，代理和 GOPRIVATE。   奖品：v1.0.0 标签。",
  ["WHAT CHEF BO LEARNED: the GIL, Process and the main guard, Pool and chunksize, Queue and Pipe, locks and Value, shared_memory, ProcessPoolExecutor.   PRIZE: the SCALED stamp."] = "宝厨学到了：GIL、Process 和 main guard、Pool 和 chunksize、Queue 和 Pipe、锁和 Value、shared_memory、ProcessPoolExecutor。   奖品：SCALED 印章。",
  ["WHAT CHEF BO SHOWED: list stacks, DP, windows, heapq, intervals, OrderedDict LRU, grid DFS.   PRIZE: the OFFER."] = "BO 厨师示范了：list 栈、DP、窗口、heapq、区间、OrderedDict LRU、网格 DFS。   奖品：OFFER。",
  ["WHAT CHEF BO SHOWED: recursion, trees, graphs, lists, sorting, hashing, workers, in Python.   PRIZE: HIRED."] = "BO 厨师示范了：递归、树、图、链表、排序、哈希、工作线程，全部用 Python。   奖品：录用。",
  ["WHAT MEI SHOWED: O(1) to O(2^n), HashMap beats Vec::contains, sort then binary_search.   PRIZE: the O(1) stamp."] = "MEI 示范了：从 O(1) 到 O(2^n)，HashMap 胜过 Vec::contains，先排序再 binary_search。   奖品：O(1) 印章。",
  ["WHAT MEI SHOWED: Vec as a stack, DP tables, windows, BinaryHeap, intervals, an LRU, grid DFS.   PRIZE: the OFFER."] = "MEI 示范了：Vec 当栈、DP 表、窗口、BinaryHeap、区间、一个 LRU、网格 DFS。   奖品：OFFER。",
  ["WHAT MEI SHOWED: recursion, trees, graphs, lists, sorting, hashing, workers, in Rust.   PRIZE: HIRED."] = "阿美展示了：递归、树、图、链表、排序、哈希、工作线程，全部用 Rust。   奖品：录用。",
  ["WIND"] = "窗口",
  ["Wait for all three woks before printing the receipt. Which method blocks until a thread is done?"] = "打印收据前等齐三口锅。哪个方法阻塞到线程完成？",
  ["Wait for every cook to finish before closing the kitchen. Which JoinHandle method blocks until the thread ends?"] = "关厨房之前先等每个厨师干完。哪个 JoinHandle 方法会阻塞到线程结束？",
  ["Wait for the tea thread and take its result. Which method?"] = "等泡茶线程结束并取它的结果。哪个方法？",
  ["Wait on muffin or hash brown, whichever is ready. Which keyword?"] = "等松饼或薯饼，哪个先好用哪个。哪个关键字？",
  ["Wait one second without freezing the loop. Which asyncio function, never time.sleep?"] = "等一秒但不冻住循环。哪个 asyncio 函数，绝不是 time.sleep？",
  ["Wait then close(results) in a goroutine: the receiver's range ends cleanly. No leaks."] = "在 goroutine 里 Wait 再 close(results)：接收方的 range 干净地结束。没有泄漏。",
  ["Wait until both cooks call Done. Fill: var wg sync.___"] = "等两位厨师都调用 Done。填空：var wg sync.___",
  ["WaitGroup.Add(n), Done(), Wait(). The tray leaves when n hits zero."] = "WaitGroup.Add(n)、Done()、Wait()。n 归零时托盘出发。",
  ["Waiting on the network or burning the CPU: which word changes for CPU work?"] = "是在等网络，还是在烧 CPU：做 CPU 工作时哪个词要换？",
  ["Waiting overlaps under the GIL; computing does not. That one sentence chooses the executor every time."] = "等待在 GIL 之下可以重叠，计算不行。就这一句话，每次都替你选好 executor。",
  ["Walk every cell. Each unsunk building starts a new island: sink it whole, then add one. Fill the operator."] = "走遍每个格子。每个没沉的楼开启一座新岛：把它整个沉掉，然后加一。填这个运算符。",
  ["Walk every cell. Land that is still standing is a new island: count it and sink all of it. Which function does the sinking?"] = "走遍每一格。还立着的陆地就是一座新岛：计一并把它整个沉掉。哪个函数负责沉？",
  ["Walk every shop name in a slice. Fill: for _, name := ___ shops"] = "遍历 slice 里的每个店名。填空：for _, name := ___ shops",
  ["Walk from the flat to Lucky Mac. Fix every Go bug on the way."] = "从家走到幸运麦。修好沿路每一个 Go bug。",
  ["Walk names and quantities side by side. Which built-in pairs two lists?"] = "把名字和数量并排遍历。哪个内置函数把两个列表配对？",
  ["Walk over a Vec by reference, no index. Which method starts the iterator?"] = "按引用遍历 Vec，不用下标。哪个方法开启迭代器？",
  ["Walk with Mei to Lucky Mac Express. Fix every Rust kiosk on the way."] = "和 Mei 一起走到幸运麦 Express。修好沿路每一台 Rust 点餐机。",
  ["Walking by reference: no clone, no take, nothing moves. node is &Box<ListNode>, auto-deref reaches next."] = "按引用遍历：不 clone，不 take，什么都不移动。node 是 &Box<ListNode>，自动解引用就能拿到 next。",
  ["Warm the grill exactly once, however many cooks call it. Fill: var once sync.___"] = "不管多少厨师调用，烤盘只预热一次。填空：var once sync.___",
  ["Warm, fry and brew at once; stop all three on the first error. Which package?"] = "同时加热、油炸和沏茶；第一个出错就三个一起停。用哪个包？",
  ["Was the key there? The second result is a bool named ___."] = "键存在吗？第二个结果是一个叫 ___ 的 bool。",
  ["Water, or land already sunk, ends the flood. The grid holds bytes: which byte literal is land?"] = "水，或者已经沉掉的陆地，都终止洪泛。网格存的是字节：哪个字节字面量是陆地？",
  ["Ways to climb 0 steps and 1 step: one each. Fill the base cases."] = "爬 0 级和爬 1 级的走法：各一种。填基础情况。",
  ["We already checked mid, so skip past it. hi = mid keeps the half-open rule."] = "mid 已经检查过，跳过它。hi = mid 保持半开区间规则。",
  ["Welcome back, Alex. The callback is the whiteboard round. First: are these brackets balanced?"] = "欢迎回来，Alex。复试就是白板轮。第一题：这些括号平衡吗？",
  ["Welcome to CODE RUSH! Round one: factorial, then fib without the exponential blowup. Buzzer's live!"] = "欢迎来到 CODE RUSH！第一回合：阶乘，然后是不会指数爆炸的 fib。抢答器开了！",
  ["What a channel does. The -ing form of the verb in the first half of the line."] = "channel 做的事。这行前半句那个动词的 -ing 形式。",
  ["What goes between the parameter list and the return type u32?"] = "参数列表和返回类型 u32 之间写什么？",
  ["What is __name__ equal to when the file is run directly, not imported?"] = "文件直接运行而不是被导入时，__name__ 等于什么？",
  ["What is the lightweight thread go starts called?"] = "go 启动的轻量级线程叫什么？",
  ["What is the three-letter name of the lock that lets one thread run bytecode at a time?"] = "让一次只有一条线程运行字节码的那把锁，三个字母的名字是什么？",
  ["What versions of everything is this build using? Fill the subcommand."] = "这次构建用的是每样东西的哪个版本？填上子命令。",
  ["Whatever opened last must close first. That sentence is a stack."] = "最后打开的必须最先关闭。这句话就是一个栈。",
  ["When fast reaches the end, slow is halfway. One pass, no length count."] = "fast 到末尾时，slow 在中间。一次遍历，不数长度。",
  ["When fast runs out, slow stands in the middle. O(n) time, O(1) space, and Option<&T> is Copy so the hops are free. Combo x4."] = "fast 走到头时，slow 正好站在中间。时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)，而且 Option<&T> 是 Copy，所以这些跳跃不花钱。连击 x4。",
  ["When you edit a library and its caller at the same time, replace points a module path at a folder on disk, and go.work does it for a whole workspace without touching any go.mod. cannot find module means the import path and go.mod disagree; go mod tidy repairs go.mod from the imports. go mod vendor copies every dependency into the repo for builds with no network."] = "同时改一个库和它的调用方时，replace 把模块路径指向磁盘上的文件夹，go.work 则不碰任何 go.mod 就为整个工作区做同样的事。cannot find module 意味着导入路径和 go.mod 不一致；go mod tidy 根据 import 修好 go.mod。go mod vendor 把每个依赖复制进仓库，供没有网络的构建使用。",
  ["Where did the download actually land? Fill the last directory of the cache."] = "下载到底落在了哪里？填上缓存的最后一级目录。",
  ["Where do cur and best start? Not at 0: a list of only losses still has a best hour."] = "cur 和 best 从哪里开始？不是 0：全是亏损的列表也有最好的一小时。",
  ["Where does a context go? Name the first parameter every Go API uses."] = "context 放在哪里？说出每个 Go API 都用的那个第一参数。",
  ["Where does go get look first, and what does it fall back to? Fill the fallback."] = "go get 先看哪里，找不到又退回到什么？填上后备值。",
  ["Where is await?"] = "await 在哪里？",
  ["Which Cargo.toml section lists the crates the project uses?"] = "Cargo.toml 的哪一节列出项目用到的 crate？",
  ["Which Go type finds a price by name in O(1), on average?"] = "哪个 Go 类型按名字找价格是平均 O(1)？",
  ["Which built-in reads a line typed at the terminal?"] = "哪个内置函数读取终端输入的一行？",
  ["Which built-in tells you what kind of value price is?"] = "哪个内置函数告诉你 price 是什么类型的值？",
  ["Which built-in type finds a price by name in O(1), on average?"] = "哪个内置类型按名字找价格是平均 O(1)？",
  ["Which built-in writes a line to the terminal?"] = "哪个内置函数把一行写到终端？",
  ["Which directory name makes a package importable only from inside this module?"] = "哪个目录名让一个包只能从这个模块内部导入？",
  ["Which go.mod is in charge here? Ask the tool for the file it found."] = "这里由哪个 go.mod 说了算？问工具它找到了哪个文件。",
  ["Which keyword before def makes fetch a coroutine?"] = "def 前面的哪个关键字让 fetch 成为协程？",
  ["Which keyword binds a name to a value in Rust?"] = "在 Rust 里哪个关键字把名字绑定到值上？",
  ["Which keyword brings HashMap from the standard library into this file?"] = "哪个关键字把标准库里的 HashMap 引进这个文件？",
  ["Which keyword brings the time module in?"] = "哪个关键字引入 time 模块？",
  ["Which keyword declares a function in Rust?"] = "Rust 里哪个关键字声明函数？",
  ["Which keyword declares a set of methods that types can promise?"] = "哪个关键字声明一组类型可以承诺实现的方法？",
  ["Which keyword defines a new type?"] = "哪个关键字定义一个新类型？",
  ["Which keyword opens the block whose errors you want to catch?"] = "哪个关键字打开你想捕获错误的代码块？",
  ["Which keyword starts a function definition?"] = "哪个关键字开始一个函数定义？",
  ["Which letter before the quote lets {n} be replaced by the value of n?"] = "引号前的哪个字母让 {n} 被替换成 n 的值？",
  ["Which method returns 9 for the three characters of 銅鑼灣?"] = "哪个方法对 銅鑼灣 这三个字符返回 9？",
  ["Which operator raises 2 to the tenth power?"] = "哪个运算符计算 2 的 10 次方？",
  ["Which placeholder inside the string prints the value of n?"] = "字符串里的哪个占位符会打印 n 的值？",
  ["Which special method runs when Order('noodles') is created?"] = "Order('noodles') 被创建时运行哪个特殊方法？",
  ["Which standard library module gives real parallelism for CPU work?"] = "哪个标准库模块能为 CPU 工作提供真正的并行？",
  ["Which standard package prints to the terminal?"] = "哪个标准包负责向终端打印？",
  ["Which std collection finds a price by name in O(1), on average?"] = "哪个 std 集合按名字找价格是平均 O(1)？",
  ["Which std trait, with an empty body, makes OrderError a real error?"] = "哪个 std trait，空着函数体，就能让 OrderError 成为真正的错误？",
  ["Why do four threads not make four times the arithmetic? Name the lock, three letters."] = "为什么四个线程做不出四倍的运算？说出那把锁的名字，三个字母。",
  ["Why does a second process escape the lock? Each one has its own ___."] = "为什么第二个进程能逃开这把锁？因为每个都有自己的 ___。",
  ["Why threads do not go faster"] = "为什么线程不会更快",
  ["With a JoinableQueue the parent waits for the work, not the workers. Which call acknowledges one item?"] = "用 JoinableQueue 时，父进程等的是活儿，不是 worker。哪个调用确认了一件事做完了？",
  ["With a cache every fib(k) is computed once. The cost drops to O(___)"] = "有了 cache 每个 fib(k) 只算一次。代价降到 O(___)",
  ["With a memo every fib(k) is computed once. The cost drops to O(___)"] = "有了 memo 每个 fib(k) 只算一次。代价降到 O(___)",
  ["With a vendor directory present, go build uses it and never touches the network or the cache. It is the whole dependency set, checked in, reviewable in a diff."] = "有 vendor 目录在，go build 就用它，再也不碰网络或缓存。那是整套依赖，已签入，能在 diff 里审阅。",
  ["With cap 1 the sender finishes even if the context won the select. With an unbuffered channel that goroutine would block for ever: a leak."] = "容量为 1 时，即使 select 里是 context 赢了，发送方也能跑完。用无缓冲 channel 的话那个 goroutine 会永远阻塞：泄漏。",
  ["With, then a duration word. The twin that takes a time.Time is WithDeadline."] = "With，再加一个表示时长的词。接受 time.Time 的那个孪生兄弟叫 WithDeadline。",
  ["With, then the verb for stopping. Its siblings are WithTimeout and WithDeadline."] = "With，再加表示停止的那个动词。它的兄弟是 WithTimeout 和 WithDeadline。",
  ["With, then the word for a time limit. WithDeadline takes a clock time instead."] = "With，再加表示时限的词。WithDeadline 则接收一个时钟时刻。",
  ["With, then the word for what is stored. The key is a private type so nobody can collide with it."] = "With，再加表示所存之物的那个词。键用一个私有类型，这样谁都撞不上。",
  ["WithTimeout returns a child that cancels itself. Always defer cancel() or you leak."] = "WithTimeout 返回一个会自行取消的子 context。永远要 defer cancel()，否则会泄漏。",
  ["WithValue is for request-scoped data that crosses API boundaries: a trace id, not the parameters of your function."] = "WithValue 是给跨 API 边界的请求级数据用的：trace id 可以，你函数的参数不行。",
  ["Without a with block, what must always follow acquire()?"] = "不用 with 块的话，acquire() 之后必须永远跟着什么？",
  ["Without the guard, spawn re-imports the file, the import starts another Process, and that is the fork bomb you just wrote by accident."] = "没有这个 guard，spawn 会重新 import 文件，而这次 import 又启动一个 Process，那就是你无意中写出的 fork 炸弹。",
  ["Without with, which method must you remember to call on the file?"] = "没有 with 的话，你必须记得对文件调用哪个方法？",
  ["Word count. New word: start at 0. Seen word: bump it. One entry call does both. Fill: entry(w).___(0)"] = "词频统计。新词：从 0 开始。见过的词：加一。一次 entry 调用两件事都办了。填空：entry(w).___(0)",
  ["Worker pool and pipeline"] = "工作池与流水线",
  ["Worker pool with threads"] = "用线程做工作池",
  ["Worker pool: N goroutines range over a jobs channel; close(jobs) ends them; WaitGroup then close(results)."] = "工作池：N 个 goroutine 对 jobs channel 做 range；close(jobs) 结束它们；WaitGroup 之后 close(results)。",
  ["Worker pool: an mpsc channel of jobs, the Receiver in Arc<Mutex<>>, N thread::spawn workers looping on recv. drop(tx) ends them, join waits."] = "工作池：一条装任务的 mpsc channel，Receiver 放进 Arc<Mutex<>>，N 个 thread::spawn 出来的工人循环 recv。drop(tx) 结束它们，join 等它们。",
  ["Worker pools and how many to start"] = "worker pool 和该开多少个",
  ["Workers are identical goroutines sharing one input channel. The channel is the queue."] = "worker 是共享同一个输入 channel 的相同 goroutine。channel 就是队列。",
  ["Works on slices, strings, maps, channels. cap is the capacity."] = "适用于 slice、string、map、channel。cap 是容量。",
  ["Wrap the bytes as an array without copying them. Which attribute is the memoryview?"] = "不复制地把这些字节包成数组。哪个属性是那个 memoryview？",
  ["Write the reply into w, not the terminal. Which fmt function?"] = "把回复写进 w，不是终端。用 fmt 的哪个函数？",
  ["You can clone it. The proxy cannot. Tell the tool which paths to fetch itself."] = "你能 clone。代理不能。告诉工具哪些路径要它自己去取。",
  ["You did tokio this afternoon. asyncio is the same shape: one loop, many awaits."] = "你下午做过 tokio。asyncio 是同样的形状：一个循环，很多 await。",
  ["You fixed Price in luckymac, but the cousin's shop still builds against v1.2.0 from the cache. Of course it does."] = "你在 luckymac 里修好了 Price，可表哥的店还在用缓存里的 v1.2.0 构建。当然会这样。",
  ["You got HIRED at seven. This is the OFFER round. A stack, Mei, it's always a stack."] = "七点你拿到了 HIRED。这是 OFFER 轮。用栈，Mei，永远是栈。",
  ["You imported rider and then deleted the call. Finish the error."] = "你导入了 rider，然后删掉了调用。补全错误信息。",
  ["You made a menu folder and wrote package pricing inside it. Go accepts it. Every reader will hate it."] = "你建了个 menu 文件夹，里面却写 package pricing。Go 接受它。每个读代码的人都会讨厌它。",
  ["You only need a bool: is the order in one of two states? Which macro?"] = "你只需要一个 bool：订单是否处于两种状态之一？哪个宏？",
  ["You reach step i from one below or two below. Fill the second term: dp[i - 1] + dp[___]"] = "到达第 i 级来自下一级或下两级。填第二项：dp[i - 1] + dp[___]",
  ["You reach step i from one step below or two steps below. Fill the second index."] = "到达第 i 级要么从下一级来，要么从下两级来。填上第二个下标。",
  ["You still want the position of every dish on the ticket. Which adapter adds it?"] = "你还是想要每道菜在票上的位置。哪个适配器加上它？",
  ["Your workers each pickled two gigabytes of the same table. That is the whole runtime, right there."] = "你每个 worker 都 pickle 了同一张两个 GB 的表。整个运行时间就在那儿。",
  ["[0i32; 26] lives on the stack: no HashMap, no allocation. Add for a, subtract for b, all zero means anagram."] = "[0i32; 26] 待在栈上：不用 HashMap，不分配堆内存。a 加，b 减，全为零就是变位词。",
  ["[1,6] absorbs [2,4]: without the larger-end rule you would shrink it to [1,4]. last is a slice, so out sees the change."] = "[1,6] 吞掉 [2,4]：没有取更大终点的规则，你会把它缩成 [1,4]。last 是切片，所以 out 能看到改动。",
  ["[3]string is an array: a value, fixed length, copied on assignment. []string is a slice."] = "[3]string 是数组：值类型，定长，赋值时复制。[]string 是 slice。",
  ["[T any] is the widest constraint. comparable is for map keys."] = "[T any] 是最宽的约束。comparable 用于 map 的键。",
  ["[[9, 11], [10, 12], [13, 15]] becomes [[9, 12], [13, 15]]. Sort plus one pass: O(n log n)."] = "[[9, 11], [10, 12], [13, 15]] 变成 [[9, 12], [13, 15]]。排序加一趟：O(n log n)。",
  ["[]int is a slice. [3]int is an array of three. Slices are what you use."] = "[]int 是 slice。[3]int 是三个元素的数组。平时用的是 slice。",
  ["[]rune(s) once, then index freely. Interviewers check this in Go."] = "先 []rune(s) 一次，然后随意取下标。面试官在 Go 里专门考这个。",
  ["[dependencies] asks for versions; Cargo.lock records the exact ones. Commit the lock for binaries."] = "[dependencies] 提出版本要求；Cargo.lock 记下精确版本。二进制项目要把 lock 文件提交进去。",
  ["[expr for x in xs if cond] is a list comprehension. Rust's iter().map().collect(), in one readable line."] = "[expr for x in xs if cond] 是列表推导式。Rust 的 iter().map().collect()，写成一行好读的话。",
  ["[i32; 3] lives on the stack and never grows. Vec is for lists that change size."] = "[i32; 3] 放在栈上，永不增长。Vec 用于大小会变的列表。",
  ['[package]\nname = "delivery"\nedition = "2021"\n\n[___]\nserde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }\ntokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }\n'] = '[package]\nname = "delivery"\nedition = "2021"\n\n[___]\nserde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }\ntokio = { version = "1", features = ["full"] }\n',
  ["_ matches anything and binds nothing. Without it the match is not exhaustive and will not compile. The gate shows set."] = "_ 匹配一切，不绑定任何东西。没有它 match 就不穷尽，编译不过。闸门显示 set。",
  ["_ means I know this exists and I am ignoring it on purpose."] = "_ 的意思是：我知道它存在，我是故意忽略它。",
  ['___ OPEN: u8 = 7;        // hour the Express opens\n\nfn main() {\n    println!("opens at {}", OPEN);\n}\n'] = '___ OPEN: u8 = 7;        // Express 的开门时间\n\nfn main() {\n    println!("opens at {}", OPEN);\n}\n',
  ['___ Order {\n    item: String,\n    qty: u32,\n}\nlet o = Order { item: "muffin".to_string(), qty: 2 };\n'] = '___ Order {\n    item: String,\n    qty: u32,\n}\nlet o = Order { item: "muffin".to_string(), qty: 2 };\n',
  ["___ Order:\n    pass\n\no = Order()\n"] = "___ Order:\n    pass\n\no = Order()\n",
  ["___ Size { Small, Large }\n\nlet size = Size::Large;\nlet extra = match size {\n    Size::Small => 0,\n    Size::Large => 5,       // every variant handled\n};\n"] = "___ Size { Small, Large }\n\nlet size = Size::Large;\nlet extra = match size {\n    Size::Small => 0,\n    Size::Large => 5,       // 每个变体都处理了\n};\n",
  ['___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n'] = '___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n',
  ['___ fry(item):\n    print("frying", item)\n\nfry("egg")\n'] = '___ fry(item):\n    print("frying", item)\n\nfry("egg")\n',
  ['___ greet() {\n    println!("welcome to Lucky Mac Express");\n}\n// no arrow: this one returns the unit type ()\n'] = '___ greet() {\n    println!("welcome to Lucky Mac Express");\n}\n// 没有箭头：这个返回单元类型 ()\n',
  ["___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n"] = "___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n",
  ['___ night shift starts at 21:00\nprint("open")\n'] = '___ 夜班 21:00 开始\nprint("open")\n',
  ['___ open("stock.csv") as f:\n    for line in f:\n        count(line)\n# f is closed here\n'] = '___ open("stock.csv") as f:\n    for line in f:\n        count(line)\n# 到这里 f 已经关闭\n',
  ['___ queue:\n    person = queue.pop(0)\n    print("bowl for", person)\n'] = '___ queue:\n    person = queue.pop(0)\n    print("bowl for", person)\n',
  ['___ std::collections::HashMap;\n\nfn main() {\n    let mut stock = HashMap::new();\n    stock.insert("muffin", 4);\n}\n'] = '___ std::collections::HashMap;\n\nfn main() {\n    let mut stock = HashMap::new();\n    stock.insert("muffin", 4);\n}\n',
  ["___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n"] = "___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n",
  ['___ time\ntime.sleep(1)     # let the wok heat\nprint("ready")\n'] = '___ time\ntime.sleep(1)     # 让锅先热起来\nprint("ready")\n',
  ["___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n"] = "___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n",
  ['___("Lucky Mac night shift")\n'] = '___("Lucky Mac night shift")\n',
  ["___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // ok is false after\n"] = "___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // 之后 ok 为 false\n",
  ["___(floors)                  // len(floors) == 0 after\n"] = "___(floors)                  // 之后 len(floors) == 0\n",
  ['___(prices, "closed")\n'] = '___(prices, "closed")\n',
  ['___, err := tap("octopus")\n'] = '___, err := tap("octopus")\n',
  ["___:\n    qty = int(raw)\nexcept ValueError:\n    qty = 0\n"] = "___:\n    qty = int(raw)\nexcept ValueError:\n    qty = 0\n",
  ['___timer\ndef fry(item):\n    return f"fried {item}"\n'] = '___timer\ndef fry(item):\n    return f"fried {item}"\n',
  ["__enter__ runs at the with line. Return self or the resource. Rust would use Drop for the other half."] = "__enter__ 在 with 那一行运行。返回 self 或者资源。Rust 另一半会用 Drop。",
  ["__exit__(self, exc_type, exc, tb) always runs. Return True to swallow the exception; return None to let it propagate."] = "__exit__(self, exc_type, exc, tb) 总会运行。返回 True 吞掉异常；返回 None 让它继续传播。",
  ["__init__ is the constructor body; self.item = item makes an attribute. __new__ exists too, rarely needed."] = "__init__ 是构造器的主体；self.item = item 创建一个属性。__new__ 也存在，很少需要。",
  ["__str__ is what print and str() use; __repr__ is the unambiguous form, used when __str__ is missing. Go's String()."] = "__str__ 是 print 和 str() 用的；__repr__ 是无歧义的形式，__str__ 缺失时用它。Go 的 String()。",
  ["a + b with no semicolon is the value of the block. Go coders write return; Rust coders usually do not."] = "不带分号的 a + b 就是块的值。写 Go 的人写 return；写 Rust 的人通常不写。",
  ["a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // prints ___\n"] = "a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // 打印 ___\n",
  ["a if cond else b reads left to right like English. The shutter sign flips to 'closed' at the last bowl."] = "a if cond else b 像英语一样从左读到右。最后一碗出完，门口的牌子翻成 'closed'。",
  ["a lesson you can carry in a photo album"] = "一堂可以放进相册随身携带的课",
  ["a to z. The array length is part of the type, so it must be a constant."] = "从 a 到 z。数组长度是类型的一部分，所以必须是常量。",
  ["a.clone() allocates a second buffer. Cheap types derive Copy instead and never need it."] = "a.clone() 分配第二个缓冲区。便宜的类型改用 derive Copy，根本不需要它。",
  ["a.clone(). Allocation is where space complexity is paid; drop frees it at the end of scope, no collector needed."] = "a.clone()。分配就是支付空间复杂度的地方；drop 在作用域结束时释放，不需要回收器。",
  ["a.sort()                              # once: n log n\nfor x in queries:\n    i = bisect.bisect_left(a, x)      # each: O(___)\n"] = "a.sort()                              # 一次：n log n\nfor x in queries:\n    i = bisect.bisect_left(a, x)      # 每次：O(___)\n",
  ["a.sort()    # in place: O(___) extra space (Timsort's small buffer aside)\n"] = "a.sort()    # 原地：额外空间 O(___)（Timsort 的小缓冲不算）\n",
  ["a.sort() sorts the list where it is. Extra memory, in Big O: O(___)"] = "a.sort() 就地排序列表。额外内存，用 Big O 说：O(___)",
  ["a.sort();                                  // once: n log n\nfor x in &queries {\n    let hit = a.binary_search(x).is_ok();  // each: O(___)\n}\n"] = "a.sort();                                  // 一次：n log n\nfor x in &queries {\n    let hit = a.binary_search(x).is_ok();  // 每次：O(___)\n}\n",
  ["a.sort_unstable();    // in place: O(___) extra space\n"] = "a.sort_unstable();    // 原地：额外空间 O(___)\n",
  ["a[-1] is the last item, a[-2] the one before. Bo's off-by-one is gone."] = "a[-1] 是最后一项，a[-2] 是倒数第二。Bo 的差一错误消失了。",
  ["a[1:3] copies items 1 and 2 into a new list. a[:2], a[2:], a[::2] and a[::-1] (reversed) all work."] = "a[1:3] 把第 1、2 项复制进新列表。a[:2]、a[2:]、a[::2] 和 a[::-1]（反转）都行。",
  ["a[mid] is too small: the answer is to the right. Fill: lo = ___ + 1"] = "a[mid] 太小：答案在右边。填空：lo = ___ + 1",
  ["add changes qty. Which receiver borrows the order with write access?"] = "add 修改 qty。哪个接收者带写权限借用订单？",
  ["amounts.___();     // pdqsort, no scratch buffer, O(n log n)\n"] = "amounts.___();     // pdqsort，没有临时缓冲，O(n log n)\n",
  ["amounts.sort();    // ___ : stable merge sort\n"] = "amounts.sort();    // ___ ：稳定的归并排序\n",
  ["append is amortized O(1). Python has no stack class; a list is the stack."] = "append 均摊 O(1)。Python 没有栈类；列表就是栈。",
  ["apply_async returned a handle. Which method waits for the value?"] = "apply_async 返回了一个句柄。哪个方法等这个值？",
  ["arr writes straight into the shared block, so every process sees the change with no send at all. This is how big NumPy jobs go parallel."] = "arr 直接写进那块共享内存，所以每个进程都看得到这次改动，完全不用发送。大型 NumPy 任务就是这样并行的。",
  ["arrows walk   ESC map"] = "方向键 走   ESC 地图",
  ["as f binds what __enter__ returned. with a() as x, b() as y: manages two at once."] = "as f 绑定 __enter__ 返回的东西。with a() as x, b() as y: 同时管理两个。",
  ["as usize widens the u8 for free. A u8 index would not compile: Rust never converts integers silently."] = "as usize 免费把 u8 拓宽。用 u8 当下标编译不过：Rust 从不悄悄转换整数。",
  ["as_ followed by the short word for reference. Its cousin as_deref goes one step further, to Option<&Node>."] = "as_ 后面接表示引用的那个短词。它的同伴 as_deref 更进一步，给到 Option<&Node>。",
  ["as_completed is Go's select over many channels: whoever finishes first is served first, and a slow chunk never holds up the log."] = "as_completed 就是 Go 对着许多条 channel 的 select：谁先做完就先招呼谁，慢的那一块绝不会拖住日志。",
  ["as_ref would give Option<&Box<T>>. This one also derefs the Box. as_ plus deref."] = "as_ref 给到的是 Option<&Box<T>>。这个还会对 Box 解引用。as_ 加上 deref。",
  ["async and tokio"] = "async 与 tokio",
