  ["async def makes a coroutine; await pauses it until the result is in. asyncio.run starts the loop, gather runs several at once, sleep waits without blocking, create_task fires and forgets."] = "async def 创建协程；await 暂停它直到结果到来。asyncio.run 启动循环，gather 同时运行多个，sleep 不阻塞地等待，create_task 放出去不管。",
  ["async def returns a coroutine object when called; nothing runs until it is awaited or scheduled."] = "async def 被调用时返回一个协程对象；在被 await 或调度之前什么都不会运行。",
  ["async fn eta(url: &str) -> Result<String, Box<dyn Error>> {\n    // GET, wait for headers, then wait for the body\n    let body = ___::get(url).await?.text().await?;\n    Ok(body)\n}\n"] = "async fn eta(url: &str) -> Result<String, Box<dyn Error>> {\n    // GET，先等响应头，再等响应体\n    let body = ___::get(url).await?.text().await?;\n    Ok(body)\n}\n",
  ["async fn fetch_eta(..) -> u32 really returns impl Future<Output = u32>. Nothing runs until polled."] = "async fn fetch_eta(..) -> u32 实际返回 impl Future<Output = u32>。被 poll 之前什么都不跑。",
  ['async fn plan() {\n    // suspends here; other tasks run while we wait\n    let eta = fetch_eta(7)___;\n    println!("rider back in {eta} min");\n}\n'] = 'async fn plan() {\n    // 在这里挂起；我们等待时其他任务照常跑\n    let eta = fetch_eta(7)___;\n    println!("rider back in {eta} min");\n}\n',
  ["async fn returns a Future; .await drives it. tokio runs them; spawn and join! run them at once."] = "async fn 返回 Future；.await 驱动它。tokio 负责运行；spawn 和 join! 让它们同时跑。",
  ["asyncio"] = "asyncio",
  ["asyncio handles the waiting, processes handle the computing, and await joins them. Go does the same thing with one goroutine and no ceremony."] = "asyncio 负责等，进程负责算，await 把两边接起来。Go 用一个 goroutine 就做同一件事，还不用这么多仪式。",
  ["asyncio.run(main()) creates the loop, runs the coroutine, closes the loop. Rust's #[tokio::main]."] = "asyncio.run(main()) 创建循环、运行协程、关闭循环。Rust 的 #[tokio::main]。",
  ["atomic.Int64 keeps its own value, so nobody can read it the unsafe way. The old atomic.AddInt64(&n, 1) still works, but the type is safer."] = "atomic.Int64 自己保管着那个值，所以没人能用不安全的方式读它。老写法 atomic.AddInt64(&n, 1) 仍然可用，但用类型更安全。",
  ["atomic.Pointer[Menu] gives copy-on-write config: build a new menu, Store it, and every reader after that sees the new one whole."] = "atomic.Pointer[Menu] 给你写时复制的配置：做一份新菜单，Store 进去，之后每个读者看到的都是完整的新版本。",
  ["await asyncio.sleep(1) yields to the loop; time.sleep(1) would freeze every task. Same trap as in tokio."] = "await asyncio.sleep(1) 让给循环；time.sleep(1) 会冻住每个任务。和 tokio 里一样的陷阱。",
  ["await hands control to the event loop until the coroutine finishes. Only allowed inside async def."] = "await 把控制权交给事件循环直到协程完成。只允许在 async def 里使用。",
