  ["class defines a type. __init__ runs on creation; self is the object, written explicitly. __str__ is the print form. super() reaches the parent. @dataclass writes the boilerplate."] = "class 定义一个类型。__init__ 在创建时运行；self 是对象本身，要明写。__str__ 是打印形式。super() 触及父类。@dataclass 替你写样板代码。",
  ["class, __init__, self"] = "class、__init__、self",
  ["clear(m) deletes every key. Before 1.21 you looped with delete."] = "clear(m) 删除所有键。1.21 之前要用 delete 循环删。",
  ["close() drops your view, unlink() destroys the block. Skip unlink and the memory is still there after the process ends, with a warning to match."] = "close() 放掉你的视图，unlink() 才销毁这块内存。漏了 unlink，进程结束后内存还在，还会附送一段警告。",
