  ["concurrent map writes killed the process. Which sync type is a map made for goroutines?"] = "concurrent map writes 把进程弄死了。sync 的哪个类型是为 goroutine 造的 map？",
  ["concurrent.futures is the one API for both: ThreadPoolExecutor for waiting, ProcessPoolExecutor for computing. submit returns a Future whose result() blocks and re-raises; as_completed yields futures as they finish; executor.map keeps the order. asyncio joins in through run_in_executor, so an event loop can hand CPU work to processes without blocking."] = "concurrent.futures 是两边共用的一套 API：等东西用 ThreadPoolExecutor，算东西用 ProcessPoolExecutor。submit 返回一个 Future，它的 result() 会阻塞并重新抛出异常；as_completed 谁先做完就交出谁；executor.map 保持顺序。asyncio 通过 run_in_executor 加入进来，于是事件循环可以把 CPU 工作交给进程而不被阻塞。",
  ["const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n"] = "const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n",
