  ["const opens = 6. The lift knows when breakfast starts."] = "const opens = 6。电梯知道早餐几点开始。",
  ["container/heap needs Less. For a min-heap, when does i come before j?"] = "container/heap 需要 Less。最小堆里，i 什么时候排在 j 前面？",
