  ["dict: hash, slot, compare. O(1) average, O(n) worst when everything collides. Go's map, Rust's HashMap."] = "dict：哈希、槽位、比较。平均 O(1)，全部碰撞时最差 O(n)。Go 的 map，Rust 的 HashMap。",
  ["dict[str, float]. Go's map[string]float64, Rust's HashMap<String, f64>. TypedDict names each key."] = "dict[str, float]。Go 的 map[string]float64，Rust 的 HashMap<String, f64>。TypedDict 给每个键命名。",
  ["done := make(chan ___)   // zero bytes per value\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n"] = "done := make(chan ___)   // 每个值零字节\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n",
