  ["elif chains tests top to bottom; the first true branch runs, the rest are skipped. No switch in Python before match."] = "elif 从上到下串起判断；第一个为真的分支执行，其余跳过。match 之前的 Python 没有 switch。",
  ["entry(a).or_default() returns &mut Vec<u32>, so push works in one line. One hash lookup, not two."] = "entry(a).or_default() 返回 &mut Vec<u32>，所以一行就能 push。只查一次哈希，不是两次。",
  ["entry(k).or_insert(0) returns &mut to the value; * dereferences it. get(k) returns Option, so a missing key is None, not a panic."] = "entry(k).or_insert(0) 返回指向值的 &mut；* 解引用。get(k) 返回 Option，所以不存在的键是 None，不是 panic。",
  ["enum OrderError lists every failure. Debug is required by the Error trait later."] = "enum OrderError 列出每一种失败。之后 Error trait 要求实现 Debug。",
  ["enum Size { Small, Large } Variants can carry data too, like Some(12). match without a Medium arm is a compile error, not a bug at the till."] = "enum Size { Small, Large } 变体也能带数据，比如 Some(12)。match 少了 Medium 分支是编译错误，不是收银机上的 bug。",
  ['enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// a pattern test that returns true or false\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n'] = 'enum State { Queued, Cooking, Riding, Done }\n// 一次模式测试，返回 true 或 false\nlet busy = ___!(state, State::Cooking | State::Riding);\nif busy { println!("not yet"); }\n',
  ["enumerate() gives (index, item). zip(prices) would give (dish, price). No off-by-one."] = "enumerate() 给出 (下标, 元素)。zip(prices) 则给出 (菜, 价格)。不会差一。",
  ["enumerate(xs, start) yields (i, x). Never write for i in range(len(xs)) when you also need xs[i]."] = "enumerate(xs, start) 产出 (i, x)。当你还需要 xs[i] 时，永远不要写 for i in range(len(xs))。",
  ["errgroup.WithContext cancels the shared ctx the moment one task fails, and Wait returns that first error. It is Go's Promise.all."] = "errgroup.WithContext 在有一个任务失败的那一刻取消共享的 ctx，而 Wait 返回那第一个错误。它就是 Go 版的 Promise.all。",
  ["error is an interface. Check err != nil. defer runs when the function returns."] = "error 是一个 interface。检查 err != nil。defer 在函数返回时执行。",
  ["error is interface{ Error() string }. Your own types can carry data."] = "error 就是 interface{ Error() string }。你自己的类型可以携带数据。",
  ["errors.As finds the first error of that type and stores it in re."] = "errors.As 找到链中第一个该类型的 error，存进 re。",
  ["errors.Is compares values down the chain. Use it instead of ==."] = "errors.Is 沿着链逐个比较值。用它代替 ==。",
  ["errors.New for fixed messages; name them ErrSomething at package level."] = "固定消息用 errors.New；在包级别命名为 ErrSomething。",
  ["errors.New makes one. %w wraps one. errors.Is and errors.As search the chain."] = "errors.New 创建一个。%w 包装一个。errors.Is 和 errors.As 搜索整条链。",
  ["eta.cache_info() shows hits and misses; eta.cache_clear() empties it. Arguments must be hashable. Round six to Bo."] = "eta.cache_info() 显示命中和未命中；eta.cache_clear() 清空它。参数必须可哈希。第六回合归 Bo。",
  ["except KeyError as e: e is the exception; str(e) is its message, e.args the details. The name dies after the block."] = "except KeyError as e: e 是异常；str(e) 是它的消息，e.args 是细节。这个名字出了代码块就消失。",
  ["except ValueError: catches only that. A bare except: swallows everything, even Ctrl-C. Name the type."] = "except ValueError: 只捕获这一种。光秃秃的 except: 会吞掉一切，连 Ctrl-C 都吞。写上类型。",
  ["expect(msg) panics with msg on Err. Use it for real bugs, not for user input. The till is back; Siu Ming exhales."] = "expect(msg) 遇到 Err 就带着 msg panic。用在真正的 bug 上，别用在用户输入上。收银机回来了；小明松了口气。",
  ['f = open("stock.csv", "w")\nf.write("egg,12\\n")\nf.___()      # flush and release; with does this for you\n'] = 'f = open("stock.csv", "w")\nf.write("egg,12\\n")\nf.___()      # 刷新并释放；with 会替你做\n',
  ['f"..." is an f-string: any expression inside {} is evaluated. {n:>4} pads, {price:.2f} rounds.'] = 'f"..." 是 f-string：{} 里的任何表达式都会被求值。{n:>4} 补位，{price:.2f} 四舍五入。',
  ['f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n'] = 'f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n',
  ["f.close() flushes the buffer. Until then the last lines may not be on disk. The safe locks properly tonight."] = "f.close() 刷新缓冲区。在那之前最后几行可能还没写到磁盘上。今晚保险柜锁好了。",
  ["fetch, underscore, then the arithmetic you want."] = "fetch，下划线，然后是你想做的运算。",
  ["fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst) adds and returns the old value atomically. SeqCst is the strictest, simplest ordering."] = "fetch_add(1, Ordering::SeqCst) 原子地加并返回旧值。SeqCst 是最严格、最简单的内存序。",
  ["fib calls itself twice per call, no cache. Cost, in Big O?"] = "fib 每次调用再调用自己两次，没有 cache。用 Big O 说代价多少？",
  ["fib calls itself twice per call, no memo. Cost, in Big O?"] = "fib 每次调用再调用自己两次，没有 memo。用 Big O 说代价多少？",
  ["fib(40) naively is a billion calls. Look the answer up first. Which HashMap method?"] = "朴素写法的 fib(40) 有十亿次调用。先去查表。哪个 HashMap 方法？",
  ["fib(40) naively is a billion calls. One decorator remembers every result. Which one, from functools?"] = "朴素的 fib(40) 要十亿次调用。一个装饰器记住每个结果。functools 里的哪一个？",
  ["fib(n) = fib(n-1) + the one before that. The base case n < 2 guarantees this never underflows."] = "fib(n) = fib(n-1) 加上再前面那个。base case n < 2 保证这里永远不会下溢。",
  ["fib(n) is the sum of the two before it. Fill the second call: fib(n - 1) + fib(___)"] = "fib(n) 是前两项之和。填第二个调用：fib(n - 1) + fib(___)",
  ["fib(n-1) + fib(n-2): two calls, so 2^n without a memo. With one, each n is computed once. Round one to Chef Bo."] = "fib(n-1) + fib(n-2)：两次调用，所以没有 memo 就是 2^n。有了 memo 每个 n 只算一次。第一回合归 Bo 厨师。",
  ["filter keeps items where the closure is true. It is lazy until collect pulls."] = "filter 保留闭包返回 true 的元素。在 collect 拉动之前它是惰性的。",
  ["filter, map, collect: the chain is lazy until collect. Collecting once lets us iterate twice, forwards and rev."] = "filter、map、collect：整条链在 collect 之前都是惰性的。收集一次，就能正反各遍历一遍。",
  ["finally: runs after try and except, even on return or a fresh exception. else: runs only when nothing was raised."] = "finally: 在 try 和 except 之后运行，即使 return 或者又抛出新异常。else: 只在没有抛出异常时运行。",
  ["first() gives an Option. Return None early if the order is empty. Which operator?"] = "first() 给出 Option。订单为空就提前返回 None。哪个运算符？",
