  ['int("12") is 12. int("12.5") raises ValueError; float first if the text has a dot.'] = 'int("12") 是 12。int("12.5") 抛出 ValueError；文本带小数点就先 float。',
  ["int('abc') fails. Which keyword catches that error type?"] = "int('abc') 失败。哪个关键字捕获这个错误类型？",
  ["interface { Pay(int) error }. The till does not care if it is Octopus or cash."] = "interface { Pay(int) error }。收银机不在乎是八达通还是现金。",
