  ["is compares identity. Two riders in a loop must meet; on a straight route fast falls off the end. Round four to Bo."] = "is 比较同一性。环里的两个骑手必然相遇；直路上 fast 会从末尾掉出去。第四回合归 Bo。",
  ["is_some_and(|e| e < 10) beats map(..).unwrap_or(false). Review clean at 17:59. SHIPPED."] = "is_some_and(|e| e < 10) 胜过 map(..).unwrap_or(false)。17:59 审查全过。已上线。",
  ['it = iter([1])\nnext(it)      # 1\ntry:\n    next(it)\nexcept ___:\n    print("belt empty")\n'] = 'it = iter([1])\nnext(it)      # 1\ntry:\n    next(it)\nexcept ___:\n    print("belt empty")\n',
  ["items.last() is items.get(len - 1). O(1), and no panic on an empty Vec. push at the end is O(1) amortized."] = "items.last() 就是 items.get(len - 1)。O(1)，空 Vec 也不会 panic。末尾的 push 摊还是 O(1)。",
  ["items[-1]. Python adds len for you. Constant time, like append at the end (amortized) and pop()."] = "items[-1]。Python 替你加上 len。常数时间，就像末尾的 append（摊还）和 pop()。",
  ["items[len(items)-1]. Python spells it items[-1]. Both constant time. So is append at the end, amortized."] = "items[len(items)-1]。Python 写成 items[-1]。两者都是常数时间。末尾的 append 摊还之后也是。",
  ["iter() borrows, into_iter() consumes. map, filter, collect, sum, fold: no index bugs."] = "iter() 借用，into_iter() 消耗。map、filter、collect、sum、fold：没有下标 bug。",
  ["iter() yields &T. into_iter() yields T and eats the Vec. Dish zero prints again."] = "iter() 产出 &T。into_iter() 产出 T 并吃掉 Vec。第零道菜又能打出来了。",
  ["iter().sum() needs the result type written down. map, filter, count and collect live on the same chain."] = "iter().sum() 需要写出结果类型。map、filter、count 和 collect 都在同一条链上。",
  ["iter(x) calls x.__iter__(); next(it) calls __next__. That pair is the whole iterator protocol."] = "iter(x) 调用 x.__iter__()；next(it) 调用 __next__。这一对就是整个迭代器协议。",
  ["iter.Seq[T] is func(yield func(T) bool). for x := range Items() just works."] = "iter.Seq[T] 就是 func(yield func(T) bool)。for x := range Items() 直接就能用。",
  ["j moves left as i moves right. Stop when they meet."] = "i 右移时 j 左移。相遇即停。",
