  ["let bill = vec![18, 0, 42, 0, 25];\n// into_iter gives i32; the closure sees &i32\nlet ok: Vec<_> = bill.into_iter().___(|p| *p > 0).collect();\nassert_eq!(ok, vec![18, 42, 25]);\n"] = "let bill = vec![18, 0, 42, 0, 25];\n// into_iter 给出 i32；闭包看到的是 &i32\nlet ok: Vec<_> = bill.into_iter().___(|p| *p > 0).collect();\nassert_eq!(ok, vec![18, 42, 25]);\n",
  ["let binds. mut allows change. const needs a type. as converts. A new let can shadow an old name."] = "let 绑定。mut 允许修改。const 必须写类型。as 做转换。新的 let 可以遮蔽旧名字。",
