  ["queue.Queue is thread-safe: put adds a job, get takes one, task_done marks it finished, join waits until every job is done."] = "queue.Queue 是线程安全的：put 加一个任务，get 取一个，task_done 标记完成，join 等到每个任务都完成。",
  ["queue.Queue locks every operation. Queue(maxsize=3) blocks put when full: a buffered channel."] = "queue.Queue 给每个操作上锁。Queue(maxsize=3) 满了时 put 会阻塞：一个带缓冲的 channel。",
