  ["vec![18, 22, 25] is the literal form. Vec::new() makes an empty one. Index with [0] like Go."] = "vec![18, 22, 25] 是字面量形式。Vec::new() 建一个空的。像 Go 一样用 [0] 索引。",
  ['visited := map[string]___{}\nqueue := []string{"Causeway Bay"}\nvisited["Causeway Bay"] = true\n'] = 'visited := map[string]___{}\nqueue := []string{"Causeway Bay"}\nvisited["Causeway Bay"] = true\n',
  ["wg.Add(1)\ngo func() {\n    defer wg.___()\n    cook(o)\n}()\nwg.Wait()\n"] = "wg.Add(1)\ngo func() {\n    defer wg.___()\n    cook(o)\n}()\nwg.Wait()\n",
  ["wg.Add(1) per worker, or wg.Add(3) once. Pass &wg: a WaitGroup must not be copied."] = "每个 worker wg.Add(1)，或一次 wg.Add(3)。传 &wg：WaitGroup 不能被复制。",
  ["where T: Display, reads the same as <T: Display> but stays legible with many bounds."] = "where T: Display, 和 <T: Display> 意思一样，但约束多了依然好读。",
  ["while True:\n    item = q.___()\n    if item is None:\n        break\n    save(item)\n"] = "while True:\n    item = q.___()\n    if item is None:\n        break\n    save(item)\n",
  ["while True:\n    item = q.get()\n    save(item)\n    q.___()\n# parent: q.join() returns at zero\n"] = "while True:\n    item = q.get()\n    save(item)\n    q.___()\n# 父进程：q.join() 归零时返回\n",
  ["while left > 0 { } Prints 2 then 0. continue jumps to the next check, break leaves."] = "while left > 0 { } 打印 2 然后 0。continue 跳到下一次检查，break 离开。",
  ['while queue: runs while the list is truthy, i.e. not empty. An empty list, 0, None and "" are all False.'] = 'while queue: 在列表为真、也就是非空时运行。空列表、0、None 和 "" 都是 False。',
  ["who returns a borrow of self. Write the return type with no lifetime at all."] = "who 返回对 self 的借用。写出完全不带生命周期的返回类型。",
  ['with ProcessPoolExecutor(8) as ex:\n    fut = ex.___(total, rows)\n    log("still free to work")\n'] = 'with ProcessPoolExecutor(8) as ex:\n    fut = ex.___(total, rows)\n    log("still free to work")\n',
  ["with calls __enter__ on the way in and __exit__ on the way out, exception or not. Go's defer, scoped to a block."] = "with 进去时调用 __enter__，出来时调用 __exit__，有没有异常都一样。Go 的 defer，作用域是一个代码块。",
  ["with lock: is acquire and release, even on error. served += 1 is not atomic, GIL or no GIL."] = "with lock: 就是 acquire 加 release，出错也会释放。served += 1 不是原子的，有没有 GIL 都一样。",
  ["with lock: is the same thing with the finally written for you, which is why nobody writes acquire by hand any more."] = "with lock: 就是同一件事，只是 finally 已经替你写好了，所以现在没人再手写 acquire 了。",
  ["with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    for size in pool.___(resize, photos):\n        log(size)\n"] = "with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    for size in pool.___(resize, photos):\n        log(size)\n",
  ["with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    r = pool.apply_async(total, (rows,))\n    do_other_work()\n    print(r.___(timeout=60))\n"] = "with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    r = pool.apply_async(total, (rows,))\n    do_other_work()\n    print(r.___(timeout=60))\n",
  ["with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    sizes = pool.___(resize, photos)\n# sizes[0] belongs to photos[0]\n"] = "with mp.Pool(8) as pool:\n    sizes = pool.___(resize, photos)\n# sizes[0] 对应 photos[0]\n",
  ["with mp.___() as m:\n    totals = m.dict()\n    pool.map(add_to, [(totals, r) for r in rows])\n    print(dict(totals))\n"] = "with mp.___() as m:\n    totals = m.dict()\n    pool.map(add_to, [(totals, r) for r in rows])\n    print(dict(totals))\n",
  ['with open("stock.csv") ___ f:\n    data = f.read()\n'] = 'with open("stock.csv") ___ f:\n    data = f.read()\n',
  ["with opens a resource and guarantees it is closed, even on error. __enter__ and __exit__ make a class a context manager; @contextmanager makes one from a generator."] = "with 打开一个资源并保证它被关闭，出错也是。__enter__ 和 __exit__ 让一个类成为上下文管理器；@contextmanager 用生成器造一个。",
  ["words = [\"noodles\", \"tea\", \"toast\"]\nwords.sort(key=___)\nprint(words)     # ['tea', 'toast', 'noodles']\n"] = "words = [\"noodles\", \"tea\", \"toast\"]\nwords.sort(key=___)\nprint(words)     # ['tea', 'toast', 'noodles']\n",
  ["wrapping, underscore, the operation. Its cousins are checked_sub (Option) and saturating_sub (stops at 0)."] = "wrapping，下划线，运算名。它的表亲是 checked_sub（Option）和 saturating_sub（停在 0）。",
  ["x := 1\ndefer fmt.Println(x)    // prints ___ at the end\nx = 2\n"] = "x := 1\ndefer fmt.Println(x)    // 最后打印 ___\nx = 2\n",
  ['x in list is O(n); x in set or dict is O(1). not in is the negative. Works on strings too: "eg" in "egg".'] = 'x in list 是 O(n)；x in set 或 dict 是 O(1)。not in 是否定。字符串也行："eg" in "egg"。',
  ["x in list walks every element; x in set hashes once. One keyword, two costs. Know which one you are paying."] = "x in list 遍历每个元素；x in set 哈希一次。一个关键字，两种代价。要知道自己付的是哪一种。",
  ["yield suspends the function; the loop resumes it. Nothing is built ahead: one bowl in memory at a time."] = "yield 挂起函数；循环再唤醒它。不会预先构建任何东西：内存里一次只有一碗。",
  ["yield turns a function into a generator: it hands out one value at a time and remembers where it was. next pulls one. iter, enumerate and zip are the everyday iterator tools."] = "yield 把函数变成生成器：一次交出一个值，并记住走到了哪里。next 拉出一个。iter、enumerate 和 zip 是日常的迭代器工具。",
  ["zip stops at the shorter list; zip(a, b, strict=True) raises on a mismatch (3.10). zip(*pairs) unzips."] = "zip 在较短的列表处停下；zip(a, b, strict=True) 在长度不一致时抛错（3.10）。zip(*pairs) 反过来解开。",
  ["zip(xs, xs[1:]) walks neighbouring pairs. Since 3.10 itertools.pairwise does the same. Round five to Bo."] = "zip(xs, xs[1:]) 走遍相邻的对。3.10 起 itertools.pairwise 做的是同一件事。第五回合归 Bo。",
  ['{} or dict(). {"tea": 12} with items. Keys must be hashable: strings, numbers, tuples, not lists.'] = '{} 或 dict()。有项目就写 {"tea": 12}。键必须可哈希：字符串、数字、元组，列表不行。',
  ["{} uses Display. {:?} uses Debug. {n} reads a variable by name. Three muffins, printed."] = "{} 用 Display。{:?} 用 Debug。{n} 按名字读取变量。三个松饼，打印出来了。",
  ["|x| x * 2 is a closure. It captures nothing here; map calls it for every &i32."] = "|x| x * 2 是一个闭包。这里它什么都不捕获；map 对每个 &i32 调用它一次。",
  ["~T means 'underlying type T'. | joins the choices. See constraints.Ordered."] = "~T 表示“底层类型为 T”。| 连接各个选项。参见 constraints.Ordered。",
}
